def add(n,focus,stages,src,example,units,related,place,history):
 rows=[]
 for row in units.strip().splitlines():
  f=[x.strip().split('~',1) for x in row.split('|')]
  assert len(f)==4 and all(len(x)==2 for x in f),(n,row)
  rows.append(f)
 assert len(rows)==16,(n,len(rows))
 D[f'a{n}']={'focus':focus.split('~'),'stages':[x.split('~') for x in stages.split('|')],'src':src.split(),'example':example.split('~'),'units':rows,'related':related,'place':place,'history':history.split('~')}

add(368,'弱點風險、相依圖與修補放行~Vulnerability risk, dependency graphs and patch acceptance','資產與風險~Assets and risk|修補與相依~Patches and dependencies|測試與部署~Testing and deployment|驗證與復原~Verification and recovery','patch patchcase',
'假想 200 個受影響資產中完成 170 個，覆蓋率為 85%；若另有 10 個盤點遺漏資產，真正分母為 210，覆蓋率降至 80.95%。覆蓋不是風險消除率，例子不使用實際弱點或目標。~In a synthetic inventory, 170 of 200 affected assets gives 85% coverage. Ten missing assets change the denominator to 210 and coverage to 80.95%. Coverage is not risk-elimination probability; no real vulnerability or target is used.', '''
資產識別~Asset identity|同一主機的版本、角色與責任人須以穩定識別串連。~Stable identifiers connect version, role and accountable owner.|以合成清單找出重複名稱與缺漏責任人。~Find duplicate names and missing owners in a synthetic inventory.|主機名稱相同便必然是同一資產。~Equal hostnames necessarily mean equal assets.
軟體物料~Software inventory|應用程式版本不能代表所有內含函式庫版本。~Application versions do not identify every bundled dependency.|比較直接與傳遞相依的版本圖。~Compare direct and transitive dependency versions.|只盤點最上層應用程式即可。~Inventorying only the top application is sufficient.
暴露面~Exposure surface|可達性與許可權前提會改變同一弱點的情境風險。~Reachability and privilege prerequisites change contextual risk.|在本地假想網路圖分開外部、內部及離線資產。~Separate external, internal and offline assets on a local diagram.|分數相同的弱點都有相同營運風險。~Equal scores imply equal operational risk.
優先序~Prioritization|利用證據、重要性與可補償控制共同決定順序。~Evidence, criticality and compensating controls jointly inform priority.|用匿名情境比較同分不同暴露面的排序。~Rank anonymous equal-score cases with different exposure.|所有低分專案可永久略過。~All low-score items can be ignored permanently.
供應來源~Update provenance|更新檔的完整性與供應者身分是不同檢查。~Update integrity and publisher identity are distinct checks.|對自製測試包核對雜湊與簽章信任根。~Check hashes and signature trust roots on a self-made package.|雜湊吻合便證明供應者可信。~A matching hash proves the publisher is trusted.
版本相依~Version dependencies|修補一個元件可能使相依介面不相容。~Patching one component may break dependent interfaces.|將假想 API 版本變更傳播到相依圖。~Propagate a synthetic API change through dependencies.|安全更新不可能改變功能介面。~Security updates cannot change interfaces.
變更視窗~Change windows|可用性與風險會共同約束部署時間。~Availability and risk jointly constrain deployment timing.|比較有備援與單節點的停機預算。~Compare downtime budgets with and without redundancy.|最短部署時間必然最安全。~The shortest deployment is necessarily safest.
回退資產~Rollback assets|回退需儲存資料格式、設定及舊版依賴。~Rollback needs data-format, configuration and dependency compatibility.|模擬新版資料無法被舊版讀取的回退。~Simulate new data unreadable by an old version.|保留舊執行檔就保證可回退。~Keeping an old executable guarantees rollback.
測試矩陣~Test matrix|安全、功能與負載回歸應各有可觀測條件。~Security, functional and load regression need separate criteria.|在玩具服務列出三類測試與預期輸出。~List three test classes and expected outputs for a toy service.|能啟動便等於回歸測試透過。~Starting successfully equals passing regression.
金絲雀部署~Canary rollout|少量先行部署降低影響範圍但不代表所有負載。~A small canary limits impact but may not represent all workloads.|比較合成金絲雀與全量流量分佈。~Compare synthetic canary and full traffic distributions.|金絲雀無錯便可略過後續監測。~An error-free canary removes further monitoring needs.
健康閘門~Health gates|部署閘門需含錯誤率、延遲及資料一致性。~Rollout gates include errors, latency and data consistency.|故意提供低錯誤率但高尾延遲的假想報告。~Inspect a report with low errors but high tail latency.|只監測平均延遲即可放行。~Mean latency alone is enough for acceptance.
分批節奏~Batch pacing|同時失去多個故障域可能耗盡備援。~Concurrent changes across fault domains can exhaust redundancy.|在三域圖中計算每批剩餘副本數。~Count surviving replicas per batch across three domains.|每批數量相同便有相同故障風險。~Equal batch sizes imply equal failure risk.
修補證據~Patch evidence|更新成功日誌還需與執行版本交叉核對。~Update-success logs require running-version cross-checks.|比較假想安裝紀錄與重新啟動後版本。~Compare installation records and post-restart versions.|安裝成功訊息等於執行中已修補。~Installation success means the running process is patched.
例外到期~Exception expiry|暫時例外需責任人、到期日與補償措施。~Temporary exceptions need owners, expiry and compensating controls.|模擬到期例外重新進入修補佇列。~Return expired synthetic exceptions to the queue.|核准一次的例外永不需重新審查。~One approval makes an exception permanent.
覆蓋分母~Coverage denominators|盤點遺漏會使修補率看似過高。~Missing assets can inflate measured patch coverage.|以本課算例重算納入遺漏後的覆蓋率。~Recalculate coverage after adding missing assets.|未知資產不應計入任何風險討論。~Unknown assets need no risk consideration.
復原回顧~Recovery review|故障原因、版本與驗收證據應可重建。~Causes, versions and acceptance evidence must be reconstructable.|用離線時間線重現失敗批次與回退決策。~Reconstruct a failed batch and rollback decision offline.|復原成功表示不需保留失敗資料。~Successful recovery removes the need to retain failure evidence.
''',[(369,'修補與應變都需資產與證據鏈~Both patching and response need assets and evidence chains','修補為預防性變更，應變處理已發生事件~Patching is preventive change; response handles observed incidents'),(399,'兩者都需版本與相依的審查~Both need version and dependency review','核心協作流程還處理長期程式維護~Kernel collaboration also manages long-term code maintenance')],'nist','NIST 修補指南將維護與組織風險連結；本課以合成清單重建判斷流程。~NIST patch guidance connects maintenance to organizational risk; this course reconstructs decisions with synthetic inventories.')

add(369,'偵測、遏止與業務復原的協調~Coordination of detection, containment and business recovery','準備與演練~Preparation and exercises|辨識與判斷~Identification and decisions|遏止與復原~Containment and recovery|學習與驗收~Learning and acceptance','ir forensic',
'假想 12 起演練事件的偵測總時間 180 分鐘，平均 MTTD=15 分鐘；若一事件耗 90 分鐘，剩餘 11 起平均僅 8.18 分鐘。平均不能替代最慢事件與分位數，也不是服務保證。~Twelve synthetic incidents detected over 180 minutes give mean MTTD=15 minutes. If one takes 90 minutes, the other eleven average 8.18 minutes. Report tails as well as means; these are not service guarantees.', '''
授權範圍~Exercise authority|演練的系統、資料與處置許可權應事先確定。~Systems, data and response authority are defined before exercises.|以玩具環境寫出允許和禁止的處置。~Specify allowed and prohibited actions in a toy environment.|所有測試帳號都有正式系統處置權。~All test accounts have production-response authority.
角色交接~Role handoff|指揮、分析與業務決策需有交接介面。~Command, analysis and business decisions need handoff interfaces.|畫出合成事件的責任分工與批准路徑。~Map responsibility and approvals for a synthetic incident.|技術分析人員可自行代表所有業務決策。~Analysts automatically own all business decisions.
事件模型~Incident model|訊號、事件與已確認事件不能混為一談。~Signals, events and confirmed incidents are distinct.|分類本地產生的正常與異常日誌。~Classify locally generated normal and abnormal logs.|每個告警都是已確認入侵。~Every alert is a confirmed intrusion.
演練注入~Exercise injects|注入情境需分開預期行為與不可預知分支。~Injects distinguish expected behavior and uncertain branches.|設計假想服務中斷而不執行真實攻擊。~Design fictional service disruption without attacking systems.|演練指令碼完全成功便代表所有事件可處理。~A successful script proves all incidents are manageable.
時間基準~Time references|不同日誌時鐘誤差會改變事件排序。~Clock errors across logs can change event ordering.|加入已知偏差後重建帶誤差範圍的時間線。~Reconstruct a timeline after adding known clock offsets.|排序文字時間戳就保證因果順序。~Sorting textual timestamps guarantees causality.
證據可信~Evidence confidence|來源、完整性與觀測缺口共同影響結論。~Provenance, integrity and blind spots affect conclusions.|給每項合成觀測標示可信度與缺口。~Label confidence and gaps for synthetic observations.|兩條重複日誌便是兩個獨立證據。~Duplicate logs are independent evidence.
事件分級~Incident severity|分級需同時考慮影響與確定度。~Severity accounts for impact and confidence.|比較高影響低確定度與低影響高確定度。~Compare high-impact uncertain and low-impact certain cases.|只有確定度最高事件值得處置。~Only the most certain incident merits action.
競爭解釋~Competing hypotheses|異常可能來自故障、變更或濫用。~Anomalies may result from failures, changes or misuse.|為玩具登入尖峰提出兩個非攻擊解釋。~Propose two nonattack explanations for a toy login spike.|異常行為只有惡意活動一種原因。~Malicious activity is the only cause of anomalies.
遏止代價~Containment cost|隔離能限制擴散但可能中斷關鍵依賴。~Isolation limits propagation but may break critical dependencies.|在離線相依圖預測隔離對業務的影響。~Predict isolation impact on an offline dependency graph.|隔離越多裝置業務損失必然越小。~More isolation necessarily reduces business loss.
證據與復原~Evidence and recovery|急速復原可能改寫尚未儲存的證據。~Rapid recovery can overwrite unpreserved evidence.|比較先取樣與先重啟的資料保留情境。~Compare sampling-first and restart-first evidence retention.|重新啟動不可能影響可用證據。~Restarting cannot affect available evidence.
復原順序~Recovery ordering|相依服務需依健康與信任條件依序復原。~Dependencies restore according to health and trust conditions.|用玩具服務圖排序身分、資料與應用層。~Order identity, data and applications on a toy graph.|所有節點同時恢復必然最快且安全。~Restoring all nodes together is always fastest and safest.
復原驗證~Recovery validation|能回應請求不能證明資料正確及風險解除。~Serving requests does not prove correct data or removed risk.|比較功能、資料與安全三類離線驗收。~Compare functional, data and security acceptance offline.|HTTP 成功狀態即可結案。~An HTTP success status closes the incident.
通知紀錄~Communication records|通知應依已確認事實、時點與責任角色。~Communication follows confirmed facts, timing and accountable roles.|撰寫匿名演練摘要並標示未證實項。~Write an anonymous exercise brief with unconfirmed items marked.|未確認推測可直接當作正式事件結論。~Unconfirmed speculation can be a formal conclusion.
偵測指標~Detection metrics|平均偵測時間可能隱藏長尾事件。~Mean detection time can hide long-tail incidents.|以本課算例另列最慢值及事件數。~Report the slowest value and sample size alongside the example.|平均改善便代表每個事件都改善。~An improved average means every incident improved.
復盤因果~Review causality|復盤需分開時間相關與可驗證原因。~Reviews separate temporal association from verified causes.|在合成時間線標示哪些因果仍需驗證。~Mark causal claims still needing evidence on a synthetic timeline.|故障後最後一個變更必然是原因。~The last preceding change is necessarily the cause.
修正追蹤~Corrective-action tracking|改善事項需負責人、到期與重演證據。~Actions need owners, deadlines and re-exercise evidence.|將一項流程缺口轉成可觀察的再次演練。~Turn a process gap into an observable repeat exercise.|寫下改善建議便等於風險已降低。~Writing a recommendation means risk is reduced.
''',[(368,'共同使用資產盤點與版本證據~Both use asset inventories and version evidence','應變需在不完整資訊下決策~Response must decide with incomplete information'),(370,'事件分析仰賴證據保全~Response analysis relies on preserved evidence','證據保全重視不可改寫而非快速恢復服務~Preservation prioritizes nonalteration rather than rapid service restoration')],'nist','SP 800-61r3 將應變整合到 CSF 2.0 的風險管理；課程演練不接觸真實受害系統。~SP 800-61r3 integrates response with CSF 2.0 risk management; exercises do not access real victim systems.')

add(370,'可追溯、完整且可重現的數位證據~Traceable, intact and reproducible digital evidence','授權與識別~Authority and identification|採集與保全~Collection and preservation|分析與交查~Analysis and cross-checking|報告與重現~Reporting and reproduction','forensic evidence',
'一份假想 64 GiB 映像以 250 MiB/s 讀取，理想單次時間為 64×1024/250=262.14 秒；若採集後再完整驗證讀取一次，最低讀取時間約 524.29 秒。未含 I/O 競爭、寫入與工具開銷。~A synthetic 64 GiB image read at 250 MiB/s takes 262.14 seconds ideally. One further full verification read brings minimum reading time to 524.29 seconds, excluding contention, writes and tool overhead.', '''
合法與任務範圍~Authority and scope|證據接觸需限定資料、目的與處理授權。~Evidence access is bounded by data, purpose and authority.|用自建測試檔描述可分析與不可分析區域。~Define analyzable areas on self-created test files.|擁有技術能力就代表取得資料的授權。~Technical ability implies authority to obtain data.
證據識別~Evidence identification|唯一識別連結媒體、映像、版本與交接紀錄。~Unique IDs connect media, images, versions and custody records.|對兩個相似測試檔建立不同證物識別。~Assign separate evidence IDs to similar test files.|檔名相同即可合併證物。~Equal filenames justify merging evidence.
揮發性排序~Volatility ordering|記憶體與暫存狀態可能先於磁碟消失。~Memory and transient state can disappear before disk evidence.|在假想系統中排序易失與持久資料。~Rank volatile and durable data in a fictional system.|所有資料在關機後仍完整可讀。~All data remains intact after shutdown.
採集變更~Collection alteration|採集工具自身可能造成可觀察系統變更。~Collection tools may themselves change observed state.|列出玩具工具可能產生的日誌與時間戳。~List logs and timestamps a toy collector may change.|讀取工具永不改變任何系統狀態。~Read tools never change system state.
唯讀路徑~Read-only paths|寫入阻斷需涵蓋整個採集路徑而非單一設定。~Write blocking covers the entire collection path.|只在本地副本上比較唯讀設定與寫入行為。~Compare read-only settings and writes on local copies only.|唯讀標籤就是完整寫入阻斷證據。~A read-only label proves complete write blocking.
位元映像~Bitstream images|映像範圍與讀取錯誤決定哪些位元被保留。~Image scope and read errors determine preserved bits.|在自製小映像記錄缺損區段與錯誤。~Record missing ranges and errors in a self-made image.|成功產生映像檔代表每個位元都成功採集。~Producing an image proves every bit was collected.
雜湊完整性~Hash integrity|密碼雜湊可偵測位元變更但不證明內容真實。~Cryptographic hashes detect changes, not content truth.|修改自製副本一個位元並比較摘要。~Change one bit in a self-made copy and compare digests.|雜湊吻合便證明事件敘述真實。~Matching hashes prove the event narrative true.
交接紀錄~Custody records|每次接觸需紀錄人、時點、動作與版本。~Each access records actor, time, action and version.|模擬兩次交接並找出無法追溯的空白。~Simulate two handoffs and identify untraceable gaps.|只有最初取得者需要被記錄。~Only the initial collector needs recording.
時間戳語意~Timestamp semantics|建立、修改、存取時間與時區具有不同語意。~Creation, modification, access and timezone have different meanings.|比較同一測試檔跨時區顯示和原始值。~Compare timezone display with raw values for one test file.|不同顯示時間必然代表檔案被改寫。~Different displayed times prove alteration.
檔案與磁區~Files and sectors|檔案系統配置與未配置區不能混為一談。~Allocated files and unallocated regions differ.|在自製映像對照目錄項與位元範圍。~Compare directory entries with byte ranges in a self-made image.|未配置區一定沒有與事件相關資料。~Unallocated regions never contain relevant data.
解析器驗證~Parser validation|解析結果依格式、版本與錯誤處理而異。~Parsing depends on format, version and error handling.|對已知內容的合成檔比較兩個解析路徑。~Compare two parsers on known synthetic content.|兩工具輸出一致即可排除共同解析錯誤。~Matching tools exclude shared parsing errors.
獨立交查~Independent corroboration|獨立來源能區分工具錯誤和真實事件。~Independent sources separate tool error from events.|對合成登入紀錄與自製應用紀錄交查。~Cross-check synthetic login and application records.|複製同一份日誌便增加獨立證據。~Copying one log creates independent evidence.
採集吞吐~Collection throughput|讀寫瓶頸與驗證次數共同決定耗時。~Read/write bottlenecks and verification passes set duration.|重算本課映像採集與驗證下限。~Recalculate collection and verification time bounds.|標稱磁碟頻寬就是端到端採集速度。~Rated disk bandwidth equals end-to-end collection speed.
假設邊界~Inference boundaries|看不到紀錄不等於行為未發生。~Missing records do not prove an action never occurred.|為合成日誌缺口列出保留、遺失與未產生解釋。~List retention, loss and noncreation explanations for gaps.|沒有日誌即可證明沒有事件。~No log proves no event.
報告重現~Report reproduction|報告需列工具版本、輸入摘要與分析假設。~Reports specify tool versions, input digests and assumptions.|讓另一位同學只依匿名報告重算結果。~Have a peer reproduce findings from an anonymous report.|只有截圖即可完整重現分析。~Screenshots alone fully reproduce analysis.
儲存與刪除~Retention and deletion|儲存期限、存取與合規要求需獨立管理。~Retention, access and compliance requirements are managed separately.|在假想流程列出儲存、到期及例外批准。~Specify retention, expiry and exceptions in a fictional workflow.|證據越多儲存越久永遠越好。~Keeping more evidence forever is always better.
''',[(369,'兩者都建立帶可信度的時間線~Both construct confidence-aware timelines','鑑識不將急速恢復當成唯一目標~Forensics does not make rapid restoration its sole aim'),(380,'兩者都需不可混淆的資料版本~Both need unambiguous data versions','證據交接重視保全，ML 版本還需訓練重現~Custody emphasizes preservation; ML versioning also needs training reproduction')],'nist','NIST 鑑識資料分開採集、檢查、分析與報告；本課只使用自行製作的映像與日誌。~NIST forensics distinguishes collection, examination, analysis and reporting; this course uses self-created images and logs.')

add(371,'資料最小化與隱私效用權衡~Data minimization and privacy–utility trade-offs','資料與目的~Data and purpose|風險與模型~Risk and models|分析與保護~Analytics and protection|驗證與治理~Verification and governance','privacy dp',
'假想 100 人平均收入分析先將收入界定於 0–100,000 單位；固定樣本數替換鄰接下，平均敏感度 Δ=100000/100=1000 單位。Laplace ε=1 時尺度 b=1000、標準差 √2b=1414.21 單位。只此假設成立時適用。~For 100 synthetic people with values bounded to 0–100,000 units and fixed-size replace-one adjacency, mean sensitivity is 1,000 units. Laplace ε=1 gives b=1,000 and standard deviation 1,414.21 units; the assumptions are essential.', '''
用途邊界~Purpose boundaries|同一資料可因使用目的不同而形成不同隱私風險。~The same data creates different privacy risks under different purposes.|寫出合成資料分析的必要與非必要用途。~Specify necessary and unnecessary uses of synthetic data.|取得一次同意便能用於任何新目的。~One consent permits every future purpose.
資料最小化~Data minimization|少收欄位能降低暴露但可能降低可辨識性。~Fewer fields reduce exposure but can reduce identifiability of effects.|比較完整與最小化欄位的合成模型誤差。~Compare synthetic-model errors with full and minimal fields.|刪除姓名即完成最小化。~Deleting names completes minimization.
準識別欄位~Quasi-identifiers|時間、位置與屬性組合仍可能識別個人。~Time, location and attribute combinations may identify people.|對自行生成的群組計算唯一組合比例。~Measure unique combinations in self-generated groups.|沒有姓名的資料絕不可能識別個人。~Nameless data cannot identify people.
信任邊界~Trust boundaries|蒐集者、分析者與發布者可有不同許可權。~Collectors, analysts and publishers can have different privileges.|標示匿名架構每一層可見的欄位。~Mark fields visible at each layer of an anonymous architecture.|所有參與者都必須看原始資料。~Every participant must see raw data.
威脅模型~Threat models|保護方法依攻擊者先驗知識與可見輸出而異。~Protection depends on adversary knowledge and visible outputs.|在紙上設定兩種先驗而不使用真實個資。~Specify two priors on paper without real personal data.|保護強度完全與外部知識無關。~Protection is independent of outside knowledge.
連結風險~Linkage risk|外部資料連結會改變原資料的識別風險。~External linkage changes identifiability risk.|在兩組自製資料比較連結前後群組大小。~Compare group sizes before and after joining synthetic tables.|每一表單獨匿名便保證聯結後匿名。~Separately anonymous tables stay anonymous after joining.
聚合選擇~Aggregation choices|粗分群降低解析度但不自動給出正式隱私保證。~Coarse grouping reduces detail without automatically giving formal privacy.|比較不同分箱的偏差與最小群組數。~Compare bias and smallest groups under different binning.|群組有多人便等於差分隱私。~A multi-person group implies differential privacy.
存取控管~Access control|控管限制誰能讀，不限制合法輸出透露多少。~Access control limits readers, not information in permitted outputs.|分開畫存取風險與發布風險。~Draw separate access and release risks.|只有登入使用者就不需輸出隱私評估。~Logged-in users remove release-privacy needs.
統計敏感度~Statistical sensitivity|一人資料可使統計改變多少取決於界限與鄰接。~Single-person influence depends on bounds and adjacency.|重算有界平均的替換敏感度。~Recalculate bounded-mean replace-one sensitivity.|敏感度只取決於資料量，不依數值界限。~Sensitivity depends only on sample count.
噪聲與誤差~Noise and error|隨機保護會增加估計方差而非保證無偏於所有操作。~Randomized protection adds variance and does not guarantee every operation unbiased.|用合成抽樣比較發布前後誤差分佈。~Compare error distributions with synthetic sampling.|增加噪聲永遠不影響下游決策。~Adding noise never affects downstream decisions.
查詢組合~Query composition|多次發布會累積資訊洩漏預算。~Repeated releases accumulate information-disclosure budgets.|對假想查詢表追蹤累積 ε。~Track cumulative ε for a fictional query table.|每次單獨安全便表示無限次安全。~Individually safe queries are safe without limit.
小群組效用~Small-group utility|固定噪聲在小群組中有更大相對影響。~Fixed noise has larger relative effects on small groups.|比較同噪聲下 10 與 1000 人群組誤差。~Compare 10- and 1,000-person relative errors with equal noise.|相同噪聲代表所有群組同等準確。~Equal noise implies equal group accuracy.
偏差檢查~Bias checks|總體效用可能掩蓋少數群組的不良誤差。~Overall utility can hide poor minority-group errors.|以合成群組另列誤差與缺測率。~Report synthetic-group errors and missingness separately.|總體準確度高就代表群組公平。~High overall accuracy proves group fairness.
發布審查~Release review|模型、報告與中間檔都可能帶有隱私資訊。~Models, reports and intermediate files may expose private information.|盤點玩具分析留下的所有產物。~Inventory all artifacts from a toy analysis.|只審查最終表格就足夠。~Reviewing only the final table is sufficient.
再現與稽核~Reproduction and audit|可重現分析需保留設定而不必散佈原始個資。~Reproducibility needs settings without distributing personal data.|用合成替代資料重現指標計算。~Reproduce metric calculations using synthetic substitutes.|重現必須向所有人公開原始個資。~Reproduction requires sharing personal data with everyone.
效用決策~Utility decisions|隱私、誤差與服務目的需共同定義可接受範圍。~Privacy, error and purpose jointly define acceptable performance.|用本課算例寫出限用條件與未決風險。~State limits and unresolved risk for the example.|選最小 ε 就必然得到最佳產品。~The smallest ε necessarily yields the best product.
''',[(373,'兩者都區分隱私與效用~Both distinguish privacy from utility','查詢服務需正式鄰接與預算會計~Query services need formal adjacency and budget accounting'),(375,'共同限制原始資料暴露~Both limit raw-data exposure','MPC 保護計算過程但不自動保護輸出~MPC protects computation, not automatically its output')],'nist','隱私工程同時處理資料用途與量化保證；NIST 框架與 SP 800-226 支援兩個不同層次。~Privacy engineering addresses purpose and quantitative guarantees; the NIST framework and SP 800-226 support these different layers.')

add(372,'分散神經網路訓練、聚合與非同分佈資料~Distributed neural training, aggregation and non-IID data','參與者與資料~Participants and data|梯度與聚合~Gradients and aggregation|隱私與故障~Privacy and failures|評估與交付~Evaluation and delivery','flower secagg',
'假想三個客戶分別有 20、30、50 筆資料與標量更新 1、3、5；FedAvg 權重為 0.2、0.3、0.5，聚合更新為 3.6。等權平均為 3；權重差異反映樣本數而非品質保證，也未提供隱私保證。~Three synthetic clients have 20, 30 and 50 samples and scalar updates 1, 3 and 5. Sample-weighted FedAvg yields 3.6; equal weighting yields 3. Weights reflect sample counts, not guaranteed quality or privacy.', '''
聯邦邊界~Federation boundaries|資料留本地不表示梯度或模型不洩漏資訊。~Local data retention does not prevent update or model leakage.|畫原始資料、更新與全域模型的流向。~Trace raw data, updates and global-model flows.|不傳原始資料就自動有差分隱私。~Not sending raw data automatically gives differential privacy.
模型同構~Model compatibility|可聚合權重需有相同參數語意與次序。~Aggregated weights need aligned parameter meanings and ordering.|比對兩個玩具 MLP 的層形狀與名稱。~Compare layer shapes and names in two toy MLPs.|參數數量相同便代表模型相容。~Equal parameter counts imply compatibility.
MLP 前向~MLP forward pass|h=φ(Wx+b) 的非線性決定多層表達能力。~Nonlinearity in h=φ(Wx+b) enables multilayer expressiveness.|手算兩層小網路的前向值與飽和區。~Calculate a tiny two-layer network and saturation regions.|堆疊線性層必然增加非線性表達。~Stacking linear layers necessarily adds nonlinearity.
本地反傳~Local backpropagation|鏈式法則將本地損失梯度傳回每層參數。~The chain rule propagates local loss gradients to parameters.|以有限差分核對小網路的一個權重梯度。~Check one tiny-network gradient with finite differences.|梯度只由最後一層決定。~Only the last layer determines gradients.
樣本權重~Sample weights|FedAvg 樣本權重與客戶等權有不同目標。~Sample weighting and equal-client weighting target different objectives.|重算本課三客戶兩種聚合。~Recalculate both aggregation choices for three clients.|等權與樣本加權永遠相等。~Equal and sample-weighted aggregation always agree.
本地輪數~Local epochs|更多本地更新減少通訊但可能放大客戶漂移。~More local updates reduce communication but can amplify client drift.|在合成異分佈資料比較 1 與 5 輪。~Compare one and five epochs on synthetic non-IID data.|本地輪數越多全域模型必然越好。~More local epochs always improve the global model.
非同分佈~Non-IID data|標籤與特徵分佈差異會改變全域梯度方向。~Label and feature shifts change aggregate gradient direction.|對兩個合成客戶比較梯度夾角。~Compare gradient angles for two synthetic clients.|每個客戶低訓練損失就保證全域最佳。~Low local losses guarantee a global optimum.
客戶取樣~Client sampling|參與機率差異可能產生訓練代表性偏差。~Different participation probabilities can bias representation.|模擬慢速客戶經常缺席的類別涵蓋。~Simulate class coverage when slow clients are often absent.|只選最快客戶不影響資料代表性。~Choosing fastest clients preserves representation.
裁剪規則~Clipping rules|L2 裁剪限制單次更新範數而非移除所有異常。~L2 clipping bounds update norms without removing all anomalies.|手算超過閾值的向量縮放比例。~Calculate scaling for a vector above its threshold.|裁剪後每個座標都等於閾值。~Clipping makes every coordinate equal the threshold.
安全聚合~Secure aggregation|掩碼相消隱藏單客戶更新但會揭露允許的聚合。~Canceling masks hide individual updates while revealing allowed aggregates.|用三個玩具向量驗證掩碼相消。~Verify mask cancellation with three toy vectors.|安全聚合保證聚合輸出不洩漏任何資訊。~Secure aggregation makes outputs reveal no information.
掉線門檻~Dropout thresholds|重建門檻與參與者故障假設需相容。~Reconstruction thresholds must match dropout assumptions.|在紙上模擬一名與多名客戶掉線。~Simulate one and multiple client dropouts on paper.|安全聚合完全不受客戶掉線影響。~Secure aggregation is unaffected by client dropout.
差分隱私~Differential privacy|噪聲、裁剪、取樣與會計共同形成 DP 保證。~Noise, clipping, sampling and accounting jointly determine DP guarantees.|列出一個合成輪次所需的 DP 參數。~List DP parameters for one synthetic round.|只加任意噪聲便可宣佈正式 DP。~Any added noise justifies a formal DP claim.
模型驗證~Model validation|全域與每客戶測試需避免資料重疊。~Global and client tests must avoid overlapping training data.|建立合成客戶隔離與時間隔離測試。~Build client-isolated and time-isolated synthetic tests.|各客戶訓練集就是可靠的全域測試。~Client training sets are reliable global tests.
通訊成本~Communication cost|參數位寬、客戶數及輪數共同決定傳輸量。~Bit width, clients and rounds determine transfer volume.|計算玩具模型全輪下載與上傳位元數。~Calculate full-round upload and download bits.|只看模型檔案大小便得到總通訊成本。~Model-file size alone gives total communication cost.
收斂診斷~Convergence diagnosis|損失變化需對照客戶取樣與資料變化。~Loss changes must be checked against sampling and data changes.|對假想曲線註記客戶組成與更新版本。~Annotate hypothetical curves with clients and update versions.|損失升高只有學習率過高一個原因。~Higher loss can only mean an excessive learning rate.
交付版本~Delivery versions|發布模型需連結參與政策與隱私會計紀錄。~Released models link participation policies and privacy accounting.|產生無個資的玩具模型卡與設定摘要。~Create a personal-data-free toy model card and settings digest.|保留最終權重便足以稽核聯邦訓練。~Final weights suffice to audit federated training.
''',[(373,'裁剪與預算是共同隱私元件~Clipping and budgets are shared privacy components','聯邦訓練還面臨客戶異分佈與掉線~Federated training also faces non-IID clients and dropout'),(379,'共同分析神經網路權重與記憶體~Both analyze neural weights and memory','訓練反傳與生成推論有不同計算圖~Backpropagation and generation use different computation graphs')],'nist','Flower 公開範例把安全聚合與差分隱私分開組合；課程用三客戶模型呈現它們不同的保證。~Flower examples compose secure aggregation and differential privacy separately; a three-client model illustrates their distinct guarantees.')

add(373,'鄰接定義、敏感度與查詢預算~Adjacency, sensitivity and query budgets','隱私定義~Privacy definitions|機制與效用~Mechanisms and utility|組合與服務~Composition and service|驗證與發布~Verification and release','dp flower',
'教學計數的加減一鄰接敏感度為 1；ε=0.5 的 Laplace 尺度 b=2，標準差 √8=2.828。五次各 ε=0.5 查詢用基本序列組合得 ε_total≤2.5；共享固定發布的後處理不另消耗預算。~An add/remove-one count has sensitivity 1. At ε=0.5, Laplace b=2 and standard deviation is 2.828. Basic composition bounds five ε=0.5 releases by total ε≤2.5; post-processing one fixed release spends no additional budget.', '''
保護單位~Protected units|一筆紀錄與一位使用者可能不是同一鄰接單位。~A record and a person may be different adjacency units.|比較每人一筆與每人多筆的敏感度。~Compare sensitivity with one versus many records per person.|紀錄級 DP 自動等於使用者級 DP。~Record-level DP automatically equals user-level DP.
鄰接選擇~Adjacency choices|替換與加減一鄰接可能給出不同敏感度。~Replace-one and add/remove-one adjacency can differ in sensitivity.|以小資料表計算兩種鄰接下的差異。~Calculate both adjacency differences on a small table.|鄰接隻影響命名不影響證明。~Adjacency changes names but not proofs.
ε 語意~Meaning of epsilon|ε 約束相鄰資料輸出機率比而非個人曝光百分比。~Epsilon bounds neighboring output-probability ratios, not exposure percentages.|比較 exp(0.5) 與 exp(1) 的比率上界。~Compare exp(0.5) and exp(1) ratio bounds.|ε=0.1 就表示洩漏機率為 10%。~Epsilon 0.1 means a 10% leakage probability.
δ 語意~Meaning of delta|δ 是近似 DP 的加性容許項，不是平均誤差。~Delta is an additive approximate-DP allowance, not mean error.|在機率不等式分開標示 ε 與 δ。~Mark epsilon and delta separately in the probability inequality.|δ 可用資料標準差直接取代。~Data standard deviation can replace delta.
敏感度界限~Sensitivity bounds|剪裁或取值界限須在看到私密極值前固定。~Bounds are fixed before using private extremes.|比較預先有界與依資料最大值設定的方法。~Compare predetermined bounds with data-derived maxima.|直接取私密最大值定界永不消耗隱私。~Private maxima can define bounds without privacy cost.
Laplace 機制~Laplace mechanism|計數噪聲尺度等於 L1 敏感度除以 ε。~Count-noise scale is L1 sensitivity divided by epsilon.|重算本課尺度、標準差及不同 ε。~Recalculate scale and standard deviation for different epsilon.|把 ε 乘敏感度就是所需噪聲尺度。~Noise scale equals epsilon times sensitivity.
Gaussian 機制~Gaussian mechanism|Gaussian 噪聲校準需同時考慮 ε、δ 與敏感度。~Gaussian calibration needs epsilon, delta and sensitivity.|僅比較已列假設的校準方法與適用區間。~Compare calibrated methods only under stated assumptions.|Gaussian 機制完全不需 δ。~Gaussian mechanisms never need delta.
後處理~Post-processing|不再讀私密資料的後處理保留既有 DP 保證。~Post-processing without private access preserves existing DP.|對同一噪聲發布做四捨五入與圖表轉換。~Round and plot the same noisy release.|每次重畫同一發布都要再加 ε。~Every replot of the same release spends epsilon.
序列組合~Sequential composition|多個讀取同一私密資料的發布需累積預算。~Multiple private-data releases accumulate budgets.|重算五次查詢的基本 ε 上界。~Recalculate the basic bound for five queries.|每個發布各自 DP 就能無限制重複。~Individually DP releases may be repeated without limit.
平行組合~Parallel composition|不重疊保護單位的分割槽才可用平行組合。~Parallel composition requires disjoint protected units.|比較同人跨區與真正不同人的分割槽。~Compare cross-partition people with truly disjoint people.|表格分成兩檔便保證平行組合成立。~Splitting files guarantees parallel composition.
適應性查詢~Adaptive queries|後續查詢依前輸出選擇仍需會計。~Queries selected from earlier outputs still need accounting.|用合成問答樹追蹤每一路徑預算。~Track budgets along synthetic query-tree paths.|查詢由 AI 選擇就不用隱私會計。~AI-selected queries need no privacy accounting.
查詢快取~Query caching|重送相同已發布值與重新抽噪聲不同。~Returning a cached release differs from drawing fresh noise.|比較重送固定值與多次重新發布。~Compare cached values with repeated fresh releases.|相同 SQL 每次新噪聲都免費。~Fresh noise for identical SQL is free each time.
效用區間~Utility intervals|噪聲尾部可能主導小計數的相對誤差。~Noise tails may dominate relative error for small counts.|對同尺度計算小計數與大計數相對誤差。~Compare relative errors for small and large counts.|噪聲標準差固定代表相對誤差固定。~Fixed noise deviation means fixed relative error.
服務隔離~Service isolation|預算必須在多帳號、多程式間原子更新。~Budgets need atomic updates across accounts and processes.|模擬兩個同時查詢爭用最後預算。~Simulate concurrent queries racing for the final budget.|前端顯示剩餘預算即可防止超支。~A frontend budget display prevents overspending.
實作驗證~Implementation validation|隨機樣本測試不能單獨證明任意資料皆 DP。~Sampling tests alone cannot prove DP for every dataset.|區分證明、參數核查與隨機性檢查。~Separate proof, parameter checks and randomness checks.|兩組輸出直方圖相似即可證明 DP。~Similar histograms prove DP.
釋出紀錄~Release ledger|發布需儲存機制、參數、鄰接與版本。~Releases record mechanism, parameters, adjacency and version.|輸出不含私密種子的假想查詢會計表。~Create a fictional ledger without private random seeds.|公開噪聲種子不會影響隱私保護。~Publishing noise seeds cannot affect privacy.
''',[(371,'皆需說明隱私效用權衡~Both explain privacy–utility trade-offs','正式 DP 會計比一般資料治理更精確~Formal DP accounting is more specific than general governance'),(372,'訓練更新可用裁剪與噪聲~Training updates can use clipping and noise','查詢服務以發布為單位，聯邦以輪次及取樣會計~Query services account for releases; federation accounts for rounds and sampling')],'nist','NIST SP 800-226 強調應檢查承諾的隱私單位、參數與實作範圍；算例是作者獨立設定。~NIST SP 800-226 emphasizes checking protected units, parameters and implementation scope; numerical cases are independently chosen.')

add(374,'密文代數、噪聲預算與精度管理~Ciphertext algebra, noise budgets and precision','表示與安全~Representation and security|密文運算~Ciphertext computation|電路與成本~Circuits and cost|解密與驗證~Decryption and validation','seal he',
'玩具模環 Z₁₇ 的明文 8+12≡3 (mod17)，8×12≡11。若欲表達一般整數 20，模數 17 會迴繞；這只是明文算術，不是安全加密參數或密文安全實作。~In toy plaintext ring Z17, 8+12≡3 and 8×12≡11 modulo 17. Representing ordinary integer 20 would wrap. This illustrates plaintext arithmetic only, not secure encryption parameters or a secure ciphertext implementation.', '''
明密文邊界~Plain/cipher boundaries|同態運算保護處理中資料但允許解密結果可見。~Homomorphic computation protects processing while allowing result decryption.|畫資料持有者、運算者及結果接收者。~Draw data owner, evaluator and result recipient.|同態加密使所有輸出永不可讀。~Homomorphic encryption makes all outputs unreadable forever.
環表示~Ring representation|多項式商環決定係數運算與折返。~Polynomial quotient rings determine coefficient operations and reduction.|在玩具低階多項式手算乘積及折返。~Calculate toy polynomial products and reduction.|密文向量就是普通實數向量。~Ciphertext vectors are ordinary real vectors.
BFV 與 CKKS~BFV and CKKS|BFV 做模整數運算，CKKS 表達近似數值。~BFV computes modular integers; CKKS represents approximate values.|比較整數計數與浮點統計的方案需求。~Compare scheme needs for integer counts and floating statistics.|CKKS 保證任意實數完全精確。~CKKS guarantees exact arbitrary real numbers.
安全參數~Security parameters|多項式維度與密文模數需共同滿足安全估計。~Polynomial dimension and ciphertext modulus jointly affect security estimates.|讀正式參數列而不將玩具值當安全配置。~Read standard tables without treating toy values as secure.|較大密文模數一定提高安全性。~Larger ciphertext modulus always improves security.
加法路徑~Addition paths|同態加法需要相容的參數層級及編碼。~Homomorphic addition needs compatible levels and encoding.|比較同層與異層的假想操作條件。~Compare hypothetical same-level and different-level operations.|任何兩密文皆可直接相加。~Any two ciphertexts can be added directly.
乘法噪聲~Multiplication noise|乘法增加噪聲與密文表示成本。~Multiplication increases noise and representation costs.|用符號成本表比較加法與乘法電路。~Compare addition and multiplication circuits symbolically.|乘法和加法的噪聲成本相同。~Addition and multiplication have equal noise costs.
重線性化~Relinearization|重線性化縮減密文大小但不消除全部誤差。~Relinearization reduces ciphertext size without removing all error.|畫乘法前後項數及評価金鑰角色。~Draw term counts and evaluation-key roles around multiplication.|重線性化將密文直接解密。~Relinearization directly decrypts ciphertexts.
尺度管理~Scale management|CKKS 尺度與重縮放決定誤差和剩餘層級。~CKKS scales and rescaling affect error and remaining levels.|用假想尺度鏈比較連續乘法後層級。~Compare levels after successive toy scale operations.|重縮放不影響任何精度。~Rescaling cannot affect precision.
乘法深度~Multiplicative depth|電路深度不是乘法總次數。~Circuit depth differs from total multiplication count.|比較平衡樹與串聯連乘的深度。~Compare balanced-tree and serial-product depths.|相同乘法數必然有相同深度。~Equal multiplication counts imply equal depth.
多項式近似~Polynomial approximations|非多項式函式需定義逼近區間與誤差。~Nonpolynomial functions need approximation ranges and errors.|比較 toy sigmoid 近似在範圍內外的誤差。~Compare toy sigmoid approximation inside and outside its range.|逼近在一點準確便對所有輸入準確。~Accuracy at one point implies accuracy everywhere.
向量打包~Vector packing|SIMD 打包的槽位置決定運算資料對齊。~SIMD slot positions determine data alignment.|手排兩組短向量並對照逐槽結果。~Arrange short vectors and check per-slot results.|打包後所有槽自動互相求和。~Packing automatically sums all slots.
旋轉金鑰~Rotation keys|槽旋轉需評價金鑰且增加傳輸與儲存成本。~Slot rotations need evaluation keys and add storage costs.|列出向量求和所需旋轉距離。~List rotation distances required for a vector sum.|槽旋轉無需任何額外金鑰。~Slot rotations require no extra keys.
模數迴繞~Modular wraparound|模整數結果需和業務可表示範圍一致。~Modular results must match the application’s representation range.|重算本課 Z17 加乘與一般整數的差別。~Recalculate toy Z17 arithmetic versus ordinary integers.|模數運算得到的 3 就是整數和 20。~Modular result 3 equals ordinary integer sum 20.
結果誤差~Result errors|CKKS 誤差需區分近似、量化和累積運算。~CKKS errors distinguish approximation, quantization and arithmetic accumulation.|以合成輸入比較明文參考與近似結果。~Compare plaintext references and approximate outputs on synthetic inputs.|成功解密代表數值完全無誤。~Successful decryption proves zero numerical error.
成本量測~Cost measurement|編碼、加密、評価和解密應分別計時。~Encoding, encryption, evaluation and decryption are timed separately.|建立本地玩具流程的分段成本表。~Build segment costs for a local toy pipeline.|只報評價時間就是端到端延遲。~Evaluation time equals end-to-end latency.
輸出最小化~Output minimization|加密過程不阻止合法結果透露敏感統計。~Encrypted processing does not prevent sensitive result disclosure.|比較完整預測向量與聚合輸出的需求。~Compare full prediction vectors with aggregate-output needs.|使用 HE 後永遠不需輸出隱私控制。~HE eliminates output-privacy controls.
''',[(375,'共同將明文可見範圍分離~Both separate plaintext visibility boundaries','HE 用密文評価，MPC 用參與方協同協議~HE evaluates ciphertexts; MPC coordinates parties'),(373,'共同檢查輸出仍會透露資訊~Both inspect information still revealed by outputs','DP 量化釋出隱私，HE 保護計算過程~DP quantifies release privacy; HE protects computation')],'microsoft','SEAL 支援多種同態方案；本課從代數、深度到近似誤差逐層比較，不以玩具參數宣稱安全。~SEAL supports multiple homomorphic schemes; this course compares algebra, depth and approximation without claiming toy parameters secure.')

add(375,'秘密分享、協議威脅模型與通訊成本~Secret sharing, protocol threat models and communication','參與與威脅~Parties and threats|分享與運算~Sharing and computation|協議與故障~Protocols and failures|輸出與驗證~Outputs and validation','mpc mpcsrc',
'玩具模環 Z₁₇ 將秘密 s=9 分享為 4、7、15，因為 (4+7+15) mod17=9。每個分享若按正確隨機協議產生可隱藏原值；此固定例子不構成安全實作。加上公開值 3 後可只改一個分享為 7，和變為 12。~Toy shares 4,7,15 in Z17 sum to secret 9. Secure hiding requires a correct randomized protocol; these fixed numbers are not a secure implementation. Adding public 3 to one share changes the reconstructed sum to 12.', '''
參與方角色~Party roles|MPC 保證依不串通或容忍串通的假設而定。~MPC guarantees depend on noncollusion or tolerated collusion.|對三方玩具計算標示哪組被假設誠實。~Mark assumed-honest groups in a three-party toy computation.|參與方越多就不需威脅模型。~More parties remove the need for threat models.
誠實與惡意~Honest and malicious behavior|半誠實與惡意模型允許的偏離不同。~Semi-honest and malicious models allow different deviations.|列出遵守協議但分析記錄與偽造訊息差異。~Distinguish analyzing compliant transcripts from forged messages.|半誠實安全自動等於惡意安全。~Semi-honest security automatically implies malicious security.
分享代數~Sharing algebra|加法分享的總和在指定有限環重建秘密。~Additive shares reconstruct by summing in a specified finite ring.|重算本課三個分享及模數折返。~Recalculate the three shares and modular reduction.|直接做一般整數加法便是環重建。~Ordinary integer addition alone reconstructs ring secrets.
隨機性要求~Randomness requirements|分享隱私依賴足夠隨機且不重複的隨機量。~Share privacy needs adequate, unreused randomness.|僅以符號分析重用隨機量可能帶來的關聯。~Analyze reused-randomness correlations symbolically.|固定教學分享可直接用於保密生產資料。~Fixed teaching shares securely protect production data.
公開加法~Public addition|公開常數加到一個加法分享即可調整總秘密。~Adding a public constant to one additive share changes the secret.|比較只加一次與每個分享都加常數。~Compare adding once versus adding to every share.|每個分享都加 c 後總秘密只加 c。~Adding c to every share adds only c overall.
秘密加法~Secret addition|兩個秘密的對應分享可區域性相加。~Corresponding shares of two secrets can be added locally.|用玩具向量逐方相加並重建核對。~Add toy share vectors by party and verify reconstruction.|秘密加法必須先公開兩個明文。~Secret addition requires revealing both plaintexts.
秘密乘法~Secret multiplication|區域性分享相乘通常缺少跨分享交叉項。~Local share products generally miss cross-share terms.|展開兩個分享和的乘積找出交叉項。~Expand share-sum products and locate cross terms.|對應分享相乘就必然得到正確乘積分享。~Multiplying corresponding shares always yields correct product shares.
預處理材料~Preprocessing material|乘法三元組等材料必須與協議安全假設相容。~Multiplication triples must match protocol security assumptions.|以符號流程標示離線材料和線上使用。~Mark offline material and online consumption symbolically.|同一個三元組可以無限重用。~One multiplication triple can be reused indefinitely.
比較運算~Comparison circuits|秘密比較需不同於普通公開分支的協議。~Secret comparisons need protocols unlike public branches.|對玩具最大值畫不公開中間比較的電路。~Draw a toy maximum circuit without revealing intermediate comparisons.|秘密值可直接在公開 if 裡分支且不洩漏。~Public branching on a secret reveals nothing.
定點數值~Fixed-point numbers|定點縮放與截斷影響範圍及誤差。~Fixed-point scaling and truncation affect range and error.|以合成小數比較不同縮放因子的誤差。~Compare scaling-factor errors for synthetic decimals.|有限環可無需編碼直接存任意實數。~Finite rings directly store arbitrary reals without encoding.
通訊輪次~Communication rounds|網路延遲對多輪依賴協議的成本影響大。~Network latency strongly affects dependent multiround protocols.|比較 10 與 100 輪在假想 RTT 下的下限。~Compare latency bounds for 10 and 100 rounds under assumed RTT.|吞吐相同的網路對多輪協議完全等價。~Equal-throughput networks are equivalent for multiround protocols.
認證檢查~Authentication checks|惡意安全的完整性檢查與隱私是不同性質。~Malicious-security integrity checks differ from privacy.|在符號記錄區分分享機密與訊息認證。~Separate share confidentiality and message authentication symbolically.|資料被分享就自動能檢測所有篡改。~Sharing data automatically detects every alteration.
退出與終止~Dropout and abort|某些協議允許中止但不保證每方獲得輸出。~Some protocols permit abort without guaranteeing everyone an output.|用紙上狀態圖分析一方離開。~Analyze one party leaving with a paper state diagram.|安全協議必定提供公平與不中止。~Secure protocols always guarantee fairness and no abort.
輸出洩漏~Output disclosure|合法輸出的統計仍可能揭露輸入資訊。~Allowed output statistics may disclose input information.|比較總和、均值與每個輸入輸出。~Compare totals, means and individual-input outputs.|MPC 輸出無需任何披露風險評估。~MPC outputs need no disclosure-risk review.
成本驗證~Cost validation|協議、參與數與資料量需一起報告。~Protocol, party count and data size must be reported together.|記錄玩具基準的輪數、位元組和版本。~Record toy benchmark rounds, bytes and versions.|只報告每秒運算元就足以比較所有 MPC。~Operations per second suffice to compare all MPC systems.
部署分離~Deployment separation|模擬三個程序不等於真實獨立信任域。~Three simulated processes are not independent trust domains.|分開標示本地驗證與實際信任部署要求。~Distinguish local validation from actual trust-domain requirements.|同機三個程式證明了跨機構不串通。~Three same-host processes prove institutional noncollusion.
''',[(374,'皆分離資料持有者與計算者~Both separate owners and evaluators','MPC 通訊輪次與 HE 電路深度是不同成本~MPC communication rounds and HE circuit depth differ'),(371,'共同考慮最終輸出的資料用途~Both consider purposes of final outputs','MPC 協議保證不取代資料最小化治理~MPC guarantees do not replace minimization governance')],'microsoft','MP-SPDZ 為多種協議提供比較平臺；本課將安全模型、算術域與成本分開，不跨模型宣稱保證。~MP-SPDZ compares multiple protocols; this course separates threat models, arithmetic domains and costs without transferring guarantees across models.')


add(376,'關係資料、路徑查詢與圖形一致性~Relationship data, path queries and graph consistency','資料與語意~Data and semantics|儲存與索引~Storage and indexes|查詢與推理~Queries and reasoning|驗證與維護~Verification and maintenance','graphplan graphindex',
'假想平均出度 b=4 的無重複樹狀圖，深度 3 搜尋最多檢查 1+4+16+64=85 個節點。實際圖含環、共享節點與過濾，因此此幾何級數只是展開上界模型，不能當作資料庫耗時預測。~A synthetic tree with branching factor 4 searched to depth 3 visits 1+4+16+64=85 nodes. Real graphs have cycles, shared nodes and filters; this geometric model is not a database runtime prediction.', '''
節點身分~Node identity|實體識別與顯示名稱應分開儲存。~Entity identity is stored separately from display names.|在玩具資料中區分同名人物與同一人物別名。~Separate namesakes and aliases in toy data.|顯示名稱相等就能合併節點。~Equal display names justify merging nodes.
邊方向~Edge direction|關係方向、型別與時間限定圖形語意。~Direction, type and time constrain relationship meaning.|比較僱用、引用與隸屬三種有向邊。~Compare employment, citation and membership directions.|所有關係都可視為對稱。~All relationships are symmetric.
屬性結構~Property structure|屬性圖與三元組資料有不同表示介面。~Property graphs and triples expose different representations.|把一個玩具工程組織映成兩種表示。~Map one toy engineering organization into both formats.|任何圖格式都有相同查詢語意。~All graph formats have identical query semantics.
來源可信~Source provenance|知識關係應連結來源與生效範圍。~Knowledge relationships link provenance and validity scope.|為合成供應鏈邊新增來源與有效日期。~Add sources and validity dates to synthetic supply-chain edges.|關係入庫後不需要來源。~Stored relationships need no provenance.
唯一約束~Uniqueness constraints|唯一鍵能限制重複但不能保證語意正確。~Unique keys limit duplication without ensuring semantic truth.|注入不同鍵但同實體的玩具重複資料。~Insert toy duplicates with different keys but one entity.|唯一約束消除所有實體辨識錯誤。~Uniqueness constraints eliminate all entity-resolution errors.
索引入口~Index entry points|索引加速起始候選集合而非每條遍歷。~Indexes accelerate starting candidates, not every traversal.|比較小圖的全掃描與索引查詢計畫。~Compare scans and index seeks on a small graph.|建立任何索引都會加速所有查詢。~Any index speeds every query.
基數估計~Cardinality estimates|圖形分佈偏斜會讓平均度數估計失準。~Skewed degree distributions can defeat average-degree estimates.|比較均勻圖與樞紐圖的候選數。~Compare candidate counts in uniform and hub graphs.|平均節點度數足以描述最差展開。~Average degree describes worst-case expansion.
交易邊界~Transaction boundaries|部分更新可能留下不相容節點與關係。~Partial updates can leave incompatible nodes and relationships.|在玩具交易中模擬更新中途失敗。~Simulate a failed mid-update toy transaction.|節點寫入成功便代表所有邊一致。~Writing nodes successfully proves all edges consistent.
路徑長度~Path length|可變長度路徑需限制迴圈與搜尋深度。~Variable-length paths need cycle and depth bounds.|對小環圖比較有無深度限制的展開。~Compare bounded and unbounded expansion on a small cycle.|可達路徑越長查詢成本一定越低。~Longer reachable paths always cost less.
最短路徑~Shortest paths|邊權與方向決定最短的定義。~Weights and directions define what shortest means.|比較最少跳數與最小權重的玩具路徑。~Compare minimum hops and minimum weight on toy paths.|最少跳數永遠就是最小成本。~Fewest hops always means lowest cost.
圖形連線~Graph joins|多個模式交會可能增加中間結果基數。~Joining patterns can multiply intermediate cardinality.|記錄小圖每個運運算元的輸入輸出列數。~Record input/output rows of each operator on a small graph.|回傳列數少代表中間計算也少。~Few output rows imply little intermediate work.
推理邊界~Reasoning boundaries|路徑相關不代表因果或可替代關係。~Path association does not prove causality or substitutability.|為合成供應鏈路徑列可推論與不可推論項。~List valid and invalid inferences from synthetic supply paths.|兩節點相連便代表一者造成另一者。~Connected nodes prove one causes the other.
效能剖析~Performance profiling|實際列數與估計列數應逐運算子比較。~Actual and estimated rows are compared per operator.|在假想 PROFILE 表定位誤估放大處。~Locate amplified misestimates in a fictional PROFILE table.|只看總耗時便能判定索引缺失位置。~Total runtime locates every missing index.
存取隔離~Access isolation|圖形查詢許可權需涵蓋節點、關係與屬性。~Query privileges cover nodes, relationships and properties.|在玩具圖測試不同角色可見子圖。~Check role-visible subgraphs on a toy graph.|隱藏一個節點標題即可保護所有關係。~Hiding one title protects all relationships.
更新溯源~Update provenance|刪除或替換關係需保留變更原因和版本。~Deleting or replacing relations retains reason and version.|比較兩個合成版本的關係差異。~Compare relationship differences across synthetic versions.|新增邊無需檢查舊知識是否矛盾。~New edges need no contradiction checks.
交付圖譜~Graph delivery|圖譜驗收需同時看資料品質與查詢正確性。~Graph acceptance checks data quality and query correctness.|讓同學依來源重建一條工程關係鏈。~Have a peer reconstruct an engineering chain from sources.|圖形畫得漂亮就證明知識正確。~Attractive visualization proves correct knowledge.
''',[(377,'皆以索引縮小搜尋候選~Both use indexes to narrow candidates','圖查詢重關係路徑，文字排序重詞項證據~Graphs emphasize paths; text ranking emphasizes term evidence'),(378,'圖譜可提供可追溯檢索資料~Graphs can provide traceable retrieval data','RAG 還需檢查生成內容是否遵循證據~RAG additionally checks generated claims against evidence')],'cern','圖形資料庫把關係變成可查詢資料；本課借公開科學協作脈絡建立玩具知識圖，不宣稱 CERN 使用所選商用資料庫。~Graphs make relationships queryable; toy knowledge uses public scientific-collaboration context without claiming CERN uses the selected commercial database.')

add(377,'倒排索引、詞項評分與搜尋品質~Inverted indexes, term scoring and search quality','文字與索引~Text and indexes|評分與候選~Scoring and candidates|排序與服務~Ranking and service|驗證與更新~Verification and updates','bm25 textindex',
'假想 N=1000 篇檔案、詞出現於 n=100 篇，BM25 IDF=ln[1+(N−n+0.5)/(n+0.5)]=2.2986。若 tf=3、k1=1.2、b=0.75 且檔案長度等於平均，詞分約 2.2986×3×2.2/4.2=3.6121；無法直接當相關機率。~For N=1,000 and n=100, BM25 IDF is 2.2986. With tf=3, k1=1.2, b=0.75 and average-length text, the term score is about 3.6121; it is not a relevance probability.', '''
檔案身分~Document identity|索引檔案需穩定 ID、版本和來源。~Indexed documents need stable IDs, versions and origins.|把三個自製檔案的更新映到索引 ID。~Map updates of three self-made documents to index IDs.|URL 不變表示內容永不變。~An unchanged URL implies unchanged content.
斷詞策略~Tokenization|詞切分與正規化影響索引及查詢一致性。~Tokenization and normalization affect index-query compatibility.|比較中文詞、英文大小寫與數值單位的切分。~Compare Chinese terms, English case and numeric units.|只要文字可顯示就有一致詞項。~Displayable text always yields consistent terms.
倒排結構~Inverted structure|詞項對應檔案與位置列表。~Terms map to document and position lists.|手建五篇玩具檔案的倒排表。~Build a five-document toy inverted index.|倒排索引依序存完整網頁畫面。~An inverted index stores complete page screens in order.
欄位語意~Field semantics|標題、內文與識別欄位需不同分析規則。~Titles, bodies and identifiers need different analysis rules.|比較工程型號作 keyword 與分詞的差別。~Compare keyword versus tokenized engineering model numbers.|所有欄位都應用相同分析器。~All fields should use one analyzer.
詞頻飽和~Term-frequency saturation|BM25 詞頻貢獻隨 tf 增大逐漸飽和。~BM25 term contributions saturate as frequency increases.|手算 tf=1、3、10 的相對變化。~Calculate relative changes for tf 1,3 and 10.|重複詞十倍就必然得到十倍 BM25 分數。~Tenfold repetition always gives tenfold BM25 scores.
逆檔案頻率~Inverse document frequency|罕見詞的區分能力由語料統計決定。~Rare-term discrimination depends on corpus statistics.|重算本課 IDF 並更換檔案頻數。~Recalculate IDF with different document frequencies.|詞在每篇都有便最能區分檔案。~A term in every document best distinguishes documents.
長度正規化~Length normalization|長檔案的詞頻需依相對長度調整。~Long-document frequencies are adjusted by relative length.|比較相同 tf 的短文與長文。~Compare short and long documents with equal term frequency.|檔案越長就一定更相關。~Longer documents are necessarily more relevant.
候選擷取~Candidate truncation|只檢查有限候選可能遺漏相關檔案。~Limited candidates may miss relevant documents.|在自製語料比較不同候選上限的召回。~Compare recall at different candidate limits on self-made text.|首階段前十名包含所有相關檔案。~The first-stage top ten contain every relevant document.
多欄位排序~Multifield ranking|欄位權重需和任務證據一致而非任意放大。~Field weights should follow task evidence, not arbitrary amplification.|在工程檔案題集比較標題與內文權重。~Compare title/body weights on engineering queries.|標題權重無限提高總會改善搜尋。~Unlimited title weight always improves search.
短語查詢~Phrase queries|詞項位置影響短語與近接匹配。~Term positions affect phrase and proximity matches.|比較相同詞但次序不同的玩具文。~Compare toy texts with identical terms in different orders.|含相同詞就必然符合任意短語。~Matching terms necessarily match every phrase.
相關標註~Relevance judgments|相關程度需由任務與標註規則定義。~Task and annotation rules define relevance grades.|讓兩人獨立標註自製問答並比較一致性。~Have two reviewers label self-made queries independently.|點選次數就是無偏相關標註。~Click count is an unbiased relevance label.
排序指標~Ranking metrics|NDCG、MRR 與召回衡量不同性質。~NDCG, MRR and recall measure different properties.|手算三個候選列表的首答位置與增益。~Compute first-hit rank and gain for three toy lists.|單一排序指標能代表所有搜尋任務。~One ranking metric represents every search task.
分片統計~Shard statistics|分片語料分佈差異可能影響評分比較。~Different shard corpora can affect score comparisons.|在紙上比較全域與分片檔案頻數。~Compare global and shard-level frequencies on paper.|分片後每片 IDF 一定等於全域 IDF。~Shard IDF always equals global IDF.
更新可見~Update visibility|檔案更新與索引可搜尋時點可能不同。~Document updates and search visibility can differ in time.|建立玩具更新、重新整理與查詢時間線。~Build a toy update-refresh-query timeline.|寫入回應成功便永遠立即可搜尋。~Successful writes are always instantly searchable.
內容授權~Content rights|可搜尋連結不代表可複製全文或圖片。~Searchable links do not grant copying rights.|對自製語料與官方連結分開設定展示範圍。~Separate display scope for self-made text and official links.|網頁公開就可不限量重製全文。~Public webpages allow unlimited full-text copying.
搜尋驗收~Search acceptance|延遲、相關性、更新與授權需共同驗收。~Latency, relevance, freshness and rights are accepted jointly.|在離線題集列出指標及失敗查詢。~List metrics and failed queries on an offline set.|平均延遲最快的系統必然搜尋最佳。~The lowest mean latency guarantees the best search.
''',[(382,'兩者皆需候選召回與延遲驗證~Both validate candidate recall and latency','文字索引依詞頻，向量索引依表示距離~Text indexes use terms; vector indexes use representation distance'),(378,'RAG 的檢索可沿用倒排候選~RAG can reuse inverted-index candidates','生成答案需另外檢查來源忠實度~Generated answers need additional source-faithfulness checks')],'cern','搜尋從詞項倒排發展到混合檢索；本課只使用自製檔案比較排序，不蒐集未授權網站內容。~Search evolves from inverted terms to hybrid retrieval; self-made text supports ranking comparisons without unauthorized content collection.')

add(378,'檢索、神經生成與證據忠實度~Retrieval, neural generation and evidence faithfulness','資料與切片~Data and chunks|表示與檢索~Representations and retrieval|生成與限制~Generation and constraints|驗證與服務~Verification and service','rag ragpaper attention',
'假想問題有 10 個相關切片，top-5 取回 3 個；precision@5=3/5=0.6，recall@5=3/10=0.3。若答案引用 4 個可核驗宣告中 3 個獲來源支援，宣告支援率=0.75；此率不是整體答案正確率。~A synthetic query has 10 relevant chunks; top five retrieve three, giving precision@5=0.6 and recall@5=0.3. Three supported claims among four verifiable claims give support rate 0.75, not overall answer accuracy.', '''
來源可用~Source usability|來源需有版本、授權與可引用位置。~Sources need versions, rights and citeable locations.|為自製手冊建立來源 ID 與段落位址。~Assign source IDs and paragraph addresses to a self-made manual.|找到公開 PDF 就可全文重製。~Finding a public PDF permits full reproduction.
切片邊界~Chunk boundaries|切片過短會失去條件，過長會稀釋檢索訊號。~Short chunks lose conditions; long chunks dilute retrieval signals.|比較自製公式與假設是否落在同切片。~Check whether formulas and assumptions stay in one chunk.|每個切片字數相同就代表語意完整。~Equal chunk lengths imply complete semantics.
版本去重~Version deduplication|舊新版混合可能造成矛盾證據。~Mixing old and new versions can create conflicting evidence.|對兩版玩具規格標記生效與廢止。~Mark effective and obsolete toy specifications.|同標題檔案都可同等當最新來源。~Equal titles make all versions equally current.
資料許可權~Data permissions|檢索候選需在生成前依使用者許可權過濾。~Candidates are permission-filtered before generation.|用假資料角色檢查私有切片不進提示。~Verify fictional private chunks never enter unauthorized prompts.|生成後把引用隱藏就保護了私有內容。~Hiding citations after generation protects private content.
嵌入表示~Embedding representations|向量相近表示模型相似性，不保證物理正確。~Embedding similarity reflects model representations, not physical truth.|比較同義與數值相反的自製工程句。~Compare synonymous and numerically opposite self-made sentences.|最高餘弦相似度的句子必然正確。~The highest-cosine sentence is necessarily correct.
混合檢索~Hybrid retrieval|詞項與向量候選對型號和語意互補。~Lexical and vector candidates complement identifiers and semantics.|以工程型號與概念題比較兩種候選。~Compare methods on engineering identifiers and concepts.|向量搜尋永遠可取代型號精確搜尋。~Vector search always replaces exact identifier search.
再排序模型~Reranking models|交叉編碼器比較查詢與檔案對，成本隨候選數增加。~Cross-encoders score query-document pairs with candidate-dependent cost.|畫雙塔與交叉編碼器的計算路徑。~Draw dual-encoder and cross-encoder computation paths.|交叉編碼器可零成本處理無限候選。~Cross-encoders process unlimited candidates at no cost.
召回與精確~Recall and precision|召回不足可能使生成器無法引用缺失事實。~Low recall can deny the generator needed evidence.|重算本課 precision 與 recall 並增大 k。~Recalculate example precision and recall at larger k.|precision 高就代表所有必要證據都取回。~High precision means all required evidence is retrieved.
注意力介面~Attention interfaces|生成器在 token 序列上計算注意力，來源順序影響可見上下文。~Generators attend over tokens; source order affects visible context.|標出玩具提示的問題、證據與指示區。~Mark questions, evidence and instructions in a toy prompt.|注意力權重就是來源真實性證明。~Attention weights prove source truth.
提示信任~Prompt trust|來源內容是資料，不能自動提升為系統指令。~Source content is data, not automatically system authority.|用自製含無害錯誤指示的檔案驗證隔離。~Test separation using self-made harmless misleading text.|檔案裡的指示都應優先於系統規則。~Document instructions override system rules.
上下文預算~Context budget|token 限制需保留問題、來源和回答空間。~Token limits reserve space for question, evidence and output.|計算玩具提示加入切片後的剩餘容量。~Calculate remaining capacity after adding toy chunks.|輸入塞滿全部視窗就不影響輸出。~Filling the input window never affects output.
答案限制~Answer constraints|證據不足時應保留未知而非填補假設為事實。~Insufficient evidence remains unknown rather than invented fact.|對缺參數的工程問句生成有條件回答。~Write conditional answers to missing-parameter engineering questions.|語句流暢表示參數來源完整。~Fluent text proves complete parameter provenance.
引用對齊~Citation alignment|每項宣告需對應支援它的段落與條件。~Each claim maps to supporting passages and conditions.|逐句檢查合成答案與手冊內容。~Check each synthetic claim against the manual.|在段落末放任意來源就算完整引用。~Any citation at paragraph end suffices.
忠實度量測~Faithfulness measurement|來源支援率與真實世界正確率不同。~Source support and real-world correctness differ.|重算本課支援率並標記錯誤來源風險。~Recalculate support and mark potentially incorrect sources.|來源支援便保證世界事實正確。~Source support guarantees real-world truth.
延遲拆解~Latency decomposition|檢索、再排序、首 token 與生成需分段量測。~Retrieval, reranking, first token and generation are timed separately.|以假想時間表比較端到端與首答延遲。~Compare total and first-answer latency in a fictional table.|只看生成速度便代表整體服務速度。~Generation speed equals total service speed.
迴歸題集~Regression queries|題集需包含矛盾、許可權、未知與數值邊界。~Tests include contradictions, permissions, unknowns and numeric boundaries.|用自製資料建立可重算的八題題集。~Build eight reproducible questions from self-made data.|只測容易回答問題即可驗收 RAG。~Easy questions alone validate RAG.
''',[(377,'倒排檢索可作 RAG 的詞項通道~Inverted retrieval can be RAG lexical search','RAG 還組合生成與引用驗證~RAG additionally combines generation and citation checks'),(379,'共同依賴 token、注意力與推論快取~Both use tokens, attention and inference caches','RAG 增加可變來源與許可權邊界~RAG adds variable evidence and permission boundaries')],'cern','RAG 原始研究把外部檢索與參數化生成組合；本課將檢索、生成、引用驗收分開，避免把流暢答案當證據。~Original RAG research combines external retrieval with parametric generation; this course separately accepts retrieval, generation and citations.')

add(379,'Transformer、KV 快取與推論排程~Transformers, KV caches and inference scheduling','模型與數值~Models and numerics|注意力與快取~Attention and caches|服務與排程~Service and scheduling|驗證與交付~Verification and delivery','attention cache',
'假想 7×10⁹ 個參數、每個 2 bytes 的權重佔 14 GB 十進位，約 13.04 GiB；不含快取及執行開銷。若 32 層、32 KV 頭、頭維 128、2048 token、FP16，單序列 KV≈2×32×32×128×2048×2=1 GiB；GQA 改變 KV 頭數。~Seven billion two-byte parameters occupy 14 decimal GB, about 13.04 GiB, excluding runtime and caches. A 32-layer, 32-KV-head, head-size-128, 2,048-token FP16 sequence needs about 1 GiB of KV; GQA changes the KV-head count.', '''
參數與啟用~Parameters and activations|權重、啟用與快取有不同生命週期。~Weights, activations and caches have different lifetimes.|畫單請求與多請求的記憶體共享範圍。~Draw memory sharing for one and multiple requests.|模型檔案大小就是總記憶體需求。~Model-file size equals total memory needs.
詞元表示~Token representations|token 化影響序列長度與語言成本。~Tokenization affects sequence length and language costs.|比較自製繁中、英文和公式的 token 數。~Compare token counts of self-made Chinese, English and formulas.|同字數不同語言必然同 token 數。~Equal character counts imply equal token counts across languages.
嵌入與位置~Embedding and position|位置表示使序列順序對注意力可辨。~Position representations make order distinguishable to attention.|比較調換 token 的玩具向量輸入。~Compare toy inputs with reordered tokens.|無位置資訊的注意力自然知道任意順序。~Attention without positions knows any sequence order.
前饋層~Feed-forward layers|逐 token 非線性變換可主導參數與運算量。~Per-token nonlinear transformations can dominate parameters and compute.|計算玩具 d×4d×d 兩層矩陣維度。~Calculate dimensions of a toy d-to-4d-to-d block.|Transformer 只有注意力層沒有非線性。~Transformers contain only attention and no nonlinearity.
QKV 投影~QKV projections|Q、K、V 分別服務匹配與加權內容。~Q,K,V separately support matching and weighted content.|用兩 token 小矩陣手算投影形狀。~Calculate projection shapes for two toy tokens.|K 與 V 在所有網路中必然是同一矩陣。~Keys and values are always identical matrices.
縮放注意力~Scaled attention|softmax(QKᵀ/√d)V 需在對應軸正規化。~Softmax(QK-transpose/sqrt(d))V normalizes the matching axis.|手算兩 token 權重且核對各列和為一。~Calculate two-token weights and check row sums.|softmax 權重可無需正規化直接相加。~Softmax weights need no normalization.
因果遮罩~Causal masks|自迴歸 token 不能讀取尚未生成的未來位置。~Autoregressive tokens cannot read future positions.|畫三 token 下三角可見矩陣。~Draw a three-token lower-triangular visibility matrix.|生成時每個 token 都可看到未來真實答案。~Generated tokens can see future true answers.
多頭與 GQA~Multihead and GQA|Q 頭與 KV 頭可以不同數，影響快取容量。~Query and KV head counts can differ, affecting cache size.|比較 32 Q 頭配 32 和 8 KV 頭的容量。~Compare 32 query heads with 32 versus 8 KV heads.|GQA 必然保留與 MHA 相同 KV 容量。~GQA necessarily retains MHA cache capacity.
Prefill~Prefill|prefill 建立輸入序列快取與首答狀態。~Prefill builds input caches and first-answer state.|對假想短長提示比較首 token 延遲。~Compare first-token latency for short and long toy prompts.|第一 token 延遲只由輸出字數決定。~First-token latency depends only on output length.
Decode~Decode|decode 每步新增 token，常受權重讀取與快取存取約束。~Decode appends tokens and can be limited by weight and cache access.|用本地假模型分開計時 prefill 與 decode。~Time prefill and decode separately with a local toy model.|prefill 與 decode 的瓶頸永遠相同。~Prefill and decode always share the same bottleneck.
KV 快取~KV caches|儲存舊 K、V 可避免重算，但容量隨 token 增長。~Caching old keys and values avoids recomputation but grows with tokens.|重算本課單序列 KV 位元組數。~Recalculate example single-sequence KV bytes.|KV 快取大小不隨上下文增加。~KV cache does not grow with context.
量化誤差~Quantization errors|低位權重減少容量但可能改變輸出與數值誤差。~Low-bit weights reduce size but may alter outputs and error.|比較玩具量化前後層輸出與誤差。~Compare layer outputs before and after toy quantization.|四位權重在所有題目都與 FP16 完全相同。~Four-bit weights always equal FP16 outputs.
連續批次~Continuous batching|動態合批提高利用率但需處理請求生命週期。~Dynamic batching improves utilization while tracking request lifecycles.|模擬短長請求加入退出的排程表。~Simulate short and long request arrivals and exits.|合批越大每個請求延遲必然越低。~Larger batches always lower every request’s latency.
隔離與配額~Isolation and quotas|多使用者服務需限制上下文、同時請求與資源。~Multiuser services bound context, concurrency and resources.|在玩具請求表驗證每帳號容量限制。~Check per-account limits with toy requests.|共享模型代表可共享所有使用者快取。~Sharing a model permits sharing all users' caches.
生成策略~Generation policies|溫度與取樣會改變隨機性而非保證真實性。~Temperature and sampling change randomness, not truth guarantees.|對自製有限詞表比較貪婪與隨機取樣。~Compare greedy and random selection on a self-made vocabulary.|temperature=0 就保證所有事實正確。~Temperature zero guarantees factual correctness.
服務驗收~Service acceptance|首 token、每 token、尾延遲與品質應一起報告。~First-token, per-token, tail latency and quality are reported together.|建立合成請求矩陣並保留失敗案例。~Build a synthetic request matrix and retain failures.|只報每秒 token 就證明服務適合所有使用者。~Tokens per second alone proves universal service suitability.
''',[(378,'同用 Transformer 生成核心~Both use Transformer generation','RAG 多了可追溯檢索與引用鏈~RAG adds traceable retrieval and citation chains'),(372,'共同分析模型權重與梯度結構~Both analyze weights and gradient structure','推論儲存 KV，聯邦訓練管理更新及會計~Inference manages KV; federation manages updates and accounting')],'microsoft','Transformer 注意力與後續快取介面構成生成服務的核心；容量公式為透明的假想配置，非某一產品規格。~Transformer attention and subsequent cache interfaces underpin generation services; capacity formulas use transparent hypothetical settings, not a product specification.')

add(380,'資料版本、管線相依與訓練重現~Data versions, pipeline dependencies and training reproduction','來源與身份~Origins and identity|版本與儲存~Versions and storage|管線與重現~Pipelines and reproduction|交付與治理~Delivery and governance','dvc pipeline',
'假想 100 GB 資料每版僅改 5 GB、保留 10 版：完整複製需 1000 GB；若真實可重用固定內容塊，理想需 100+9×5=145 GB，節省 85.5%。壓縮、區塊邊界、去重與版本保留仍影響實際值。~Ten full 100-GB copies need 1,000 GB. If only 5 GB changes per version and unchanged blocks are genuinely reusable, ideal storage is 145 GB, an 85.5% saving. Compression, boundaries, deduplication and retention alter actual costs.', '''
資料身分~Data identity|資料內容、來源和版本應有可核對識別。~Content, provenance and versions need checkable identifiers.|對自製小表儲存摘要與來源說明。~Record digests and provenance for a self-made table.|資料夾名稱相同就表示內容相同。~Equal folder names imply equal content.
內容摘要~Content digests|摘要辨別內容變化但不證明標註質量。~Digests distinguish changes without proving label quality.|改變合成一行記錄並比較摘要。~Change one synthetic row and compare digests.|雜湊正確代表每個標註正確。~Correct hashes prove every label correct.
資料清單~Data manifests|清單連線檔案、大小、格式與必要許可權。~Manifests connect files, sizes, formats and permissions.|讓同學僅依清單找到自製輸入。~Have a peer locate self-made inputs from a manifest.|只保留資料總大小就能重現版本。~Total size alone reproduces a version.
許可用途~License purposes|訓練與公開散佈可能需要不同授權。~Training and redistribution may need different permissions.|為自製和官方連結分別記錄允許用途。~Record separate permissions for self-made files and links.|能下載就能重發所有資料。~Downloadability permits redistribution of all data.
程式碼資料分離~Code/data separation|大型資料可在物件儲存，程式碼留版本控制。~Large data can live in object storage while code is versioned.|畫玩具 Git metadata 與資料物件對應。~Map toy Git metadata to data objects.|大型權重必須全部放普通 Git 才能追蹤。~Large weights must be in ordinary Git to be tracked.
不可變版本~Immutable versions|固定版本避免訓練途中讀取改變資料。~Pinned versions prevent training-time data changes.|比較指定版本與漂浮最新版本的結果。~Compare pinned and floating-latest inputs.|資料下載網址固定就代表內容不可變。~Fixed download URLs imply immutable content.
快取與去重~Caching and deduplication|內容重用可減少複製但需驗證物件完整性。~Content reuse reduces copies but needs integrity checks.|重算本課理想儲存並標記不能共享部分。~Recalculate ideal storage and unshareable regions.|兩版只改少量記錄就必然只佔少量空間。~Small record changes guarantee small extra storage.
遠端許可權~Remote permissions|metadata 可公開不代表資料物件也公開。~Public metadata need not imply public data objects.|對玩具 manifest 分開測試資料訪問角色。~Test data-access roles separately from toy manifests.|Git 公開後所有物件必須公開。~Public Git requires all objects public.
管線有向圖~Pipeline DAG|每階段輸入、輸出和參數形成相依圖。~Stage inputs, outputs and parameters form a dependency DAG.|畫清洗、切分、訓練與評價的玩具 DAG。~Draw a toy clean-split-train-evaluate DAG.|階段執行順序可以不理相依。~Stage order may ignore dependencies.
失效重算~Invalidation|輸入或參數變化需重算受影響的後續階段。~Changed inputs or parameters invalidate downstream stages.|在玩具圖傳播一個參數變更。~Propagate one parameter change through a toy graph.|只改參數不需重算任何產物。~Parameter changes never require recomputation.
隨機性版本~Randomness versions|種子、演算法、裝置與版本皆影響可重現程度。~Seeds, algorithms, devices and versions affect reproducibility.|比較固定種子但不同程式版本的輸出。~Compare fixed seeds across program versions.|固定種子保證跨所有硬體逐位元相同。~A seed guarantees bitwise identity on every device.
資料切分~Data splits|訓練驗證切分需在版本變化下避免洩漏。~Train/validation splits avoid leakage across revisions.|固定自製資料的實體級切分並檢查重複。~Pin entity-level synthetic splits and inspect duplication.|隨機逐列切分永遠不發生資料洩漏。~Random row splits never leak information.
血緣記錄~Lineage records|模型版本需連線實際輸入、參數和程式。~Model versions link actual inputs, parameters and code.|為玩具模型生成完整血緣摘要。~Produce a complete lineage digest for a toy model.|只儲存最終權重就可重現訓練。~Final weights alone reproduce training.
恢復驗證~Restore validation|備份是否有效需以恢復測驗確認。~Backup validity requires restore tests.|從合成離線物件重建一個指定版本。~Rebuild a pinned version from synthetic offline objects.|上傳成功等於能可靠恢復。~Successful upload guarantees restore.
留存策略~Retention policies|刪除物件會破壞引用它的歷史版本。~Deleting objects can break historical revisions referencing them.|找出玩具保留策略下會失效的版本。~Identify revisions broken by a toy retention policy.|刪除舊資料不影響任何舊模型重現。~Deleting old data never affects old-model reproduction.
交付驗收~Delivery acceptance|交付需驗證內容、執行與授權三種完整性。~Delivery checks content, execution and rights integrity.|讓同學用無私人資料的封包重現小訓練。~Have a peer reproduce toy training without private data.|ZIP 可以解壓就表示研究可重現。~Unzipping proves research reproducibility.
''',[(381,'共同連結模型、資料與時間版本~Both connect model, data and temporal versions','漂移監測比較執行分佈而非僅重現訓練~Drift monitoring compares operation distributions, not merely training reproduction'),(370,'共同使用摘要與可追溯紀錄~Both use digests and traceable records','ML 管線還需參數與隨機性，而鑑識重交接~ML adds parameters and randomness; forensics emphasizes custody')],'cern','資料版本把研究輸入與可重現管線連結；本課以小型合成資料示範，不將 metadata 當作公開資料授權。~Data versioning connects research inputs with reproducible pipelines; synthetic examples do not treat metadata as data-release permission.')

add(381,'資料漂移、品質與模型效能分離~Separation of data drift, quality and model performance','基準與資料~References and data|統計與漂移~Statistics and drift|效能與告警~Performance and alerts|復核與回饋~Review and feedback','drift metrics',
'假想基準 N(0,1) 與執行 N(0.5,1)，均值偏移為 0.5 個基準標準差。兩批各 n=100 時均值差標準誤 sqrt(1/100+1/100)=0.1414，z≈3.536；此理想檢驗假設獨立常態且不是效能下降證明。~Synthetic reference N(0,1) and current N(0.5,1) differ by 0.5 reference deviations. Two independent n=100 batches give mean-difference SE=0.1414 and z≈3.536 under normal assumptions; drift is not proof of performance loss.', '''
基準版本~Reference versions|比較需固定基準資料、時間窗與模型版本。~Comparisons pin reference data, windows and model versions.|建立自製監測資料的版本表。~Build versions for self-made monitoring data.|最新資料總是最佳且唯一基準。~The latest data is always the sole best reference.
資料品質~Data quality|缺測、重複與格式錯誤和分佈漂移不同。~Missingness, duplication and format errors differ from drift.|把合成異常分成品質與分佈兩類。~Classify synthetic anomalies as quality or distribution changes.|所有資料異常都可稱概念漂移。~Every data anomaly is concept drift.
特徵漂移~Feature drift|P(x) 改變不必然改變 P(y∣x)。~Changing P(x) need not change P(y∣x).|構造輸入平移但規則仍成立的玩具案例。~Construct shifted inputs with unchanged toy rules.|輸入分佈改變必定使模型失效。~Input shifts necessarily invalidate a model.
概念漂移~Concept drift|P(y∣x) 改變可能在輸入分佈不變時發生。~P(y∣x) can change while the input distribution remains fixed.|保持玩具 x 分佈並更改標註規則。~Keep toy input distributions and change labeling rules.|x 分佈不變就保證模型關係不變。~Unchanged inputs guarantee unchanged target relationships.
均值檢驗~Mean tests|均值檢驗依樣本數、方差與獨立假設。~Mean tests depend on count, variance and independence.|重算本課 z 值並改變樣本數量。~Recalculate z and change sample counts.|均值差相同就有相同統計顯著度。~Equal mean differences imply equal significance.
分佈檢驗~Distribution tests|整體分佈差異不只體現在均值。~Distribution differences are not limited to means.|比較同均值不同尾部的自製分佈。~Compare self-made distributions with equal means but different tails.|均值相同就代表分佈相同。~Equal means imply equal distributions.
效應量~Effect size|大樣本的小差異可能顯著但不重要。~Small differences in large samples can be significant yet immaterial.|同時報告假想差異、區間與影響量。~Report differences, intervals and effect sizes together.|p 值小就代表業務影響大。~A small p-value implies large business impact.
多重比較~Multiple comparisons|大量特徵檢驗會增加誤報機會。~Testing many features raises false-alarm opportunities.|模擬 20 個假想獨立檢驗的告警頻率。~Simulate alerts from 20 hypothetical independent tests.|每欄 5% 閾值意味總誤報也為 5%。~Five percent per column means five percent overall false alarms.
標籤延遲~Delayed labels|執行效能可能在真實標籤到達後才能評估。~Operational performance may need delayed labels.|畫預測、標籤到達與指標更新時間線。~Draw prediction, label-arrival and metric-update times.|沒有標籤也可直接算真實準確率。~True accuracy is available without labels.
分類指標~Classification metrics|precision、recall 與基率共同影響誤判成本。~Precision, recall and prevalence affect error costs.|手算合成混淆矩陣而不只報告 accuracy。~Calculate a synthetic confusion matrix beyond accuracy.|accuracy 高就代表罕見類別召回高。~High accuracy implies high rare-class recall.
校準漂移~Calibration drift|預測機率可能排序良好但偏離實際頻率。~Probabilities can rank well while miscalibrated.|比較合成分箱機率與實際正例頻率。~Compare binned synthetic probabilities with positive rates.|AUC 高表示機率完全校準。~High AUC implies perfect calibration.
分群監測~Segment monitoring|總體穩定可能掩蓋特定群組失效。~Overall stability can hide segment failures.|分開報告合成裝置型別的誤差。~Report errors separately by synthetic device type.|總體指標穩定代表每群組穩定。~Stable overall metrics imply stable groups.
告警抑制~Alert suppression|去重和持續視窗減少噪聲但可能延緩偵測。~Deduplication and persistence reduce noise but may delay detection.|比較單窗與連續三窗的玩具告警。~Compare one-window and three-window toy alerts.|延長持續視窗完全不會影響偵測時間。~Longer persistence never changes detection time.
競爭原因~Competing causes|模型衰退可能來自測量、流程或標籤變化。~Performance loss may reflect measurement, process or label changes.|對合成異常列出兩個可區分原因。~List two distinguishable causes for synthetic anomalies.|所有效能下降都需立即換大模型。~Every performance decline needs a larger model.
再訓練門檻~Retraining gates|漂移告警不是自動釋出新模型的充分依據。~Drift alerts alone do not justify automatic model replacement.|建立合成迴歸驗證與回退閘門。~Build synthetic regression and rollback gates.|一檢測到 drift 就必須立即上線重訓模型。~Every drift alert requires immediate model release.
監測驗收~Monitoring acceptance|驗收需檢驗漏報、誤報與實際行動價值。~Acceptance tests misses, false alarms and action value.|用自製固定題集比較兩種監測策略。~Compare two monitoring policies on self-made fixed cases.|告警越多就表示監測越有效。~More alerts mean more effective monitoring.
''',[(380,'需固定模型和資料版本才能比較~Comparisons require pinned model and data versions','監測加入時間分佈與業務後果~Monitoring adds temporal distributions and consequences'),(384,'機視覺也需監測環境與樣本偏移~Vision also monitors environment and sample shifts','影像幾何與照明需另有校正~Image geometry and lighting require separate calibration')],'nist','開源監測工具提供統計量與測試；本課區分資料變化與效能變化，不將單一告警當結論。~Open monitoring tools provide statistics and tests; the course distinguishes data shifts from performance changes rather than treating one alert as a conclusion.')

add(382,'向量距離、近似索引與召回成本~Vector distances, approximate indexes and recall cost','表示與距離~Representations and distances|索引與搜尋~Indexes and search|服務與版本~Service and versions|召回與驗收~Recall and acceptance','hnsw ivf',
'玩具向量 x=(3,4)、y=(4,3)，範數皆為 5，餘弦相似度=24/25=0.96，Euclidean 距離=√2≈1.414。單位向量距離平方=2(1−cos)=0.08；未正規化時此式不能直接沿用。~Toy x=(3,4), y=(4,3) both have norm 5, cosine 0.96 and Euclidean distance sqrt(2). For normalized vectors, squared distance is 2(1−cos)=0.08; the identity cannot be applied unchanged to unnormalized inputs.', '''
表示版本~Representation versions|不同嵌入模型的向量座標通常不可混用。~Different embedding models generally have incompatible coordinates.|給合成向量加模型與維度版本。~Add model and dimension versions to synthetic vectors.|維度相同便代表不同模型向量相容。~Equal dimensions imply cross-model compatibility.
向量正規~Normalization|單位正規化改變距離與幅度語意。~Unit normalization changes distance and magnitude meaning.|手算本課向量正規化及餘弦。~Normalize the example vectors and calculate cosine.|正規化後仍保留原向量長度資訊。~Normalization preserves original magnitude information.
距離選擇~Distance choices|內積、餘弦與 L2 有不同排名假設。~Dot product, cosine and L2 assume different ranking semantics.|比較玩具向量不同尺度下三種排名。~Compare three rankings after scaling toy vectors.|所有距離對任意向量產生相同排名。~All distances rank every vector identically.
精確基準~Exact baselines|近似召回需對照窮舉精確搜尋。~Approximate recall needs exhaustive exact references.|在本地小向量集求精確 top-k。~Find exact top-k on a small local vector set.|近似索引自己的結果可當精確真值。~An approximate index is its own exact ground truth.
HNSW 層次~HNSW hierarchy|多層鄰居圖用粗到細的路徑找候選。~Multilevel neighbor graphs navigate coarse-to-fine candidates.|畫小圖的高層入口與低層搜尋。~Draw upper entrances and lower searches on a small graph.|HNSW 是完整排序的倒排詞表。~HNSW is a fully sorted term-posting list.
圖連結度~Graph connectivity|較多鄰居增加圖成本並可能改善搜尋。~More neighbors increase graph costs and may improve search.|比較自製圖不同連結數的步數。~Compare search steps at different toy graph connectivity.|鄰居越多必然更省記憶體。~More neighbors always reduce memory.
建構深度~Construction effort|建圖候選寬度影響建設成本與品質。~Construction search breadth affects build cost and quality.|在玩具圖比較不同候選預算。~Compare different candidate budgets on a toy graph.|建圖成本不會影響後續召回。~Build effort cannot affect recall.
查詢深度~Query effort|查詢候選寬度取捨召回與延遲。~Query breadth trades recall against latency.|對固定小集比較不同搜尋預算。~Compare search budgets on one fixed small dataset.|提高搜尋預算必定同時降低延遲。~More search effort always lowers latency.
IVF 分割槽~IVF partitions|聚類中心把向量分配到多個候選桶。~Centroids partition vectors into candidate lists.|手分二維玩具點並畫邊界。~Partition toy 2D points and draw boundaries.|每個查詢都只可能相關於一個桶。~Every query is relevant to only one list.
nprobe 作用~Probe counts|探測更多分割槽降低漏檢但增加掃描量。~Probing more lists reduces misses but adds scans.|比較邊界點探測一桶與兩桶。~Compare one versus two probes near a boundary.|只查最近桶就必然有精確 top-k。~The nearest list always gives exact top-k.
量化表示~Quantized representations|壓縮向量引入誤差而非只改檔案大小。~Compressed vectors introduce errors, not merely smaller files.|比較玩具量化前後鄰近排名。~Compare neighbor ranks before and after toy quantization.|向量壓縮永遠不改變距離。~Vector compression never changes distance.
過濾搜尋~Filtered search|許可權與屬性過濾改變有效候選數量。~Permission and attribute filters change eligible candidates.|用合成角色比較先過濾與後過濾。~Compare filtering before and after search with fictional roles.|top-k 後刪無權項仍保證返回 k 個。~Deleting unauthorized top-k entries still guarantees k results.
刪除更新~Deletion and updates|邏輯刪除與重新索引影響一致性與成本。~Logical deletion and reindexing affect consistency and costs.|模擬玩具刪除後舊索引候選處理。~Simulate stale candidates after toy deletion.|刪除資料庫記錄必然馬上刪除所有索引副本。~Deleting a record instantly deletes every index copy.
召回評估~Recall evaluation|recall@k 是對精確近鄰的覆蓋，不等於語義相關。~Recall@k measures exact-neighbor coverage, not semantic relevance.|分開報告近鄰召回和人工相關標註。~Separate neighbor recall from human relevance labels.|向量召回 100% 代表答案事實全正確。~Perfect vector recall proves every answer factual.
容量預算~Capacity budgets|向量、圖邊、metadata 與副本共同佔儲存。~Vectors, edges, metadata and replicas share storage costs.|計算假想 1000×128 FP32 原始向量 bytes。~Calculate raw bytes for 1,000 synthetic 128D FP32 vectors.|維度乘位寬就是整個資料庫容量。~Dimensions times width equals total database capacity.
服務驗收~Service acceptance|延遲、召回、過濾與更新皆需固定題集。~Latency, recall, filtering and updates need fixed tests.|用自製向量建立可重跑評估報告。~Build a reproducible report using self-made vectors.|單次最快查詢即可代表服務品質。~The single fastest query represents service quality.
''',[(377,'共同評估候選召回與排名~Both evaluate candidate recall and rankings','向量表示可能失去精確型號詞~Vectors can lose exact identifier terms'),(378,'向量索引可支援 RAG 檢索~Vector indexes can support RAG retrieval','索引不處理生成與引用忠實度~Indexes do not handle generation or citation faithfulness')],'cern','HNSW 與 IVF 是不同候選生成路徑；本課以二維點圖說明結構，隨後驗證維度、許可權與版本。~HNSW and IVF generate candidates differently; 2D toy maps explain structure before dimension, permission and version checks.')

add(383,'聲學表示、串流神經網路與解碼~Acoustic representations, streaming neural networks and decoding','聲音與特徵~Audio and features|模型與對齊~Models and alignment|串流與解碼~Streaming and decoding|評估與交付~Evaluation and delivery','asr ctc',
'假想 16 kHz 單聲道 PCM16 每秒為 16000×2=32000 bytes。320 ms 一塊有 5120 樣本、10240 bytes；若需額外 80 ms 右文，單塊聲學可見範圍 400 ms。模型計算與端點判斷另加延遲。~Synthetic 16-kHz mono PCM16 uses 32,000 bytes/s. A 320-ms chunk has 5,120 samples and 10,240 bytes. Adding 80-ms right context makes 400 ms visible audio; compute and endpoint decisions add latency.', '''
同意與範圍~Consent and scope|語音可能包含個人資訊，錄音需有明確同意。~Speech can contain personal information; recording needs explicit consent.|用自製合成音或本人同意短句設任務。~Use synthetic audio or personally consented utterances.|瀏覽器允許麥克風等於允許永久公開錄音。~Microphone permission permits permanent public recordings.
取樣與別名~Sampling and aliasing|取樣率及前置低通限制可保留頻率。~Sampling rate and antialias filtering bound retained frequencies.|比較自製低頻音不同取樣率頻譜。~Compare synthetic tones at different sample rates.|提高位深就自動提高最高保留頻率。~More bit depth automatically raises retained bandwidth.
聲道與增益~Channels and gain|混音與增益會影響幅度及截波。~Mixing and gain affect amplitude and clipping.|對合成波形比較線性增益與飽和。~Compare gain and saturation on synthetic waveforms.|聲音越大模型一定越準。~Louder audio always improves accuracy.
幀與譜~Frames and spectra|短時窗用區域性平穩假設提取頻率特徵。~Short windows extract features under local stationarity assumptions.|計算玩具窗長、hop 與每秒幀數。~Calculate toy window, hop and frames per second.|窗越長時頻解析度都必然越好。~Longer windows always improve both resolutions.
聲學編碼~Acoustic encoders|CNN、RNN 與注意力提取不同時間依賴。~CNNs, RNNs and attention capture different temporal dependencies.|畫玩具卷積感受野與迴圈狀態。~Draw toy convolutional receptive fields and recurrent state.|所有聲學網路都無需歷史狀態。~All acoustic networks need no history state.
CTC 對齊~CTC alignment|CTC 合併重複符號並去 blank 形成文字。~CTC merges repeats and removes blanks to form text.|手算兩條含 blank 的玩具標籤路徑。~Collapse two toy label paths containing blanks.|CTC 的 blank 就是普通空白字元。~CTC blank is an ordinary space character.
RNN-T 因子~RNN-T factors|轉導器結合聲學編碼、預測網路與聯合網路。~Transducers combine acoustic, prediction and joint networks.|分開畫聲音與已輸出 token 的路徑。~Draw separate acoustic and previous-token pathways.|RNN-T 只有一個聲學 softmax。~RNN-T contains only one acoustic softmax.
流式注意力~Streaming attention|受限上下文使模型可在未讀完整音訊時輸出。~Bounded context permits outputs before full audio arrives.|比較全序列與有限右文的可見範圍。~Compare full-sequence and bounded-right-context visibility.|流式模型必需看到全部未來音訊。~Streaming models must see all future audio.
塊與重疊~Chunks and overlap|塊界重疊需避免丟失或重複處理音訊。~Chunk overlap avoids missing or duplicate processing.|重算本課樣本數並標註重疊區。~Recalculate sample counts and mark overlap regions.|塊重疊部分可重複轉寫而無需去重。~Overlaps may be transcribed twice without deduplication.
狀態延續~State continuity|流式狀態需與會話隔離並在結束時清理。~Streaming states are session-isolated and cleared at end.|用兩組自製音訊驗證狀態重置。~Check state resets with two self-made audio streams.|不同使用者可以共用前一語音狀態。~Different users may share prior speech states.
增量文字~Incremental text|暫時假設可能被後續聲音修訂。~Partial hypotheses can be revised by later audio.|記錄合成片段的暫存與確認文字。~Record partial and finalized synthetic transcripts.|首次顯示 token 就永遠不會修正。~First-displayed tokens never change.
端點偵測~Endpoint detection|停頓、噪聲與語言節奏影響終點判定。~Pauses, noise and rhythm affect endpoint decisions.|比較自製短停頓與真正結束的波形。~Compare synthetic short pauses and true endings.|靜音一幀就必定是說話結束。~One silent frame always ends speech.
解碼策略~Decoding strategies|beam 搜尋權衡語言約束與延遲。~Beam search trades language constraints against latency.|在小詞表比較貪婪與兩路候選。~Compare greedy and two-path candidates on a small vocabulary.|更大 beam 必然同時更快與更準。~Larger beams always improve speed and accuracy.
文字錯誤率~Word error rate|WER=(替換+刪除+插入)/參考詞數。~WER divides substitutions, deletions and insertions by reference words.|手算自製 10 詞參考的一組錯誤。~Calculate errors against a self-made ten-word reference.|插入錯誤不需計入 WER。~Insertions do not count in WER.
語種與口音~Languages and accents|不同語言分詞與口音需獨立驗證。~Languages, segmentation and accents need separate validation.|對本人同意的不同短句列分組結果。~Report groups for personally consented varied utterances.|一種英語測試可證明所有語種準確。~One English test proves accuracy in every language.
端到端延遲~End-to-end delay|塊等待、右文、模型及端點共同決定延遲。~Chunk wait, lookahead, model and endpointing determine delay.|建立假想延遲預算並測試尾延遲。~Build a fictional latency budget and test tails.|模型執行時間就是完整轉寫延遲。~Model execution time equals full transcription delay.
''',[(379,'都分析注意力、狀態與服務延遲~Both analyze attention, state and service latency','ASR 從聲學幀到文字而 LLM 以 token 生成~ASR maps acoustic frames to text; LLMs generate tokens'),(381,'皆需監測環境與群組質量~Both monitor environments and group quality','語音評估還需標註對齊及端點~Speech evaluation also needs alignment and endpoints')],'microsoft','CTC 與 RNN-T 提供不同對齊和串流路徑；課題用合成或本人同意錄音，不採集旁人的聲音。~CTC and RNN-T provide different alignment and streaming paths; exercises use synthetic or personally consented audio.')

add(384,'影像物理、卷積架構與檢測誤差~Image physics, convolutional architectures and detection errors','成像與標定~Imaging and calibration|資料與網路~Data and networks|推論與檢測~Inference and detection|驗證與漂移~Verification and drift','calibration cnn metrics',
'玩具卷積輸入 32×32×3，核 3×3、stride1、padding1、輸出 16 通道：輸出 32×32×16；權重 3×3×3×16=432，加偏置為 448 參數；直接卷積約 32×32×16×27=442368 MAC，1 MAC 是否算 2 FLOP 必須宣告。~A toy 32×32×3 input with 3×3 kernels, stride 1, padding 1 and 16 outputs gives 32×32×16 activations, 448 parameters including biases and 442,368 MACs. Declare whether one MAC is counted as two FLOPs.', '''
光學取樣~Optical sampling|畫素、視野和鏡頭共同決定可辨尺寸。~Pixels, field of view and lenses set resolvable sizes.|對假想視野計算毫米每畫素。~Calculate millimeters per pixel for an assumed field.|畫素越多就無條件能看清任意缺陷。~More pixels resolve arbitrary defects unconditionally.
曝光與運動~Exposure and motion|曝光時間內運動產生方向相關模糊。~Motion during exposure creates directional blur.|計算假想速度下的畫素位移。~Calculate pixel displacement at an assumed speed.|提高亮度不需考慮運動模糊。~More brightness removes motion-blur concerns.
幾何標定~Geometric calibration|內參與畸變決定畫素到幾何的對映。~Intrinsics and distortion map pixels to geometry.|用自製棋盤圖比較校正前後誤差。~Compare errors before and after self-made calibration patterns.|未標定影像可直接量任意物理長度。~Uncalibrated images measure arbitrary physical lengths.
照明對比~Lighting contrast|反射與陰影可改變缺陷特徵而非缺陷本身。~Reflection and shadows change appearance without changing defects.|比較自製同形狀圖的兩種照明。~Compare two illuminations of the same self-made shape.|暗色區域必然就是材料缺陷。~Every dark region is a material defect.
資料切分~Dataset splits|同一工件不同照片不能洩漏到訓練和測試兩側。~Views of one part must not leak across training and test.|按玩具工件 ID 分組切分。~Split by toy part IDs.|隨機按照片切分永遠獨立。~Random image splits are always independent.
標註粒度~Annotation granularity|分類、框和分割標註具有不同目標。~Classes, boxes and masks target different tasks.|對自製零件圖分別製作三種標註。~Create three annotation types for self-made parts.|類別標籤自動提供準確缺陷邊界。~Class labels automatically provide precise boundaries.
卷積參數~Convolution parameters|標準卷積參數量由核尺寸與輸入／輸出通道決定；輸出尺寸另依輸入形狀、步長與 padding 決定，步長本身不改參數量。~Standard convolution parameter counts depend on kernel size and input/output channels; output shapes additionally depend on input shape, stride and padding. Stride alone does not change parameter count.|重算本課卷積尺寸、參數與 MAC。~Recalculate example shapes, parameters and MACs.|參數數目與輸出空間尺寸必然相同。~Parameter count equals output spatial size.
感受野~Receptive fields|多層卷積及下采樣改變可見輸入範圍。~Stacked convolutions and downsampling change receptive fields.|手算兩層 3×3 stride1 的 5×5 感受野。~Calculate a 5×5 field for two stride-one 3×3 layers.|兩層 3×3 的感受野仍必然是 3×3。~Two 3×3 layers still have a 3×3 field.
啟用與梯度~Activations and gradients|非線性與鏈式法則決定訓練訊號傳播。~Nonlinearity and the chain rule determine gradient propagation.|以小層有限差分核對反傳方向。~Check backpropagation directions by tiny-layer finite differences.|增加層數永不改變梯度穩定性。~Adding layers never affects gradient stability.
CNN 與 ViT~CNN and ViT|區域性卷積與全域性注意力有不同歸納偏置。~Local convolutions and global attention have different inductive biases.|畫同玩具圖的卷積鄰域與 patch token。~Draw convolution neighborhoods and patch tokens for one toy image.|ViT 完全不需位置表示或資料驗證。~ViTs need no positional representation or validation.
候選與閾值~Candidates and thresholds|檢測閾值權衡漏檢和誤報。~Detection thresholds trade misses against false alarms.|對合成分數計算兩閾值混淆矩陣。~Calculate two-threshold confusion matrices for synthetic scores.|提高閾值會同時減少所有漏檢誤報。~Higher thresholds reduce every miss and false alarm.
IoU 衡量~IoU measurement|IoU 用交集面積除以並集面積。~IoU divides intersection area by union area.|手算自製兩矩形交集並集。~Calculate intersection and union for two self-made rectangles.|框中心重合就代表 IoU=1。~Shared box centers imply IoU one.
群組誤差~Group errors|整體 accuracy 可隱藏小缺陷或特定材料失效。~Overall accuracy can hide tiny-defect or material failures.|對合成尺寸與材料分組報告 recall。~Report recall by synthetic size and material.|整體準確率高證明所有缺陷尺寸可檢。~High accuracy proves every defect size detectable.
推論部署~Inference deployment|量化和縮圖會改變數值與小缺陷資訊。~Quantization and resizing change numerical and small-defect information.|比較自製圖縮放前後模型特徵。~Compare features before and after self-made image resizing.|部署加速不會改變任何檢出率。~Deployment acceleration never affects detection rates.
漂移追蹤~Drift tracking|新鏡頭、照明與材料改變輸入分佈。~New lenses, lighting and materials shift inputs.|為玩具環境變更制定再次驗證題集。~Define repeat tests after toy environmental changes.|一次標定透過就保證永久準確。~One calibration guarantees permanent accuracy.
工程驗收~Engineering acceptance|產線驗收需結合失誤成本、時延與可追溯性。~Acceptance combines error costs, delay and traceability.|輸出合成樣本的分組誤差與失敗示例。~Report group errors and failure examples for synthetic samples.|每秒幀數足夠就代表工程質量合格。~Enough frames per second proves engineering quality.
''',[(381,'共同監測分佈和群組質量~Both monitor distributions and group quality','視覺還依賴成像與幾何校正~Vision additionally depends on imaging and geometry'),(387,'共同處理座標、取樣與圖形管線~Both handle coordinates, sampling and image pipelines','視覺從影像推斷，渲染從模型生成影像~Vision infers from images; rendering generates them')],'microsoft','卷積與注意力架構連線成像物理和檢驗任務；課題用自製圖形，不將網路準確率當生產安全證明。~Convolution and attention connect imaging physics with inspection; self-made shapes do not make network accuracy a production-safety guarantee.')

add(385,'物理狀態、事件資料與分身一致性~Physical state, event data and twin consistency','實體與語意~Entities and semantics|事件與同步~Events and synchronization|模型與分析~Models and analysis|許可權與驗收~Permissions and acceptance','twin policy',
'假想溫度感測器每秒 10 次、每筆 40 bytes，1000 個感測器原始資料率=400000 bytes/s，約 0.4 MB/s；一天 34.56 GB 十進位。訊息封裝、索引、副本和重送不在此值內。~A synthetic fleet of 1,000 sensors at 10 samples/s and 40 bytes/sample produces 400,000 bytes/s or 34.56 decimal GB/day, before message framing, indexes, replication and retries.', '''
實體標識~Entity identifiers|物理裝置與數字實體需穩定對映。~Physical devices need stable mappings to digital entities.|給三臺玩具裝置建序號與分身 ID。~Map serials and twin IDs for three toy devices.|裝置換名就必須成為同一個舊分身。~Renaming a device guarantees identity with an old twin.
屬性與能力~Properties and capabilities|當前狀態與可執行能力是不同語意。~Current state differs from executable capability.|區分合成溫度值與允許設定動作。~Separate synthetic temperatures from allowed setpoints.|能顯示狀態就代表能控制真實裝置。~Displaying state implies controlling the real device.
測量單位~Measurement units|單位、座標與時間基準是資料語意的一部分。~Units, coordinates and clocks are part of semantics.|比較攝氏與開爾文的玩具資料轉換。~Compare Celsius and kelvin conversions in toy data.|欄位名稱溫度足以辨識其單位。~A temperature field name identifies its units.
時間版本~Temporal versions|觀測時刻與入庫時刻需分開。~Observation and ingestion times are distinct.|模擬遲到資料與最新狀態更新。~Simulate late data and latest-state updates.|最後到達的記錄必然代表最新物理狀態。~The latest arrival always represents the latest physical state.
事件排序~Event ordering|重送與亂序要求去重和順序規則。~Retries and reordering require deduplication and ordering rules.|在合成訊息序列注入重複及亂序。~Inject duplicates and reordering into synthetic messages.|訊息傳到一次就保證只處理一次。~One delivery guarantees exactly one processing.
狀態與期望~Reported and desired state|實際回報與期望設定不能直接混同。~Reported and desired states are not interchangeable.|畫玩具裝置設定與回報差異曲線。~Plot desired/reported differences for a toy device.|寫入期望狀態就表示裝置已到達。~Writing desired state means the device has reached it.
流量預算~Traffic budgets|取樣頻率、記錄大小與數量決定原始資料率。~Rate, record size and device count set raw traffic.|重算本課資料率與一天容量。~Recalculate example traffic and daily capacity.|原始資料率已經包含所有副本與索引。~Raw traffic includes all replicas and indexes.
連線失效~Connection failures|裝置離線時數字狀態可能變陳舊。~Digital state can become stale when devices disconnect.|為假想狀態新增年齡與品質標記。~Add age and quality flags to fictional states.|畫面有數值就代表當前狀態已知。~A displayed value means current state is known.
物理模型~Physical models|物理模型參數與量測需可辨識並有邊界。~Physical-model parameters and observations need identifiability and bounds.|用假想一階熱模型擬合合成資料。~Fit synthetic data with an assumed first-order thermal model.|模型能擬合一段資料就保證所有工況準確。~Fitting one segment guarantees all-condition accuracy.
資料同化~Data assimilation|預測與量測融合需依誤差模型賦權。~Prediction-observation fusion weights error models.|比較玩具高噪聲與低噪聲感測權重。~Compare high- and low-noise toy measurement weights.|每個感測器永遠應有相同權重。~Every sensor always needs equal weight.
不確定度~Uncertainty|分身估計不是對真實裝置的完全觀測。~Twin estimates are not complete observations of reality.|對合成熱預測報告範圍與缺測。~Report ranges and missingness in synthetic thermal predictions.|數字分身狀態必然無誤差。~Digital-twin states are necessarily error-free.
預測告警~Predictive alerts|異常閾值需結合模型誤差與行動目的。~Alert thresholds combine model error and intended actions.|用假想殘差比較正常偏移與故障假設。~Compare normal shift and fault hypotheses with toy residuals.|模型殘差非零就證明真實故障。~A nonzero residual proves a real fault.
許可權策略~Permission policies|讀狀態、寫設定與管理策略應分權。~Reading state, writing settings and managing policy are separated.|在玩具 API 圖分開三類角色許可權。~Separate three roles on a toy API diagram.|可以讀數值就應該能修改裝置設定。~Reading values should permit modifying device settings.
命令安全~Command safety|數字命令還需裝置端正式聯鎖與驗證。~Digital commands still need formal device-side interlocks.|只以離線狀態圖檢查命令拒絕條件。~Inspect rejection conditions on offline state diagrams only.|平臺授權成功就可略過裝置端聯鎖。~Platform authorization permits skipping device interlocks.
版本演化~Version evolution|新模型與舊裝置資料需有相容策略。~New models and old-device data need compatibility strategies.|比較玩具 schema v1 與 v2 的轉換。~Compare conversions between toy schema versions.|增添欄位永遠不會影響舊消費者。~Adding fields never affects old consumers.
分身驗收~Twin acceptance|驗收需量測陳舊度、一致性與預測誤差。~Acceptance measures staleness, consistency and prediction errors.|用合成亂序與缺測測試完整鏈。~Test the chain with synthetic reordering and missingness.|3D 外觀真實就代表模型與物理一致。~Realistic 3D appearance proves physical consistency.
''',[(381,'皆需比較預測、觀測與漂移~Both compare predictions, observations and drift','分身另須連線實體狀態與許可權~Twins additionally connect entity states and permissions'),(390,'兩者都結合模型與測量資料~Both combine models and observations','天氣模擬處理空間 PDE，分身可為單裝置~Weather solves spatial PDEs; twins may represent one device')],'eclipse','Eclipse Ditto 將分身資料與政策分成服務；本課重點是狀態語意與一致性，非真實工業裝置操作。~Eclipse Ditto separates twin data and policies into services; this course studies semantics and consistency, not real industrial-device operation.')

add(386,'投影、瓦片矩陣與空間服務一致性~Projections, tile matrices and spatial-service consistency','座標與資料~Coordinates and data|矩陣與瓦片~Matrices and tiles|服務與快取~Service and caches|質量與驗收~Quality and acceptance','wmts tiles',
'常見四叉樹每升一級瓦片數乘 4；z=10 有 4¹⁰=1048576 個全球格。若每格假想 40 kB，完整一級需 41.94 GB 十進位，空海與未覆蓋區域可能不需存。此是特定矩陣模型，不適用所有 CRS。~A common quadtree multiplies tile count by four per zoom; z10 has 1,048,576 global cells. At assumed 40 kB/cell that is 41.94 decimal GB before sparse coverage; the model is specific, not universal to all CRS.', '''
座標系統~Coordinate systems|經緯度與投影平面座標有不同單位與軸序。~Longitude/latitude and projected coordinates differ in units and axes.|對公開城市代表點記錄 CRS 與軸序。~Record CRS and axis order for public city reference points.|兩列數值永遠依經度緯度排列。~Two numbers always mean longitude then latitude.
投影變形~Projection distortion|投影不能同時保留所有面積、角度和距離。~A projection cannot preserve all areas, angles and distances.|比較玩具高低緯度範圍的尺度。~Compare scales across toy low/high latitudes.|地圖平面每公分永遠代表相同地面距離。~Every map centimeter always has equal ground distance.
資料範圍~Data extent|包圍盒與可用範圍限制可請求資料。~Bounding boxes and available extents limit requests.|給自製小地圖示示有效與空白範圍。~Mark valid and empty areas on a self-made map.|全球地圖架構表示每個位置都有資料。~A global map architecture implies data everywhere.
授權來源~Licensed sources|瓦片展示與離線大量儲存可能需不同授權。~Tile display and bulk offline storage may need different rights.|區分自製瓦片與官方地圖外部連結。~Separate self-made tiles from official map links.|可在瀏覽器看到就可無限抓取。~Browser visibility permits unlimited scraping.
矩陣定義~Matrix definitions|tileMatrixSet 定義 CRS、格寬、高度和原點。~Tile matrix sets define CRS, grid size and origin.|手畫兩層玩具格網及索引。~Draw two toy matrix levels and indices.|所有地圖服務都用同一瓦片原點。~All map services share one tile origin.
縮放級別~Zoom levels|每層解析度與格數量由矩陣規則決定。~Matrix rules set resolution and cell counts per level.|重算本課 z10 數量及下一層比例。~Recalculate z10 counts and the next-level ratio.|每增加 zoom 瓦片數僅加一。~Each zoom increase adds only one tile.
行列方向~Row/column direction|XYZ 與其他約定可能有不同 Y 方向。~XYZ and other conventions may use different Y directions.|在四格玩具地圖比較行號翻轉。~Compare row flips on a four-cell toy map.|相同行號一定對應同一地理格。~Equal rows always identify equal geographic cells.
柵格與向量~Raster and vector|柵格儲存畫素，向量儲存幾何與屬性。~Raster stores pixels; vector stores geometry and attributes.|以自製道路畫出兩種瓦片表示。~Render self-made roads in both tile forms.|向量瓦片只是無壓縮照片。~Vector tiles are uncompressed photographs.
邊界裁切~Boundary clipping|跨瓦片幾何需處理裁切及邊界連續性。~Cross-tile geometry needs clipping and continuity handling.|讓自製道路跨邊界並檢查接縫。~Check seams where self-made roads cross tiles.|各瓦片獨立正確就保證接縫連續。~Individually correct tiles guarantee seamless joins.
細節層次~Levels of detail|簡化幾何需平衡尺寸與拓撲保持。~Geometry simplification trades size against topology.|比較玩具曲線簡化前後交叉關係。~Compare crossings before and after toy curve simplification.|減少頂點永不改變拓撲。~Removing vertices never changes topology.
快取版本~Cache versions|相同 tile 地址可能因資料版而內容不同。~One tile address may differ across data revisions.|把自製地圖版本納入快取鍵。~Include self-made map revisions in cache keys.|只以 z/x/y 快取就永遠沒有舊資料。~Caching only z/x/y never serves stale data.
請求併發~Request concurrency|併發與視窗移動會產生取消和重複請求。~Concurrency and viewport movement create cancellations and duplicates.|以玩具請求表比較取消與繼續傳輸。~Compare cancellation and continued transfers in a toy table.|所有移出視窗請求都必須繼續下載。~All offscreen requests must continue downloading.
空間索引~Spatial indexes|包圍盒索引是候選篩選，不保證精確相交。~Bounding-box indexes filter candidates, not exact intersections.|畫兩項包圍盒重疊但幾何不交的例。~Draw overlapping boxes whose geometries do not intersect.|包圍盒相交就證明實體幾何相交。~Bounding-box intersection proves geometry intersection.
完整性質量~Completeness quality|缺測、不同時點與精度需在圖例中註明。~Missingness, dates and accuracy are disclosed in legends.|對自製地圖示註資料日期與未知區。~Label dates and unknown regions on a self-made map.|地圖色塊精細代表資料必然新鮮。~Detailed color blocks imply fresh data.
傳輸預算~Transfer budgets|瓦片大小、視窗覆蓋與快取命中決定流量。~Tile size, viewport coverage and cache hits set traffic.|比較假想冷啟動與快取命中流量。~Compare fictional cold-start and cached traffic.|全球資料容量就是每次看圖下載量。~Global data size equals each viewing download.
跨平臺驗收~Cross-platform acceptance|觸控、鍵盤、縮放與 CRS 需共同驗證。~Touch, keyboard, zoom and CRS are validated together.|以自製瓦片規劃多螢幕離線測試。~Plan multiscreen offline tests with self-made tiles.|桌面可看地圖就證明所有手機體驗正確。~Desktop visibility proves every mobile experience correct.
''',[(385,'空間資料可為分身提供位置語意~Spatial data can locate twin entities','地圖瓦片不保證裝置即時狀態~Tiles do not guarantee real-time device state'),(387,'共同處理視窗、細節層次與快取~Both handle viewports, detail levels and caches','GIS 需地理 CRS，渲染常用區域性世界座標~GIS needs geographic CRS; rendering often uses local world coordinates')],'ogc','OGC 將格網定義、請求介面與資料範圍標準化；課程製作自己的瓦片，不重製商業地圖。~OGC standardizes grids, requests and extents; the course creates its own tiles rather than reproducing commercial maps.')

add(387,'幾何變換、光照與 GPU 管線同步~Geometry transforms, lighting and GPU pipeline synchronization','座標與取樣~Coordinates and sampling|管線與光照~Pipelines and lighting|資源與同步~Resources and synchronization|效能與驗證~Performance and validation','vulkan sync',
'假想 1920×1080 RGBA8 單幀為 8294400 bytes，雙緩衝 16.59 MB 十進位；若每秒重寫 60 幀，原始顏色寫量約 0.498 GB/s。不含深度、MSAA、紋理讀取或壓縮，不能當作總 GPU 頻寬。~A synthetic 1920×1080 RGBA8 frame is 8,294,400 bytes; two buffers use 16.59 decimal MB. At 60 writes/s, raw color writes are about 0.498 GB/s, excluding depth, MSAA, texture reads and compression.', '''
世界座標~World coordinates|模型、世界、檢視與投影座標各有變換。~Model, world, view and projection coordinates have separate transforms.|手算自製點透過兩次平移與旋轉。~Transform a self-made point through translations and rotations.|變換矩陣可隨意交換順序。~Transform matrices may be reordered freely.
齊次表示~Homogeneous coordinates|齊次座標把平移納入矩陣乘法。~Homogeneous coordinates express translation as matrix multiplication.|對玩具點比較 w=1 與方向 w=0。~Compare a toy point w1 and direction w0.|點與方向的齊次 w 永遠相同。~Points and directions always have equal homogeneous w.
投影除法~Perspective divide|透視除法決定深度相關的投影尺寸。~Perspective division creates depth-dependent image scale.|比較同大小物體不同深度的投影。~Compare equal objects at different depths.|透視投影中遠近物體一定相同畫素大小。~Perspective gives equal pixel sizes at all depths.
取樣與別名~Sampling and aliasing|畫素取樣無法保留任意高頻幾何。~Pixel sampling cannot preserve arbitrary geometric frequencies.|渲染自製密集線條比較抗鋸齒。~Compare antialiasing on self-made dense lines.|提高幀率就能消除所有空間鋸齒。~Higher frame rates remove all spatial aliasing.
頂點處理~Vertex processing|頂點階段變換屬性併為光柵化準備圖元。~Vertex stages transform attributes for rasterization.|畫自製三角形頂點到螢幕的路徑。~Trace self-made triangle vertices to screen.|頂點階段必須處理每個最終畫素。~The vertex stage processes every final pixel.
光柵插值~Raster interpolation|重心座標與透視修正決定屬性插值。~Barycentric coordinates and perspective correction interpolate attributes.|比較玩具傾斜面紋理的兩種插值。~Compare texture interpolation on a toy tilted plane.|螢幕線性插值永遠等於三維正確插值。~Screen-linear interpolation is always 3D-correct.
深度判斷~Depth testing|深度範圍與精度影響遮擋及 z-fighting。~Depth range and precision affect occlusion and z-fighting.|比較玩具近遠裁面對深度量化。~Compare depth quantization with toy clip planes.|增大遠近範圍不影響深度精度。~Wider depth ranges never affect precision.
材質與光~Materials and light|BRDF 及光強共同決定表面出射輻射。~BRDF and illumination determine outgoing surface radiance.|在自製球面比較粗糙與光滑假設。~Compare rough and smooth assumptions on a self-made sphere.|物體顏色與照明完全無關。~Object color is independent of lighting.
紋理過濾~Texture filtering|mipmap 與過濾限制縮小取樣的混疊。~Mipmaps and filtering reduce minification aliasing.|比較自製棋盤紋理的縮圖結果。~Compare minified self-made checkerboard textures.|最近鄰取樣對所有縮放最準確。~Nearest-neighbor sampling is most accurate for every scale.
顏色空間~Color spaces|sRGB 編碼值與線性光強不能直接混算。~sRGB code values and linear intensities are not interchangeable.|比較玩具顏色線上性與編碼空間混合。~Compare mixing in linear and encoded color spaces.|平均編碼 RGB 就總是物理亮度平均。~Averaging encoded RGB always averages physical intensity.
資源生命週期~Resource lifetimes|GPU 尚在讀取時不能任意重用資源。~Resources cannot be reused arbitrarily while GPUs read them.|畫兩幀緩衝使用與回收時間線。~Draw two-frame resource use and reuse timelines.|CPU 函式返回代表 GPU 已用完資源。~CPU return means the GPU has finished resources.
執行同步~Execution synchronization|提交順序與執行完成是不同狀態。~Submission order and execution completion differ.|在玩具佇列標出等待與執行依賴。~Mark waits and execution dependencies in toy queues.|先提交永遠等於先完成。~Earlier submission always means earlier completion.
記憶體可見~Memory visibility|同步還需讓寫入對後續讀取可見。~Synchronization also makes writes visible to later reads.|畫計算寫紋理與圖形讀紋理的屏障。~Draw a barrier from compute writes to graphics reads.|只等待時間就自動保證所有記憶體可見。~Waiting alone guarantees every memory write visible.
頻寬預算~Bandwidth budgets|顏色、深度、紋理及多重取樣共同佔頻寬。~Color, depth, textures and multisampling share bandwidth.|重算本課顏色寫量並列未包含項。~Recalculate color writes and list omissions.|顏色緩衝寫量就是全部 GPU 流量。~Color-buffer writes equal all GPU traffic.
幀時間分解~Frame-time decomposition|CPU、GPU 與呈現延遲需分開量測。~CPU, GPU and presentation delays are timed separately.|比較假想 CPU-bound 與 GPU-bound 幀圖。~Compare hypothetical CPU-bound and GPU-bound frames.|平均 FPS 完全描述所有卡頓。~Average FPS describes every stutter.
渲染驗收~Rendering acceptance|驗收包含幾何、數值、資源與輸入互動。~Acceptance includes geometry, numerics, resources and interaction.|對自製場景列截圖比較與壓力情境。~Define screenshot comparisons and stress cases for self-made scenes.|畫面能出現就代表同步無誤。~A visible frame proves correct synchronization.
''',[(384,'共同處理取樣與座標轉換~Both handle sampling and coordinates','渲染生成影像，機器視覺估計物理屬性~Rendering generates images; vision estimates properties'),(392,'GPU 工作需理解計算與記憶體階層~GPU work needs compute and memory hierarchy','渲染有圖形管線，超算多為數值核心~Rendering has graphics stages; HPC mainly uses numerical kernels')],'khronos','Vulkan 明確分開執行與記憶體依賴；課程用自製三角形和波形呈現原理，不復制官方圖。~Vulkan separates execution and memory dependencies; original triangles and timelines explain principles without copying official figures.')

add(388,'資源分配、佇列政策與科學工作重現~Resource allocation, queue policies and scientific reproducibility','工作與資源~Jobs and resources|佇列與分配~Queues and allocation|執行與恢復~Execution and recovery|計量與驗證~Accounting and validation','slurm sbatch',
'假想作業用 8 節點、每節點 32 core、執行 2 小時，計量為 16 node-hours 與 512 core-hours。若 40% 時間等待通訊，不可直接說有效工作只有 307.2 core-hours；等待也佔分配資源，利用率需額外量測。~An eight-node, 32-core/node job running two hours consumes 16 node-hours and 512 core-hours. Communication waiting still occupies allocated resources; measured utilization cannot be inferred merely by subtracting wait fractions.', '''
工作邊界~Job boundaries|任務、工作步驟與資源分配是不同實體。~Tasks, job steps and allocations are distinct entities.|畫玩具作業包含兩種步驟的結構。~Draw a toy job with two step types.|一份指令碼就等於一個 CPU 任務。~One script equals one CPU task.
資源宣告~Resource declarations|core、記憶體、GPU 與時限需匹配工作需要。~Cores, memory, GPUs and time limits match workload needs.|為玩具矩陣運算列資源假設。~Specify resources for a toy matrix workload.|申請最多資源總是最快且最佳。~Requesting maximum resources is always best.
分割槽政策~Partition policies|佇列限制依資源、使用者與服務目的而異。~Queues constrain resources, users and service purposes.|比較假想短作業與長作業分割槽。~Compare fictional short- and long-job partitions.|所有分割槽都只有名字不同。~All partitions differ only by name.
身份與計費~Identity and accounting|科學賬戶許可權與資源計量需可追溯。~Scientific accounts and usage accounting need traceability.|對匿名玩具賬戶追蹤 node-hours。~Track node-hours for anonymous toy accounts.|能讀資料就擁有計算分割槽管理權。~Reading data grants partition administration.
優先序~Priority|年齡、配額與政策共同決定排序。~Age, quotas and policy jointly set priority.|用三個玩具作業比較不同排序規則。~Compare scheduling rules for three toy jobs.|提交最早者在所有政策下一定先執行。~The earliest submission always runs first.
回填排程~Backfill scheduling|小工作可在不延遲已保留工作前回填空隙。~Small jobs can fill gaps without delaying reservations.|在紙上時間表放入一個短工作。~Place a short job into a paper schedule gap.|回填總允許無限延遲大工作。~Backfill always permits indefinitely delaying large jobs.
拓撲分配~Topology allocation|節點網路距離可能影響通訊成本。~Network distance can affect communication cost.|比較玩具近鄰與分散節點配置。~Compare neighboring and scattered toy nodes.|節點數量相同就通訊成本完全相同。~Equal node counts imply equal communication costs.
可搶佔性~Preemptibility|搶佔需考慮儲存、恢復與重複計算成本。~Preemption accounts for saving, restoring and repeated work.|對假想 checkpoint 作業比較兩次搶佔。~Compare two preemptions for a hypothetical checkpointed job.|終止後再啟動一定無需任何恢復。~Restarting always needs no recovery.
任務繫結~Task binding|程序與執行緒繫結至 CPU 核心／NUMA 節點會影響共享與記憶體局部性。~Binding processes and threads to CPU cores/NUMA nodes affects sharing and memory locality.|畫玩具兩插槽執行緒與資料位置。~Map threads and data on two toy sockets.|執行緒在哪個插槽都不影響記憶體存取。~Thread sockets never affect memory access.
環境版本~Environment versions|編譯器、庫與輸入必須固定以重現。~Compilers, libraries and inputs are pinned for reproduction.|輸出玩具環境版本與輸入摘要。~Record toy environment versions and input digests.|指令碼相同就保證所有版本結果相同。~Equal scripts guarantee equal results across versions.
輸出儲存~Output persistence|計算節點暫存不等於長期產物儲存。~Node temporary storage is not durable artifact storage.|畫玩具作業結束後資料遷移路徑。~Draw data persistence after a toy job ends.|程式成功退出即保證輸出永遠存在。~Successful exit guarantees permanent outputs.
檢查點~Checkpoints|檢查點頻率權衡儲存時間與故障重算。~Checkpoint frequency trades writing time against repeated work.|在假想故障時間線比較兩種間隔。~Compare two intervals on a fictional failure timeline.|檢查點越頻繁一定越快。~More frequent checkpoints always run faster.
排隊時間~Queue time|工作等待與執行耗時需要分別報告。~Waiting and execution times are reported separately.|比較玩具短執行長等待的總週轉。~Compare short run/long wait total turnaround.|執行更快就必然總週轉更短。~Faster execution always shortens turnaround.
資源計量~Resource accounting|node-hours 與 core-hours 是分配時間計量。~Node-hours and core-hours measure allocated time.|重算本課兩種用量並分開利用率。~Recalculate both usage measures separately from utilization.|資源計量直接等於有用科學計算量。~Resource accounting equals useful scientific work.
故障分類~Failure classes|資源不足、環境與數值失敗需分開。~Resource, environment and numerical failures differ.|給自製模擬報告分類錯誤原因。~Classify errors in self-made simulated reports.|所有失敗都應靠增加節點解決。~More nodes solve every failure.
交付驗證~Delivery validation|科學交付需包含結果、環境與資源證據。~Scientific delivery includes results, environments and resource evidence.|讓同學重算一個本地小作業。~Have a peer reproduce one small local job.|擁有超算賬號就是正確科學結果證明。~A supercomputer account proves correct science.
''',[(389,'MPI 作業需資源繫結與執行環境~MPI jobs need placement and execution environments','排程決定何時與何處，MPI 決定通訊語意~Scheduling chooses when/where; MPI defines communication'),(392,'共同分析節點、拓撲與資源成本~Both analyze nodes, topology and resource costs','Frontier 另需異質 CPU/GPU 資料路徑~Frontier adds heterogeneous CPU/GPU data paths')],'ornl','Slurm 分開資源分配、工作啟動和佇列管理；所有練習是本地時間表，不登入真實超算。~Slurm separates allocation, job launch and queue management; exercises are local schedules, not real supercomputer access.')

add(389,'域分解、訊息語意與數值平行驗證~Domain decomposition, message semantics and numerical parallel validation','問題與分解~Problems and decomposition|訊息與集合~Messages and collectives|數值與效能~Numerics and performance|恢復與驗證~Recovery and validation','mpi ompitcp',
'玩具 3D 網格每子域邊長 L，體點 L³、單層六面 halo≈6L²，通訊體積比≈6/L。L=32 得 0.1875，L=64 得 0.09375；未含邊角、重疊與協議頭，不等於通訊時間比例。~For a toy cubic subdomain, L3 interior cells and roughly 6L2 one-layer halo cells give volume ratio 6/L: 0.1875 at L32 and 0.09375 at L64, excluding edges, overlap and framing; not a time fraction.', '''
域分解~Domain decomposition|空間分塊決定計算與跨塊依賴。~Spatial partitioning defines compute and interblock dependencies.|把自製二維格網分為四塊。~Partition a self-made 2D grid into four blocks.|分塊越細就無條件降低總耗時。~Finer blocks always reduce total runtime.
程序與執行緒~Processes and threads|MPI rank 與執行緒在地址空間與通訊上不同。~MPI ranks and threads differ in address spaces and communication.|畫兩 rank 各兩執行緒的資料所有權。~Draw data ownership for two ranks with two threads each.|不同 rank 自動共享同一普通陣列。~Different ranks automatically share ordinary arrays.
Communicator~Communicators|通訊域隔離訊息集合並定義 rank 身份。~Communicators isolate message groups and rank identities.|比較同程序在兩個玩具群組的 rank。~Compare one process’s ranks in two toy groups.|rank 編號在任何通訊域中都不變。~Ranks never change across communicators.
邊界條件~Boundary conditions|物理邊界與子域內部邊界處理不同。~Physical and interdomain boundaries are handled differently.|標示玩具擴散格網的兩種邊界。~Mark both boundary types on a toy diffusion grid.|所有子域邊界都應設零值。~Every subdomain boundary should be zero.
傳送匹配~Message matching|來源、tag 與 communicator 決定訊息匹配。~Source, tag and communicator determine matching.|手配三個玩具傳送與接收記錄。~Match three toy send/receive records.|訊息只按到達時間匹配。~Messages match only by arrival time.
阻塞語意~Blocking semantics|傳送返回與對端完成接收不總是同一事件。~Send return and receiver completion need not coincide.|畫不同假想緩衝策略的時間線。~Draw timelines for hypothetical buffer strategies.|阻塞傳送返回就代表對端完成整個計算。~Blocking send return means the peer finished all computation.
非阻塞完成~Nonblocking completion|非阻塞返回後緩衝仍可能被通訊使用。~Buffers may remain in use after nonblocking calls return.|在玩具時間線標出等待完成後重用。~Mark buffer reuse only after completion on a toy timeline.|非阻塞呼叫返回即可覆寫所有傳送緩衝。~Nonblocking return permits overwriting every send buffer.
halo 交換~Halo exchange|鄰接資料讓區域性 stencil 正確讀取邊界。~Neighbor data lets local stencils read boundaries correctly.|手算玩具 stencil 有無 halo 的誤差。~Calculate toy stencil errors with and without halos.|每 rank 只用自己的內點就完全正確。~Each rank needs only its interior cells.
集合順序~Collective order|同通訊域參與者需遵循相容集合呼叫順序。~Communicator members need compatible collective order.|對紙上執行圖找錯序與缺席。~Find ordering and participation errors in a paper trace.|各 rank 可隨意改集合呼叫順序。~Ranks may arbitrarily reorder collectives.
規約數值~Reduction numerics|浮點加法非結合性使規約順序影響末位。~Nonassociative floating addition makes reduction order affect low bits.|用大數、小數與負大數比較兩種次序。~Compare two orders with large, small and negative-large values.|浮點規約在任意 rank 數都逐位元相同。~Floating reductions are bitwise equal for all rank counts.
負載平衡~Load balance|最慢 rank 常限制同步階段時間。~The slowest rank often bounds synchronous phases.|比較不均分玩具單元與加權分割槽。~Compare unequal toy cells with weighted partitions.|所有 rank 單元數相同保證成本相同。~Equal cell counts guarantee equal cost.
通訊重疊~Communication overlap|重疊需有獨立工作與實際進度支援。~Overlap needs independent work and actual communication progress.|畫內點計算與 halo 傳輸的依賴。~Draw dependencies between interior work and halo transfer.|呼叫非阻塞 API 就自動完全重疊。~Nonblocking APIs guarantee complete overlap.
強弱擴展~Strong/weak scaling|固定總問題與固定每 rank 問題是不同測試。~Fixed total and per-rank problem sizes are different tests.|用合成時間表分別計算兩種效率。~Calculate both efficiencies from synthetic timings.|弱擴展結果可直接當強擴展加速。~Weak-scaling results directly give strong-scaling speedup.
表面積效應~Surface effects|halo 對體積比例隨區域性尺度縮小而增大。~Halo-to-volume ratio grows as local domains shrink.|重算本課 L32 與 L64 的比值。~Recalculate ratios for L32 and L64.|通訊量與區域性網格邊長無關。~Communication is independent of local side length.
檢查點一致~Checkpoint consistency|檢查點需保留跨 rank 的相容狀態。~Checkpoints preserve compatible cross-rank states.|對玩具步驟編號找不一致儲存。~Find inconsistent saved steps in a toy run.|每 rank 任意時刻各自存檔就能正確恢復。~Arbitrary independent rank saves always restore correctly.
結果驗證~Result validation|平行結果需對照序列、小規模與守恆約束。~Parallel results compare with serial, small-scale and conserved constraints.|重算自製小擴散網格的質量與誤差。~Recalculate mass and errors on a self-made diffusion grid.|能用更多 rank 就證明結果更準確。~More ranks prove more accurate results.
''',[(388,'都需正確任務繫結與環境版本~Both need correct placement and environment versions','MPI 的訊息正確性不是排程器的保證~Schedulers do not guarantee MPI message correctness'),(390,'天氣域分解也需 halo 與規約~Weather decomposition also needs halos and reductions','天氣有物理參數化與資料同化約束~Weather adds parameterizations and assimilation constraints')],'ornl','MPI 定義通訊語意而非單一網路速度；課程從小格網驗證數值與訊息，再分析擴展性。~MPI defines communication semantics, not one network speed; small grids validate numerics and messages before scaling analysis.')

add(390,'流體 PDE、資料同化與集合預報~Fluid PDEs, data assimilation and ensemble forecasts','方程與觀測~Equations and observations|離散與同化~Discretization and assimilation|計算與集合~Computing and ensembles|驗證與不確定~Verification and uncertainty','ifs forecast mpi',
'一維玩具平流速度 u=20 m/s、網距 Δx=1000 m，顯式格式取 CFL=uΔt/Δx≤0.8 得 Δt≤40 s。若網距減半而同 CFL，時間步須 ≤20 s；真實 IFS 可能用其他格式，本例不代表其執行配置。~For a toy explicit 1D advection scheme with speed 20 m/s and spacing 1,000 m, CFL≤0.8 gives dt≤40 s. Halving spacing gives dt≤20 s at the same CFL; this does not represent operational IFS settings.', '''
預報邊界~Forecast boundaries|預測變數、空間域與時距定義任務。~Variables, domain and lead time define the task.|指定玩具溫度場的範圍與預報時段。~Define a toy temperature field and forecast window.|天氣模式能無條件預測任意時距。~Weather models forecast arbitrary lead times unconditionally.
守恆方程~Conservation laws|質量、動量與能量約束天氣狀態演化。~Mass, momentum and energy constrain atmospheric evolution.|寫出玩具平流與擴散的守恆檢查。~Write conservation checks for toy advection and diffusion.|高解析度自動保證守恆。~High resolution automatically guarantees conservation.
尺度分離~Scale separation|網格無法顯式解析全部雲與湍流尺度。~Grids cannot explicitly resolve every cloud and turbulence scale.|對玩具尺度圖示出解析與參數化區。~Mark resolved and parameterized scales on a toy diagram.|所有物理過程都直接在每格算清楚。~Every physical process is resolved in each cell.
觀測誤差~Observation errors|儀器、代表性與時空取樣共同影響誤差。~Instrument, representation and sampling affect errors.|比較合成點測量與格平均溫度。~Compare synthetic point and grid-mean temperatures.|儀器精度高就沒有代表性誤差。~Precise instruments eliminate representation error.
離散誤差~Discretization error|時間空間格式帶截斷誤差與穩定限制。~Time/space schemes introduce truncation errors and stability limits.|比較玩具一階與二階平流誤差。~Compare toy first- and second-order advection errors.|網格誤差只由浮點位寬決定。~Grid errors depend only on floating-point width.
CFL 條件~CFL conditions|顯式平流穩定受傳播距離與網距比限制。~Explicit advection stability constrains travel distance relative to grid size.|重算本課 Δt 與減半網距情境。~Recalculate example time steps after halving spacing.|網距減半可以保持任意原時間步。~Halving spacing permits any original time step.
背景與創新~Background and innovations|同化創新為觀測與背景在觀測空間的差。~Assimilation innovations compare observations and background in observation space.|對玩具線性 H 計算 y−Hx。~Compute y−Hx for a toy linear H.|創新就是觀測減任意模型格點。~Innovation is observation minus any grid value.
誤差權重~Error weighting|背景和觀測誤差協方差決定融合權重。~Background and observation covariance determine fusion weights.|手算一維兩方差下的加權平均。~Calculate one-dimensional fusion for two variances.|最接近當前均值的觀測必然權重最大。~The observation nearest the current mean always has greatest weight.
參數化耦合~Parameterization coupling|輻射、雲與地表交換互相影響。~Radiation, clouds and surface exchange interact.|畫玩具能量收支的耦合方向。~Draw couplings in a toy energy budget.|各參數化可獨立改變且不影響其他過程。~Parameterizations change independently without interactions.
域分解~Domain decomposition|網格與譜空間變換可能需要不同通訊。~Grid and spectral transforms can need different communication patterns.|比較玩具近鄰與全域性轉置資料流。~Compare toy neighbor and global-transpose flows.|所有天氣計算都只有最近鄰通訊。~All weather computation uses only nearest neighbors.
集合擾動~Ensemble perturbations|集合取樣初始與模型不確定，而不是重複相同執行。~Ensembles sample initial/model uncertainty rather than identical reruns.|用玩具初值擾動生成三條軌跡。~Generate three trajectories from perturbed toy initial states.|執行同一模型十次必然形成有意義集合。~Ten identical runs form a meaningful ensemble.
誤差增長~Error growth|非線性動態使小初始差異隨時距變化。~Nonlinear dynamics evolve small initial differences with lead time.|比較玩具短長時段軌跡分離。~Compare toy short/long-horizon trajectory separation.|雙精度可以完全消除天氣不確定。~Double precision removes all weather uncertainty.
確定性驗證~Deterministic verification|均方誤差、偏差與區域平均衡量不同屬性。~RMSE, bias and regional means measure different properties.|手算合成預報場的誤差與偏差。~Calculate errors and bias of synthetic forecasts.|零平均偏差就表示每格預測正確。~Zero mean bias means every grid prediction is correct.
機率驗證~Probabilistic verification|機率預報需校準與辨別力而非單次命中。~Probabilistic forecasts need calibration and discrimination, not one hit.|對合成事件頻率檢查機率分箱。~Check probability bins against synthetic event frequencies.|一次 80% 預報未發生就證明模型錯誤。~One failed 80% event proves the model wrong.
資料版本~Data versions|觀測、同化與模式迴圈版本需連結。~Observation, assimilation and model-cycle versions are linked.|為玩具預測記錄完整輸入和配置。~Record complete toy forecast inputs and configuration.|同日期預測都用了完全相同觀測。~All forecasts on one date use identical observations.
釋出範圍~Release scope|科教模型不提供實際天氣災害決策保證。~Educational models give no operational hazard-decision guarantee.|標註玩具預報誤差與未驗證範圍。~Label toy forecast errors and unvalidated scope.|完成模擬便有正式災害預報資格。~Completing a simulation qualifies operational hazard forecasts.
''',[(389,'同用域分解、halo 與數值驗證~Both use domain decomposition, halos and numerical checks','天氣模式還需同化和集合不確定性~Weather adds assimilation and ensemble uncertainty'),(385,'皆融合模型與觀測資料~Both fuse models with observations','天氣具有全球空間耦合與多尺度物理~Weather has global spatial coupling and multiscale physics')],'ecmwf','ECMWF 的 IFS 檔案分列動態、同化與物理；玩具 CFL 例是作者假設，不冒充業務模式設定。~ECMWF IFS documents distinguish dynamics, assimilation and physics; the toy CFL calculation is not an operational configuration.')

add(391,'分層科學資料處理與跨機構計算~Tiered scientific processing and interinstitutional computing','實驗與資料~Experiments and data|分層與分佈~Tiers and distribution|計算與流量~Computing and transfers|驗證與重現~Verification and reproduction','wlcg lhccompute',
'假想 1 PB 十進位資料需經穩定 10 Gbit/s 鏈路傳輸，理想下限 10¹⁵×8/10¹⁰=800000 s，約 9.26 天。協議、排隊、故障與複製會增加時間；不代表 WLCG 實際資料率。~One synthetic decimal PB over a sustained 10-Gbit/s link has ideal minimum 800,000 s or 9.26 days. Protocols, queues, failures and replication add time; this is not an actual WLCG data rate.', '''
科學鏈路~Scientific chains|探測器資料、重建與分析有不同產物。~Detector data, reconstruction and analysis produce different artifacts.|畫玩具事件從原始到摘要的路徑。~Trace toy events from raw data to summaries.|最終圖表就是全部原始實驗資料。~Final plots contain all raw experimental data.
事件身份~Event identity|事件與資料集版本需穩定可追蹤。~Events and dataset versions need stable traceability.|給自製事件表賦唯一 ID 與處理版本。~Assign IDs and processing versions to self-made events.|檔名變化就代表新的物理事件。~A changed filename means a new physical event.
公開邊界~Public boundaries|開放科教資料與合作內部資料許可權不同。~Open educational and internal collaboration data have different permissions.|只以自行生成或明確開放資料做練習。~Practice only with self-generated or explicitly open data.|科學合作存在就表示所有資料可公開。~Scientific collaboration makes all data public.
探測器校正~Detector calibration|重建輸出依賴校正與條件資料。~Reconstruction depends on calibration and conditions data.|讓同一玩具事件用兩套校正比較。~Compare one toy event under two calibrations.|原始資料不變就保證重建結果不變。~Unchanged raw data guarantees unchanged reconstruction.
Tier-0 角色~Tier-0 roles|中心接收與初期處理有特定資料責任。~Central reception and initial processing have defined responsibilities.|標示公開架構中的中心角色。~Mark central roles in the public architecture.|Tier 編號表示資料真實性排名。~Tier numbers rank data truthfulness.
Tier-1 角色~Tier-1 roles|大型中心負責長期資料與再處理能力。~Major centers support durable data and reprocessing capacity.|畫玩具複製與再處理流程。~Draw toy replication and reprocessing flows.|Tier-1 僅儲存無用備份。~Tier-1 centers hold only useless backups.
Tier-2 角色~Tier-2 roles|分散站點貢獻模擬與分析資源。~Distributed sites contribute simulation and analysis resources.|為玩具分析配置資料與計算位置。~Place toy analysis data and computation.|Tier-2 在所有任務都比中心功能相同。~Tier-2 sites duplicate every central function.
跨域身份~Cross-domain identity|跨機構任務需認證、授權與可稽核身份。~Cross-institution jobs need authentication, authorization and audit identities.|畫匿名角色訪問不同假想站點的矩陣。~Map anonymous roles to fictional site privileges.|一機構賬號自動有所有機構管理許可權。~One institutional account grants all-site administration.
工作負載~Workloads|事件模擬與分析可呈不同 I/O 和 CPU 比例。~Simulation and analysis have different I/O-to-CPU ratios.|比較兩種自製合成事件任務。~Compare two self-made synthetic event tasks.|所有科學任務都只受 CPU 限制。~All scientific tasks are CPU-bound.
資料局部性~Data locality|將計算移向資料可減少重複跨站傳輸。~Moving compute toward data can reduce repeated transfers.|比較玩具下載再算與近資料計算。~Compare toy download-then-compute with near-data work.|資料局部性完全不影響科學計算時間。~Data locality cannot affect scientific runtimes.
傳輸完整~Transfer integrity|跨站複製需核對物件摘要和版本。~Inter-site copies verify object digests and revisions.|複製自製小檔案並比較摘要與 manifest。~Copy self-made files and verify digests and manifests.|傳輸成功狀態證明內容與版本都正確。~Transfer success proves correct content and versions.
頻寬下限~Bandwidth bounds|資料量除以持續有效頻寬只給理想下限。~Volume divided by sustained bandwidth gives only an ideal lower bound.|重算本課 PB 傳輸的秒與天。~Recalculate PB-transfer seconds and days.|鏈路標稱頻寬就保證端到端達到。~Rated link bandwidth guarantees end-to-end throughput.
複製策略~Replication policies|多副本提高可用性但增加儲存與流量。~Replicas improve availability but add storage and transfers.|在三假想站點圖分析共同故障域。~Analyze shared failure domains across three fictional sites.|副本三份就必然沒有共同故障。~Three replicas necessarily have no shared failures.
可重現環境~Reproducible environments|程式、校正與輸入版本需同時固定。~Code, calibration and input versions are pinned together.|為玩具事件分析儲存環境清單。~Record environments for toy event analysis.|只儲存容器名字就完整固定所有輸入。~A container name pins every input.
結果交查~Result cross-checks|獨立分析路徑可檢驗選擇與校正偏差。~Independent analysis paths check selection and calibration biases.|比較同一合成事件的兩種過濾規則。~Compare filtering rules on one synthetic event set.|兩張圖相似就說明分析完全獨立。~Similar plots prove fully independent analyses.
科學交付~Scientific delivery|交付應含資料範圍、統計誤差和處理版本。~Delivery includes data scope, statistical errors and processing versions.|讓同學重現自製事件直方圖。~Have a peer reproduce self-made event histograms.|使用世界級網格保證所有科學結論正確。~Using a world-class grid guarantees correct conclusions.
''',[(389,'科學工作都需平行資料與數值驗證~Scientific work needs parallel data and numerical checks','網格跨機構批次任務不同於緊耦合 MPI~Interinstitutional grid jobs differ from tightly coupled MPI'),(380,'共同需固定資料與處理版本~Both pin data and processing revisions','網格另需跨站授權與複製策略~Grids additionally need intersite permissions and replication')],'cern','WLCG 以分層跨機構資源支援 LHC 科學；課程比較角色而不提供真實站點訪問或管理操作。~WLCG supports LHC science with tiered interinstitutional resources; the course compares roles without real-site access or administration.')

add(392,'Frontier 異質節點、HBM 與通訊拓撲~Frontier heterogeneous nodes, HBM and interconnect topology','任務與節點~Workloads and nodes|資料與運算~Data and compute|通訊與可靠~Communication and reliability|效能與驗證~Performance and validation','frontier frontieroverview mpi',
'假想 kernel 運算強度 I=2 FLOP/byte，持續記憶體頻寬 B=1 TB/s、峰值 P=20 TFLOP/s，則 roofline 上界 min(P,BI)=2 TFLOP/s。I=30 時上界20；這些不是 Frontier 實測值，精度、資料路徑與持續頻寬須另量。~An assumed kernel with intensity 2 FLOP/byte, sustained bandwidth 1 TB/s and peak 20 TFLOP/s has roofline bound 2 TFLOP/s; intensity 30 is bounded by 20. These are not Frontier measurements; precision and data paths must be stated.', '''
異質角色~Heterogeneous roles|Frontier 計算節點結合 EPYC CPU 與 MI250X 加速器。~Frontier compute nodes combine EPYC CPUs and MI250X accelerators.|依官方圖概念重畫自己的功能關係。~Redraw original functional relationships from official descriptions.|Frontier 每節點只有單一 CPU 運算。~Frontier nodes compute only on one CPU type.
邏輯 GPU~Logical GPU units|MI250X 的 GCD 使邏輯裝置計數不同於板級數量。~MI250X GCDs separate logical-device and package counts.|區分假想任務的封裝、GCD 與 rank。~Distinguish packages, GCDs and ranks for a toy task.|四個封裝必然僅能看到四個邏輯裝置。~Four packages necessarily expose four logical devices.
CPU 管理~CPU orchestration|CPU 處理準備、啟動與部分序列工作。~CPUs prepare, launch and handle some serial work.|畫玩具迭代的 CPU/GPU 責任邊界。~Map CPU/GPU responsibilities in a toy iteration.|加入 GPU 就完全不需要 CPU 工作。~Adding GPUs removes all CPU work.
HBM 層次~HBM hierarchy|加速器近端 HBM 與主機記憶體有不同路徑。~Accelerator HBM and host memory have different access paths.|標註玩具陣列在主機與裝置的所在地。~Mark host and device placement of toy arrays.|主機指標總可無成本當本地 HBM 使用。~Host pointers always act as free local HBM.
GPU kernel~GPU kernels|大量執行緒執行需適合資料並行與訪存模式。~Many-thread execution needs data parallelism and suitable access.|比較玩具逐點 stencil 與依賴序列迴圈。~Compare toy point stencils with serial-dependent loops.|所有序列程式碼放上 GPU 就自動加速。~Every serial program accelerates automatically on GPUs.
合併訪存~Coalesced access|鄰近執行緒連續地址可減少訪存事務。~Contiguous addresses across threads can reduce transactions.|畫短陣列連續與跨步訪問模式。~Draw contiguous and strided access on a short array.|訪問相同 byte 數必然有相同頻寬。~Equal byte counts imply equal bandwidth.
暫存器壓力~Register pressure|每執行緒資源使用會限制可駐留執行緒。~Per-thread resources limit resident threads.|比較兩種玩具暫存器預算的佔用。~Compare occupancy for two toy register budgets.|暫存器使用越多併發必然越高。~More registers always increase concurrency.
資料駐留~Data residency|重複裝置端運算可避免每輪主機往返。~Repeated device work can avoid host round trips.|比較玩具十輪每輪搬移與一次駐留。~Compare per-round transfers with one resident toy run.|GPU 很快所以搬移成本可永遠忽略。~Fast GPUs make transfer costs negligible always.
Slingshot 角色~Slingshot roles|節點間 Slingshot 通訊與節點內路徑不同。~Inter-node Slingshot differs from intra-node paths.|把玩具兩節點資料路由分成內外兩層。~Separate intra/inter-node routes for two toy nodes.|所有 GPU 到 GPU 路徑完全等價。~All GPU-to-GPU paths are equivalent.
Rank 對映~Rank mapping|rank 與 GCD、CPU core 繫結影響局部性。~Rank-to-GCD/core binding affects locality.|畫一 rank 對一 GCD 的玩具分配。~Draw a one-rank-per-GCD toy placement.|rank 編號自然就保證最佳硬體繫結。~Rank IDs guarantee optimal hardware placement.
GPU-aware MPI~GPU-aware MPI|裝置緩衝支援不等於所有傳輸都無複製。~Device-buffer support does not mean every transfer is copy-free.|在假想時間線標示可能 staging 路徑。~Mark possible staging paths in a fictional timeline.|GPU-aware 表示任何訊息都零成本。~GPU-aware means every message is cost-free.
數值精度~Numerical precision|FP64、FP32 與低精度有不同誤差和峰值。~FP64, FP32 and low precision differ in errors and peaks.|對玩具規約比較不同位寬誤差。~Compare toy-reduction errors at different widths.|最大 AI 峰值就是 FP64 科學效能。~Maximum AI peak equals FP64 scientific performance.
Roofline~Roofline|可達上界同時受運算峰值與資料頻寬限制。~Attainable bounds combine compute peaks and bandwidth.|重算本課兩種強度的上界。~Recalculate bounds for both example intensities.|只看峰值 FLOPS 就知道 kernel 吞吐。~Peak FLOPS alone determine kernel throughput.
擴展瓶頸~Scaling bottlenecks|更多節點縮小區域性工作並放大通訊比例。~More nodes shrink local work and enlarge communication fractions.|比較合成強擴展表的計算與通訊。~Compare compute and communication in synthetic scaling tables.|兩倍節點永遠兩倍加速。~Twice the nodes always double speed.
檢查點 I/O~Checkpoint I/O|並行存檔需與頻寬和故障恢復協調。~Parallel checkpoints coordinate bandwidth and recovery.|用玩具狀態大小計算寫入下限。~Calculate lower write-time bounds for toy states.|所有 GPU 記憶體每步寫盤沒有成本。~Writing every GPU state each step is free.
科學驗收~Scientific acceptance|架構效能不能替代問題正確性與誤差驗證。~Architecture performance does not replace correctness and error checks.|以本地小題保留誤差、版本與假設。~Retain errors, versions and assumptions for a small local case.|在 Frontier 執行就保證科學模型正確。~Running on Frontier guarantees correct scientific models.
''',[(395,'兩套平臺都用 MI250X 與 HBM 分析~Both analyze MI250X and HBM','軟體、網路與資源政策不能直接套用~Software, networks and resource policies do not transfer unchanged'),(389,'共同分析 GPU/節點通訊與域分解~Both analyze device/node communication and decomposition','Frontier 另需考慮 GCD 與主機的異質路徑~Frontier additionally needs GCD and host heterogeneity')],'ornl','Frontier 的公開指南揭示異質節點和系統路徑；課程以原創資料流圖及假想 roofline 分解效能。~Frontier public guides describe heterogeneous paths; original flows and hypothetical rooflines decompose performance.')

add(393,'富岳 A64FX、SVE 與 Tofu D~Fugaku A64FX, SVE and Tofu D','系統與向量~System and vectors|記憶體與核心~Memory and cores|網路與程式~Networks and programs|數值與效能~Numerics and performance','fugaku a64fx mpi',
'512-bit SVE 向量可容納 8 個 FP64 元素；若一指令為向量 FMA，每元素算乘加2 FLOP，則每指令 16 FLOP。48 核、2 GHz 且假想每週期僅一條 FMA 給 1.536 TFLOP/s；不能當實際峰值，因為發射能力需另查。~A 512-bit SVE vector holds eight FP64 elements; one vector FMA counts 16 FLOPs under a two-operation convention. Forty-eight cores at 2 GHz with an assumed one FMA/cycle give 1.536 TFLOP/s, not an actual peak without issue-capability details.', '''
系統目標~System goals|富岳採用 CPU 向量架構，而非傳統外接 GPU 節點。~Fugaku uses CPU vector architecture rather than conventional external-GPU nodes.|比較玩具 CPU 向量與 GPU 分工圖。~Compare toy CPU-vector and GPU functional diagrams.|所有世界級超算都必須用 GPU。~Every world-class supercomputer requires GPUs.
A64FX 核心~A64FX cores|計算核心與輔助核心具有不同角色。~Compute and assistant cores have different roles.|依官方規格區分工作分配。~Separate workload roles using official specifications.|輔助核心數就是可用科學計算核心數。~Assistant-core count equals scientific compute-core count.
SVE 表示~SVE representations|可伸縮向量程式不應假定任意裝置同向量長度。~Scalable-vector code avoids universal fixed-length assumptions.|將玩具陣列分塊並處理尾部。~Chunk a toy array and handle its tail.|SVE 程式永遠只有固定八個元素。~Every SVE program always has eight elements.
FMA 計數~FMA accounting|FMA 峰值需說明精度、向量寬度與發射數。~FMA peaks state precision, width and issue count.|重算本課假想每週期一條 FMA。~Recalculate the example’s one-FMA-per-cycle assumption.|FMA 計數不需說明一 MAC 是否為兩 FLOP。~FMA counting needs no operation convention.
核心群組~Core-memory groups|CMG 把核心與近端記憶體分組形成局部性。~CMGs group cores and nearby memory for locality.|畫玩具四群組的陣列分塊。~Draw toy array partitions across four groups.|同節點所有記憶體路徑必然完全相同。~Every same-node memory path is identical.
HBM2 容量~HBM2 capacity|HBM2 提供高頻寬但工作集仍受容量限制。~HBM2 provides bandwidth but worksets remain capacity-limited.|計算玩具雙緩衝陣列與剩餘容量。~Calculate toy double-buffer arrays and remaining capacity.|HBM 高頻寬代表容量無限。~High HBM bandwidth means unlimited capacity.
訪存佈局~Memory layout|結構體與陣列佈局影響向量連續訪問。~Array/structure layouts affect contiguous vector access.|比較玩具 AoS 與 SoA 地址序列。~Compare toy AoS and SoA address sequences.|任何資料佈局都有相同向量效率。~Every layout has equal vector efficiency.
快取層次~Cache hierarchy|L1、共享 L2 與 HBM 對重用距離反應不同。~L1, shared L2 and HBM respond to reuse distance differently.|畫玩具重複讀取的層級路徑。~Draw cache paths for repeated toy reads.|只要用了 HBM 就不需要快取。~HBM eliminates the need for caches.
Tofu D~Tofu D|Tofu D 提供系統網路，拓撲需和程式通訊匹配。~Tofu D provides interconnect whose topology meets program communication.|畫鄰近通訊與全域性規約的玩具路徑。~Draw toy neighbor and global-reduction paths.|網路總頻寬足以預測所有規約時間。~Total bandwidth predicts every reduction time.
域對映~Domain mapping|域分解與節點拓撲對齊可改善區域性通訊。~Topology-aligned domains can improve local communication.|比較玩具規則對映與隨機對映。~Compare regular and random toy placement.|隨機對映永遠與拓撲對齊等價。~Random mapping equals topology-aligned mapping always.
向量化驗證~Vectorization checks|編譯器向量化需依賴、別名與對齊可判定。~Vectorization needs analyzable dependencies, aliasing and alignment.|分析一個自製迴圈的讀寫依賴。~Analyze read/write dependencies in a self-made loop.|開啟最佳化旗標就保證所有迴圈向量化。~Optimization flags guarantee every loop vectorized.
數值重排~Numerical reassociation|最佳化改變規約順序可能改變浮點末位。~Optimized reductions may change floating-point low bits.|比較玩具順序與樹狀求和誤差。~Compare sequential and tree sums on toy data.|向量化結果必然逐位元等於標量。~Vector results necessarily equal scalar results bitwise.
頻寬實測~Measured bandwidth|持續頻寬依工作模式而非只依規格。~Sustained bandwidth depends on workloads, not specifications alone.|為玩具 stream 與隨機訪問分別估計。~Estimate toy streaming and random accesses separately.|規格最大頻寬等於每個應用持續頻寬。~Rated bandwidth equals every application’s sustained bandwidth.
能效邊界~Energy boundaries|能耗比較需同任務、精度與量測邊界。~Energy comparisons align tasks, precision and measurement boundaries.|比較假想節點與全系統能量表。~Compare hypothetical node and full-system energies.|每瓦峰值即可代表所有應用能效。~Peak-per-watt represents every workload’s efficiency.
擴展與 I/O~Scaling and I/O|大規模執行還受資料讀寫和通訊限制。~Large runs also face data and communication limits.|以合成報告分開向量核心與 I/O。~Separate vector kernels and I/O in synthetic reports.|向量計算快就表示整份工作快。~Fast vector kernels guarantee a fast whole job.
架構比較~Architecture comparison|比較需匹配問題、精度、版本和資源用量。~Comparisons align problem, precision, versions and usage.|把本課玩具 kernel 移植為平臺中立分析。~Analyze the toy kernel in platform-neutral terms.|排名數字可取代應用級比較。~Ranking numbers replace application comparisons.
''',[(394,'皆分析 CPU、記憶體與系統通訊~Both analyze CPUs, memory and communication','富岳以 A64FX CPU 向量為主，Summit 有 V100 GPU~Fugaku centers on A64FX vectors; Summit includes V100 GPUs'),(389,'域分解與規約原理可移轉~Decomposition and reduction principles transfer','Tofu 拓撲與 SVE 效能需另量測~Tofu topology and SVE performance need new measurements')],'riken','富岳連線 A64FX 向量 CPU、HBM2 和 Tofu D；本課強調不同架構不能只按峰值比較。~Fugaku connects A64FX vector CPUs, HBM2 and Tofu D; different architectures cannot be compared by peaks alone.')

add(394,'Summit 的 POWER9、V100 與異質計算~Summit POWER9, V100 and heterogeneous computing','歷史與節點~History and nodes|資料與加速~Data and acceleration|通訊與軟體~Communication and software|驗證與比較~Validation and comparisons','summit summitoverview mpi',
'歷史 Summit 計算節點有 6 個 V100 GPU；假想每 GPU 一份 12 GiB 工作集，總為 72 GiB，但分散的裝置記憶體不能自動成為單一連續 72 GiB 陣列。若每輪主機裝置搬移 1 GB、50 GB/s 假想持續速率，單向下限 20 ms。~A historical Summit compute node has six V100 GPUs. Six assumed 12-GiB worksets total 72 GiB but do not automatically form one contiguous array. One assumed 1-GB transfer at sustained 50 GB/s has a 20-ms one-way lower bound.', '''
歷史架構~Historical architecture|Summit 是 POWER9 與 V100 結合的歷史系統案例。~Summit is a historical POWER9/V100 system case.|按官方公開結構畫原創節點圖。~Draw an original node diagram from public descriptions.|舊系統課程等於該系統今日仍接受所有工作。~A historical course implies current unrestricted access.
節點分工~Node roles|每個 Summit 計算節點的雙 POWER9 與六 V100 有不同職責；登入節點的配置不同。~Two POWER9 CPUs and six V100 GPUs have distinct roles in each Summit compute node; login-node configurations differ.|把玩具預處理與矩陣核心分到兩側。~Place toy preprocessing and matrix kernels by role.|六 GPU 自動意味著六倍任何應用速度。~Six GPUs automatically give sixfold speedup for every app.
NUMA 局部性~NUMA locality|CPU 插槽與 GPU 連線影響資料路徑。~CPU sockets and GPU connections affect data paths.|畫玩具兩插槽資源親和圖。~Draw a toy two-socket affinity diagram.|任何 CPU core 到 GPU 路徑完全相同。~All CPU-core-to-GPU paths are identical.
NVLink 角色~NVLink roles|節點內高速連線仍需依具體路徑分析。~Fast intra-node links still need path-specific analysis.|分開標示 GPU 對與主機連線。~Mark GPU pairs and host links separately.|NVLink 使所有資料移動無需時間。~NVLink makes every transfer instantaneous.
工作集容量~Workset capacity|多裝置容量之和不等於單裝置可見連續空間。~Summed device capacity is not one contiguous device space.|檢查本課六工作集是否可分塊。~Check whether six example worksets are partitionable.|多 GPU 記憶體必然可無縫當一個陣列。~Multiple GPU memories always form one seamless array.
資料搬移~Data transfers|搬移下限由容量與持續速率決定。~Transfer lower bounds depend on volume and sustained rate.|重算本課單向與往返時間下限。~Recalculate one-way and round-trip lower bounds.|標稱互連峰值就是持續傳輸速度。~Rated interconnect peak equals sustained transfer speed.
計算駐留~Compute residency|多個 kernel 駐留資料可減少往返。~Keeping data resident across kernels reduces round trips.|比較玩具五 kernel 駐留與逐次搬移。~Compare residency and per-kernel transfers for five toy kernels.|每個 kernel 必須把資料全部送回 CPU。~Every kernel must return all data to CPUs.
多 GPU 劃分~Multi-GPU partitions|任務劃分需考慮邊界與負載。~Partitioning accounts for boundaries and load.|把玩具矩陣按塊分給六裝置。~Partition a toy matrix across six devices.|平均分元素必然平均分執行成本。~Equal elements guarantee equal execution costs.
Tensor Core~Tensor cores|專用矩陣單元需匹配精度與形狀限制。~Specialized matrix units match precision and shape constraints.|在玩具矩陣列出數值誤差需求。~List accuracy needs for toy matrices.|Tensor 峰值等於任意 FP64 kernel 效能。~Tensor peaks equal arbitrary FP64-kernel performance.
混合精度~Mixed precision|低精度求解可與高精度殘差修正組合。~Low-precision solves can combine with high-precision residual correction.|分析玩具線性系統迭代改進條件。~Analyze refinement conditions for a toy linear system.|使用高精度殘差就保證所有矩陣收斂。~High-precision residuals guarantee every matrix converges.
GPU-aware 通訊~GPU-aware communication|可傳裝置緩衝與真正零複製需分開。~Device-buffer messaging differs from true zero-copy transfers.|在紙上訊息路徑標可能中轉。~Mark possible staging on paper message routes.|支援裝置指標表示無協議與同步開銷。~Device pointers imply no protocol or synchronization costs.
網路規模~Network scale|節點間網路與節點內連線具有不同瓶頸。~Inter-node and intra-node connections have different bottlenecks.|比較玩具單節點與兩節點資料交換。~Compare toy one-node and two-node exchange.|單節點加速可原封不動擴展到任意節點數。~Single-node speedups scale unchanged to any node count.
並行 I/O~Parallel I/O|資料寫出可能限制整份模擬週轉。~Data writes may bound full-simulation turnaround.|估算假想 checkpoint 寫入時間。~Estimate hypothetical checkpoint-write duration.|計算峰值高就保證存檔也快。~High compute peaks guarantee fast checkpoints.
版本維護~Version maintenance|歷史程式與今日軟體可能有相容差異。~Historical code and current software may differ in compatibility.|記錄玩具編譯器、庫與硬體假設。~Record toy compiler, library and hardware assumptions.|歷史 API 今日必然完全相同。~Historical APIs are always unchanged today.
效能比較~Performance comparisons|歷史峰值、實測與未來移植不得混為一談。~Historical peaks, measurements and future ports are distinct.|比較兩份合成報告的精度與任務邊界。~Compare precision and scope in two synthetic reports.|歷史系統峰值能直接預測新平臺速度。~Historical peaks directly predict new-platform speed.
科學複核~Scientific review|重現需留任務定義與誤差，而非只留平臺名。~Reproduction retains tasks and errors, not just platform names.|讓同學用本地小題重算科學約束。~Have a peer check scientific constraints on a small local task.|使用 Summit 字樣即證明原算例來自實測。~The name Summit proves example values measured there.
''',[(392,'共同使用異質節點與 GPU 局部性~Both use heterogeneous nodes and GPU locality','POWER9/V100 與 EPYC/MI250X 不能直接共用參數~POWER9/V100 and EPYC/MI250X cannot share parameters unchanged'),(393,'皆需明確 CPU 與記憶體路徑~Both specify CPU and memory paths','富岳以 CPU 向量化而非 V100 offload~Fugaku uses CPU vectorization rather than V100 offload')],'ornl','Summit 為異質科學計算提供可回顧的架構案例；課程不將歷史說明當作今日可申請資源保證。~Summit offers a historical heterogeneous-computing case; historical descriptions are not guarantees of current resource access.')

add(395,'LUMI 的 CPU/GPU 分割槽與高頻寬計算~LUMI CPU/GPU partitions and high-bandwidth computing','任務與分割槽~Tasks and partitions|節點與記憶體~Nodes and memory|通訊與環境~Communication and environments|效能與驗收~Performance and acceptance','lumig lumic mpi',
'假想 4096³ 個 FP64 格點單陣列為 549755813888 bytes，即 512 GiB；若每邏輯 GPU 假想能分配 50 GiB，至少需 ceil(512/50)=11 個裝置，只算單陣列。halo、第二緩衝與庫工作空間將提高需求，不能當實際 LUMI 配額。~A synthetic 4096-cubed FP64 array is 512 GiB. At assumed usable 50 GiB/logical GPU it needs at least 11 devices for one array only. Halos, extra buffers and library workspaces add capacity; this is not a LUMI quota.', '''
分割槽目的~Partition purposes|LUMI-C 與 LUMI-G 對應不同處理資源。~LUMI-C and LUMI-G serve different processing resources.|按玩具任務分出 CPU-only 與 GPU 部分。~Split toy tasks into CPU-only and GPU parts.|所有分割槽都必須用 GPU。~Every partition requires GPUs.
CPU 節點~CPU nodes|CPU 核心、NUMA 與記憶體適合獨立分析。~CPU cores, NUMA and memory need separate analysis.|畫玩具 CPU 節點的執行緒與資料。~Map threads and data on a toy CPU node.|CPU 部分只負責登入無科學用途。~CPUs only log in and have no scientific use.
GPU 節點~GPU nodes|MI250X 封裝與 GCD 數需區分。~MI250X packages and GCD counts are distinguished.|標示玩具封裝與邏輯 GPU 對應。~Mark toy package-to-logical-GPU mappings.|GPU 封裝數永遠等於邏輯裝置數。~GPU package and logical-device counts always agree.
記憶體層次~Memory hierarchy|主機記憶體與加速器 HBM 位置不同。~Host memory and accelerator HBM have different locations.|畫玩具陣列的分配與移轉。~Draw allocation and transfer of toy arrays.|所有記憶體都視為同一延遲空間。~All memory has one latency space.
容量規劃~Capacity planning|陣列、halo、緩衝與庫工作區需同時預算。~Arrays, halos, buffers and workspaces need joint budgets.|重算本課 512 GiB 與最少裝置數。~Recalculate the 512-GiB example and minimum devices.|剛好放下單一陣列就保證作業可執行。~Fitting one array guarantees the job runs.
陣列分塊~Array partitioning|分塊形狀決定邊界資料與局部性。~Partition shapes affect boundary data and locality.|比較玩具條狀與立方分塊。~Compare slab and cubic toy partitions.|任何同體積塊都有相同 halo 大小。~Equal-volume blocks have equal halos.
頻寬核算~Bandwidth accounting|訪問位元組應包含讀、寫及重複讀取。~Access bytes include reads, writes and repeated reads.|為玩具 stencil 列完整 bytes/FLOP。~List complete bytes per FLOP for a toy stencil.|只計算輸出 bytes 就是全部頻寬需求。~Output bytes equal all bandwidth requirements.
資料重用~Data reuse|快取與共享儲存可改變實際外部流量。~Caches and shared storage can change external traffic.|比較玩具 tile 前後重複讀取量。~Compare repeated reads before and after toy tiling.|每次程式讀取都必然訪問 HBM。~Every program read necessarily reaches HBM.
Slingshot 網路~Slingshot network|系統網路需與節點內路徑分層量測。~System networks and intra-node paths are measured separately.|畫玩具兩節點 GCD 通訊路線。~Draw GCD routes across two toy nodes.|系統網路延遲等於每次本地記憶體延遲。~Network latency equals local memory latency.
軟體環境~Software environments|編譯器、ROCm 與數值庫版本影響行為。~Compiler, ROCm and numerical-library versions affect behavior.|記錄玩具模型完整軟體清單。~Record complete software for a toy model.|同硬體保證所有軟體版本結果一樣。~Equal hardware guarantees equal results across software.
繫結親和~Binding affinity|CPU core 與 GCD 親和影響啟動與傳輸。~Core/GCD affinity affects launch and transfer.|畫玩具 rank 到資源的對映。~Map toy ranks to resources.|系統會無條件自動選最佳繫結。~Systems automatically choose optimal binding unconditionally.
集體通訊~Collective communication|規約成本依拓撲、訊息大小與參加數。~Reduction costs depend on topology, sizes and participants.|比較玩具小訊息與大訊息規約。~Compare small- and large-message toy reductions.|每種訊息都有相同最佳規約演算法。~Every message shares the best reduction algorithm.
能效邊界~Energy scope|能效需明確節點、機房與冷卻邊界。~Energy efficiency specifies node, facility and cooling boundaries.|比較假想晶片能量與整機能量。~Compare hypothetical chip and full-system energy.|只看 GPU 功率就得到全部系統能耗。~GPU power gives complete system energy.
利用率判斷~Utilization judgments|GPU 忙碌時間不等於科學計算效率。~GPU busy time is not scientific efficiency.|對玩具忙等待與有效計算分別計量。~Account separately for toy busy-waiting and useful compute.|GPU utilization=100% 就必然最優。~One hundred percent GPU utilization is necessarily optimal.
移植驗收~Port acceptance|移植需重新檢查數值、容量與通訊。~Ports recheck numerics, capacity and communication.|在本地小題比較兩種資料佈局誤差。~Compare errors from two layouts on a local toy problem.|同為 MI250X 系統即可原樣遷移所有配置。~All MI250X systems reuse every setting unchanged.
科學交付~Scientific delivery|平臺名不取代版本、輸入與可重算結果。~Platform names do not replace versions, inputs and reproducible results.|建立不需真實賬號的離線報告。~Create an offline report requiring no real account.|完成課程表示已操作真實 LUMI。~Completing this course means operating real LUMI.
''',[(392,'共同分析 MI250X 的封裝與 GCD~Both analyze MI250X packages and GCDs','兩平臺的環境與政策需分別驗證~Environments and policies require separate validation'),(388,'資源分割槽與計量原則相通~Partition and accounting principles transfer','具體節點與網路不能由排程模型推定~Scheduling models cannot infer concrete nodes and networks')],'lumi','LUMI 的公開檔案分別說明 CPU 與 GPU 分割槽；本課以分塊資料和容量模型強調移植需要重新驗證。~LUMI documentation separates CPU and GPU partitions; partitioned-data and capacity models emphasize revalidation after porting.')

add(396,'Aurora 的 Xeon Max、Ponte Vecchio 與資料路徑~Aurora Xeon Max, Ponte Vecchio and data paths','系統與節點~Systems and nodes|向量與矩陣~Vectors and matrices|記憶體與互聯~Memory and links|軟體與驗證~Software and validation','aurora auroraoverview mpi',
'公開架構有每節點 6 GPU；假想 1024³ FP64 陣列為 8 GiB，若每 GPU 存同樣輸入加兩個輸出共 24 GiB，則六份複製需 144 GiB，分佈分塊未必需六份輸入。例子是容量模型，非 Aurora 實際應用。~Public architecture has six GPUs per node. A synthetic 1024-cubed FP64 array is 8 GiB; input plus two output arrays uses 24 GiB/GPU, or 144 GiB for six replicas. Partitioning may avoid replicated inputs; this is a capacity model, not an Aurora application.', '''
異質節點~Heterogeneous nodes|Aurora 計算節點結合兩 Xeon Max 與六 GPU Max。~Aurora combines two Xeon Max CPUs with six GPU Max devices per compute node.|重畫自己的 CPU/GPU 功能框架。~Draw original CPU/GPU functional blocks.|Aurora 是隻有 GPU 無 CPU 的系統。~Aurora contains GPUs without CPUs.
CPU HBM~CPU HBM|CPU 的 HBM 與 DDR 可呈不同使用模式。~CPU HBM and DDR can have distinct usage modes.|在玩具分配圖區分高速與大容量區域。~Separate fast and large-capacity regions on toy maps.|CPU HBM 與 DDR 必然有相同延遲與頻寬。~CPU HBM and DDR have equal latency and bandwidth.
GPU 層次~GPU hierarchy|Ponte Vecchio 的 tile、slice 與 Xe core 有層次。~Ponte Vecchio tiles, slices and Xe cores form a hierarchy.|按公開功能層次畫原創示意。~Draw an original functional hierarchy from public descriptions.|所有 GPU 單元都只叫一個不可分割核心。~All GPU units form one indivisible core.
向量與矩陣~Vectors and matrices|向量引擎與矩陣引擎適用不同運算。~Vector and matrix engines suit different computations.|分類玩具 stencil 與 dense GEMM。~Classify toy stencils and dense GEMM.|矩陣峰值就是任何向量運算吞吐。~Matrix peaks equal all vector throughput.
工作組資源~Workgroup resources|暫存器與 shared local memory 約束併發。~Registers and shared local memory constrain concurrency.|比較玩具 workgroup 的資源預算。~Compare resource budgets for toy workgroups.|workgroup 越大必然越快。~Larger workgroups are always faster.
精度需求~Precision needs|科學殘差與低精度矩陣單元需獨立驗證。~Scientific residuals and low-precision matrix units need separate validation.|對玩具矩陣記錄容許殘差。~Record allowed residuals for toy matrices.|低精度結果在所有科學問題都夠用。~Low precision suffices for every scientific problem.
GPU HBM~GPU HBM|多 GPU 記憶體需按實際所有權與複製預算。~Multi-GPU memory is budgeted by ownership and replication.|重算本課複製與分塊容量。~Recalculate replicated and partitioned capacity.|六 GPU 的記憶體自動是一個統一陣列。~Six GPU memories automatically form one unified array.
Xe Link~Xe Link|裝置間互聯與 PCIe 路徑有不同成本。~Device links and PCIe paths have different costs.|畫玩具 GPU 對與主機路由。~Draw toy GPU-pair and host routes.|所有互聯路徑都永遠零複製零延遲。~Every interconnect route has zero copying and latency.
Slingshot NIC~Slingshot NICs|節點內裝置到 NIC 路徑影響跨節點通訊。~Device-to-NIC paths affect inter-node messaging.|分層畫兩節點的玩具傳送。~Draw toy transfers across two nodes in layers.|只知道 NIC 數量就知道實際 MPI 速度。~NIC counts determine actual MPI speed.
資料駐留~Data residency|保持資料在裝置避免反覆主機搬移。~Keeping data on devices avoids repeated host transfers.|比較玩具多步 PDE 每步與一次傳送。~Compare per-step and one-time transfers for toy PDEs.|所有陣列每輪必須自動送回主機。~Every array must return to the host each round.
oneAPI 與 SYCL~oneAPI and SYCL|抽象程式仍需正確裝置選擇與同步。~Abstract programming still needs device selection and synchronization.|在紙上標示 toy queue 與 buffer 生命週期。~Mark toy queues and buffer lifetimes on paper.|跨平臺 API 保證無需檢查任何裝置差異。~Portable APIs eliminate all device checks.
非同步依賴~Asynchronous dependencies|提交任務需顯式或可推斷資料依賴。~Submitted tasks need explicit or inferable data dependencies.|畫玩具讀取、計算與寫出 DAG。~Draw a toy read-compute-write DAG.|按程式碼書寫順序就保證任何佇列正確依賴。~Code order guarantees dependencies on every queue.
規約數值~Reduction numerics|並行順序改變浮點舍入與確定性。~Parallel order changes rounding and determinism.|比較玩具不同樹形規約誤差。~Compare errors across toy reduction trees.|更多 GPU 保證逐位元相同結果。~More GPUs guarantee bitwise-identical results.
並行儲存~Parallel storage|物件儲存與檔案 I/O 有不同訪問介面。~Object storage and file I/O expose different interfaces.|給玩具產物選擇鍵值或檔案表示。~Choose key/value or file representations for toy artifacts.|任何物件儲存介面與本地檔案完全相同。~Object-store interfaces equal local files completely.
效能分解~Performance decomposition|編譯、搬移、kernel 與 I/O 需分別計時。~Compilation, transfers, kernels and I/O are timed separately.|以假想表找端到端真正瓶頸。~Find end-to-end bottlenecks from fictional timings.|只報矩陣核心時間即可描述全部工作。~Matrix-kernel time describes the entire job.
系統驗收~System acceptance|公開規格與自製例必須明確分界。~Public specifications and self-made examples are distinguished.|輸出可重算假設與缺測清單。~Report reproducible assumptions and unmeasured items.|課程裡的假想數字是官方實測。~Hypothetical course numbers are official measurements.
''',[(392,'皆有 CPU/GPU 與系統網路的層次~Both have CPU/GPU and system-network hierarchies','Intel GPU 與 AMD GCD 架構和軟體不同~Intel GPU and AMD GCD hardware/software differ'),(395,'共同檢驗異質容量與跨節點傳送~Both check heterogeneous capacity and transfers','Xe Link 與 LUMI 的裝置路徑須分別建模~Xe Link and LUMI device paths need separate models')],'argonne','Aurora 公開指南拆分 CPU、GPU 與連線層次；課程將規格和假想陣列計算分別標示。~Aurora public guides separate CPUs, GPUs and links; specifications and hypothetical array calculations are labeled separately.')
source('eevdf','EEVDF 排程設計','EEVDF scheduler design','Linux kernel maintainers','https://docs.kernel.org/scheduler/sched-eevdf.html')
source('http10','HTTP/1.0 歷史協議 RFC 1945','Historical HTTP/1.0 RFC 1945','RFC Editor','https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc1945')

add(397,'封包交換、分層協議與歷史遷移~Packet switching, layered protocols and historical transitions','歷史與需求~History and needs|封包與路徑~Packets and paths|協議與遷移~Protocols and transitions|模擬與驗證~Simulation and validation','internet transition',
'玩具 50 kbit/s 鏈路傳送 1000 bytes，序列化時間 8000/50000=0.16 s。若儲存轉發經三條同速鏈路、不重疊且每段傳播20 ms，單包總下限=3×(160+20)=540 ms；未含排隊，不代表 ARPANET 的實測時延。~A toy 50-kbit/s link serializes 1,000 bytes in 160 ms. Three same-speed store-and-forward links with 20-ms propagation each and no overlap give 540 ms for one packet before queuing; not an ARPANET measurement.', '''
歷史證據~Historical evidence|歷史回顧與當年協議檔案提供不同證據層次。~Retrospectives and contemporary protocols provide different evidence.|把公開事件按出處與日期分列。~Separate public events by source and date.|今日協議可原樣代表所有早期網路。~Current protocols represent all early networks unchanged.
交換目標~Switching goals|封包共享鏈路與電路保留資源具有不同取捨。~Packet sharing and reserved circuits have different trade-offs.|比較玩具突發使用者的資源時間表。~Compare resource schedules for toy bursty users.|封包交換表示每個使用者都有永久獨佔鏈路。~Packet switching gives permanent dedicated links.
主機與 IMP~Hosts and IMPs|早期主機與交換節點分擔不同功能。~Early hosts and switching nodes handled distinct functions.|重畫原創歷史角色圖而不復制原圖。~Draw original historical role diagrams.|IMP 就是網頁瀏覽器。~An IMP is a web browser.
層次介面~Layer interfaces|物理、交換與端系統協議職責應分開。~Physical, switching and endpoint protocols are distinct.|給玩具訊息沿層次標示輸入輸出。~Mark toy-message inputs and outputs across layers.|所有協議都只處理同一個層次。~Every protocol handles one identical layer.
分包重組~Segmentation and reassembly|大訊息分包後需可辨順序與完整性。~Segmented messages need ordering and completeness.|把自製短字串分三包再重排重組。~Split and reorder a self-made string into three packets.|封包到達順序永遠等於傳送順序。~Arrival order always equals send order.
儲存轉發~Store-and-forward|接收完整封包再轉發會增加序列化延遲。~Whole-packet forwarding adds serialization delays.|重算本課三段單包下限。~Recalculate the three-link one-packet lower bound.|多段鏈路只需支付一次序列化時間。~Multihop links pay serialization only once.
佇列與擁塞~Queues and congestion|暫時輸入率高於服務率會累積佇列。~Arrival rates above service rates build queues.|以玩具離散時間表追蹤緩衝量。~Track buffers with a toy discrete schedule.|共享鏈路永遠不發生排隊。~Shared links never queue.
路由與故障~Routing and failure|路徑選擇需處理斷路與資料陳舊。~Route selection handles failed links and stale state.|在紙上小圖刪除一邊尋找替代路。~Remove a link in a paper graph and find alternatives.|存在替代路徑就保證立即恢復且零丟包。~An alternate path guarantees immediate loss-free recovery.
確認與重送~Acknowledgment and retry|超時與確認判斷丟失但可能產生重複。~Timeouts and acknowledgments infer loss but can duplicate packets.|模擬自製訊息確認遺失的情境。~Simulate a lost acknowledgment for self-made messages.|重送只會產生一次有效訊息。~Retries always produce exactly one effective message.
NCP 語境~NCP context|早期 NCP 與後來的 TCP/IP 層次不同。~Early NCP and later TCP/IP had different layering.|比較公開遷移計劃的功能角色。~Compare roles in the public transition plan.|NCP 與 TCP 僅名字不同。~NCP and TCP differ only by name.
端到端職責~End-to-end roles|跨網可靠性不能完全由單一鏈路保證。~Internetwork reliability is not guaranteed by one link.|在玩具兩網圖分開鏈路與端點檢查。~Separate link and endpoint checks across two toy networks.|每條鏈路可靠就不需任何端點驗證。~Reliable links eliminate endpoint verification.
IP 跨網~IP internetworking|統一網際層可跨不同底層網路。~A common internetwork layer spans different underlying networks.|畫兩種玩具鏈路封裝同一訊息。~Encapsulate one message across two toy links.|所有底層網路都必須相同速率與幀格式。~All lower networks need equal rates and frame formats.
協議遷移~Protocol migration|遷移需列相容、切換日期與回退問題。~Transitions specify compatibility, dates and fallback issues.|只在紙上製作玩具 NCP/TCP 遷移矩陣。~Create a toy NCP/TCP transition matrix on paper.|指定切換日期就自動解決所有相容問題。~A cutover date resolves every compatibility issue.
歷史安全~Historical security|早期信任假設不能沿用為今日公開部署策略。~Early trust assumptions cannot be reused as modern public security.|標記歷史案例中今日需新增的認證。~Mark authentication additions needed today.|歷史網路成功表示今日可不做認證。~Historical success means modern authentication is unnecessary.
尺度量測~Scale measurements|鏈路速率與傳播、排隊需要分別計量。~Rate, propagation and queuing are measured separately.|比較玩具高頻寬長距離與低頻寬近距離。~Compare high-bandwidth distant and low-bandwidth local links.|頻寬高就必然單包延遲最低。~Higher bandwidth always minimizes packet latency.
歷史報告~Historical report|原創模擬必須標示並非當年實測資料。~Original simulations are labeled as nonhistorical measurements.|對玩具拓撲附來源與未知參數清單。~Attach sources and unknown parameters to toy topology.|教學影像細緻就證明復原真實歷史裝置。~Detailed teaching graphics prove authentic equipment reconstruction.
''',[(398,'網際網路連通支撐後來的 Web~Internet connectivity supports later Web systems','ARPANET/網路與 Web/應用不是同一層~ARPANET/network and Web/application are different layers'),(400,'共同利用分散網路與協議互通~Both use distributed networks and protocol interoperability','DNS 根系統處理名稱委派而非資料路由~DNS roots delegate names rather than route data')],'ucla','網際網路先驅回顧與 RFC 801 提供演進與遷移證據；課程區分 ARPANET、Internet 和 Web。~Internet-pioneer accounts and RFC 801 document evolution and transition; the course distinguishes ARPANET, Internet and Web.')

add(398,'超文字、HTTP 與早期科學資訊共享~Hypertext, HTTP and early scientific information sharing','歷史與檔案~History and documents|連結與傳輸~Links and transfer|伺服器與狀態~Servers and state|驗證與發展~Validation and evolution','webhistory firstweb http10',
'假想 20 kB HTML 加 3 張各40 kB 圖片總為 140 kB；在持續 100 kB/s 下資料傳輸下限1.4 s。若序列每物件另有0.1 s 等待，四物件總至少1.8 s，未含解析、DNS與重送；不代表首個 Web 伺服器。~A synthetic 20-kB HTML file plus three 40-kB images totals 140 kB. Sustained 100 kB/s gives 1.4-s transfer minimum; four sequential 0.1-s waits make 1.8 s before parsing, DNS and retries, not the first Web server’s performance.', '''
歷史角色~Historical roles|CERN 的 Web 起源包含資訊共享需求與實現。~CERN Web origins combine information-sharing needs and implementations.|整理公開1989提案與1990實現的層次。~Separate public 1989 proposal and 1990 implementation contexts.|Web 與 Internet 都在同一天以同一用途誕生。~Web and Internet arose on one day for one purpose.
超文字關係~Hypertext relationships|連結把檔案關係變為可導航地址。~Links make document relationships navigable addresses.|在自製三頁檔案畫有向連結圖。~Draw links among three self-made pages.|連結一定表示來源支援目標所有內容。~A link endorses all destination content.
瀏覽與服務~Browsing and serving|瀏覽器取得呈現內容，服務端響應請求。~Browsers retrieve/render content; servers answer requests.|畫玩具本地頁與伺服器角色。~Draw local-page and server roles.|HTML 檔案本身就是資料庫伺服器。~An HTML file is a database server.
歷史與今日~Historical and current|早期設計不能直接當現代生產配置。~Early designs are not modern production configurations.|標出歷史功能與今日認證加密的差異。~Mark historical features versus modern authentication/encryption.|歷史系統沒有 TLS 說明今日也不需 TLS。~Historical lack of TLS removes modern TLS needs.
地址與資源~Addresses and resources|資源地址、路徑與檔案儲存位置可不同。~Resource URLs, paths and stored files can differ.|對自製頁面比較地址與本地路徑。~Compare URLs and local paths for self-made pages.|URL 必然直接對應同名磁碟檔案。~URLs necessarily map to same-named disk files.
HTTP 請求~HTTP requests|方法、目標與首部共同表述請求。~Methods, targets and headers define requests.|在紙上檢查玩具請求格式。~Inspect toy request formats on paper.|只要送任意文字就等於合法 HTTP。~Any text is valid HTTP.
狀態與內容~Status and content|響應狀態與內容語意需分別檢查。~Response status and content semantics are checked separately.|比較自製成功頁與缺檔頁。~Compare self-made success and missing-resource pages.|HTTP 200 保證頁面事實正確。~HTTP 200 guarantees factual page content.
MIME 表示~MIME representations|內容型別指導解析而非決定事實與授權。~Content types guide parsing, not truth or rights.|為自製 HTML 與圖片列 MIME。~Specify MIME types for self-made HTML and images.|圖片 MIME 標籤就代表可合法複製。~An image MIME grants legal reproduction.
檔案解析~Document parsing|結構、編碼與錯誤處理影響呈現。~Structure, encoding and error handling affect rendering.|比較自製正確與缺標籤頁面。~Compare correct and malformed self-made pages.|瀏覽器顯示出來就說明檔案結構完全正確。~Visible rendering proves fully correct structure.
相對連結~Relative links|相對地址依當前基準解析。~Relative URLs resolve against a base address.|在自製子目錄測試同一相對路徑。~Test one relative path in self-made subdirectories.|相對連結在所有目錄指向同一目標。~Relative links point to one target in every directory.
靜態與動態~Static and dynamic|靜態檔案與動態服務具有不同狀態與許可權能力。~Static files and dynamic services differ in state and permissions.|比較玩具直接 HTML 與認證服務邊界。~Compare direct HTML and authenticated-service boundaries.|隱藏靜態按鈕就保護已公開課程資料。~Hiding static buttons protects published course data.
快取新鮮~Cache freshness|快取減少傳輸但可能呈現舊版本。~Caching cuts transfers but can display old revisions.|對兩版自製檔案模擬快取鍵。~Simulate cache keys for two self-made revisions.|快取命中表示內容永遠最新。~Cache hits always mean current content.
多物件成本~Multiple-object costs|頁面時間含多個物件與請求等待。~Page time includes multiple objects and request waits.|重算本課四物件理想下限。~Recalculate the four-object example lower bound.|HTML 大小就是整頁下載量。~HTML size equals complete page traffic.
可及性結構~Accessible structure|語意標題、文字替代與鍵盤路徑幫助多種使用者。~Semantic headings, alternatives and keys support diverse users.|讓同學不用滑鼠瀏覽自製三頁。~Have a peer browse three self-made pages without a mouse.|畫面漂亮便保證所有人能操作。~Attractive screens guarantee access for everyone.
來源與授權~Sources and rights|引用歷史連結不授予複製原圖全文。~Historical links do not grant figure or full-text reuse.|使用自製頁面並列官方延伸連結。~Use self-made pages with official extension links.|可公開瀏覽的歷史頁面可無限重製。~Public historical pages allow unlimited reproduction.
演進報告~Evolution reports|報告需分開原始設計、後來標準與自製示範。~Reports distinguish origins, later standards and self-made demos.|標註 HTTP/1.0 標準不等於1990所有實現。~Mark that HTTP/1.0 is not every 1990 implementation.|較晚 RFC 可證明所有早期伺服器細節。~Later RFCs prove every early-server detail.
''',[(397,'Web 建立在已存在的網際連通上~Web builds on existing Internet connectivity','超文字與 HTTP 是應用層概念~Hypertext and HTTP are application-layer concepts'),(400,'名稱解析幫助瀏覽器找到服務~Name resolution helps browsers locate services','DNS 根服務不儲存網頁內容~DNS roots do not store webpages')],'cern','CERN 公開歷史和初期專案頁讓超文字設計可追溯；HTTP/1.0 作後續標準比較，不冒充首版實現。~CERN history and early project pages trace hypertext design; HTTP/1.0 is a later comparison, not a claim about the first implementation.')

add(399,'核心協作、併發機制與版本驗證~Kernel collaboration, concurrency and version validation','需求與貢獻~Requirements and contribution|介面與併發~Interfaces and concurrency|測試與評審~Testing and review|版本與維護~Versions and maintenance','kernel cfs eevdf',
'假想兩任務權重 1024 與 2048，總預算30 ms，按權重理想分配10 ms和20 ms。玩具公平模型 Δvruntime=Δexec×1024/weight：兩者增量皆10 ms。此說明歷史 CFS 思路，不代表現代 EEVDF 每次實際時片。~Toy weights 1,024 and 2,048 share 30 ms as 10 and 20 ms. A fair-runtime model delta-vruntime=delta-exec×1,024/weight gives both 10 ms. This illustrates historical CFS, not actual modern EEVDF slices.', '''
貢獻邊界~Contribution boundaries|核心貢獻需說明問題、範圍與維護責任。~Kernel contributions state problem, scope and responsibility.|為自製玩具程式寫明確變更目的。~Write a scoped change rationale for a self-made toy program.|任何能編譯的變更都應立即合併。~Every compiling change should be merged immediately.
歷史與版本~History and versions|Linux 長期演進，架構描述需帶版本。~Linux evolves; architecture descriptions need versions.|區分 CFS 歷史與 EEVDF 文件範圍。~Distinguish historical CFS and EEVDF scope.|所有今日 Linux 都原樣使用最初 CFS。~Every current Linux uses original CFS unchanged.
使用者核心介面~User/kernel interfaces|系統呼叫與核心內部介面穩定承諾不同。~System calls and internal kernel interfaces differ in stability.|畫玩具使用者程式與核心函式邊界。~Draw a toy userspace/kernel-function boundary.|所有核心內部函式都是永久使用者 API。~Every internal kernel function is a permanent user API.
架構差異~Architecture differences|位元組序、對齊與原子語意依平臺而異。~Endianness, alignment and atomic behavior vary by platform.|用玩具 byte 陣列比較兩種解讀。~Interpret one toy byte array in two ways.|一平臺可用就保證所有架構正確。~Working on one platform guarantees every architecture.
任務狀態~Task states|執行、可執行與等待是不同狀態。~Running, runnable and waiting are distinct states.|畫兩個玩具任務的狀態轉移。~Draw state transitions for two toy tasks.|可執行意味著正在 CPU 上執行。~Runnable means currently executing on a CPU.
公平權重~Fair weights|權重表示相對份額而非固定速度。~Weights define relative shares, not fixed speeds.|重算本課兩任務份額與虛擬時間。~Recalculate example shares and virtual runtimes.|權重翻倍保證任何任務完成時間減半。~Double weight guarantees half completion time.
EEVDF 語意~EEVDF semantics|資格與虛擬截止時間補充公平排程判斷。~Eligibility and virtual deadlines refine fair scheduling.|按官方概念繪製玩具候選選擇。~Draw toy candidate selection from official concepts.|EEVDF 就只按最早真實時鐘 deadline 排序。~EEVDF only sorts real-clock deadlines.
鎖與死鎖~Locks and deadlock|互斥順序不一致可能形成等待環。~Inconsistent lock ordering can create wait cycles.|在本地玩具執行緒畫兩鎖等待圖。~Draw a two-lock wait graph for local toy threads.|多加鎖就無條件提高併發安全與速度。~More locks always improve safety and speed.
原子與可見~Atomicity and visibility|原子操作不自動給予所有順序保證。~Atomic operations do not automatically ensure every ordering.|對玩具共享變數區分原子性與記憶體序。~Separate atomicity and ordering for toy shared variables.|使用 atomic 就不用考慮記憶體順序。~Atomics eliminate memory-order concerns.
資源生命~Resource lifetimes|引用、釋放與併發訪問需相容。~References, release and concurrent access must agree.|畫玩具物件最後引用與回收。~Draw last references and reclamation for a toy object.|物件不再顯示就一定無人正在讀取。~An undisplayed object has no active readers.
最小變更~Minimal changes|獨立小變更利於評審與迴歸定位。~Small independent changes improve review and regression attribution.|將玩具多功能改動分成兩項可驗收變更。~Split toy multifunction changes into two reviewable units.|把全部改動揉在一起永遠更容易評審。~Combining every change always eases review.
復現例項~Reproduction cases|錯誤報告需輸入、版本與可觀察結果。~Bug reports need inputs, versions and observable outcomes.|以自製小程式寫可重現故障。~Write a reproducible failure for a self-made small program.|只有錯誤截圖就足夠所有人重現。~An error screenshot suffices for everyone to reproduce.
測試層次~Test layers|單元、整合與跨架構驗證覆蓋不同風險。~Unit, integration and cross-architecture checks cover different risks.|對玩具變更列需要的具體驗證。~Specify concrete checks for a toy change.|一項測試透過就排除所有核心風險。~One passing test excludes every kernel risk.
評審證據~Review evidence|效能與正確性宣告需對應基準與限制。~Performance and correctness claims map to benchmarks and limits.|審查自製報告是否控制輸入與版本。~Review input/version controls in a self-made report.|作者說變快就可不提供任何量測。~Author claims of speed require no measurements.
版本回歸~Version regression|定位需比較已知正常與失敗的版本條件。~Diagnosis compares known-good and failed version conditions.|在玩具三版程式定位首次行為變化。~Locate the first change across three toy revisions.|最後修改的檔案永遠就是故障原因。~The last-edited file is always the failure cause.
維護交付~Maintenance delivery|長期維護需資料、介面與複核責任。~Maintenance retains evidence, interfaces and review ownership.|釋出僅供本地 toy program 的審查包。~Package review evidence for a local toy program only.|課程完成即等於獲授權修改生產核心。~Course completion authorizes production-kernel changes.
''',[(368,'版本、風險與迴歸測試原則共用~Version, risk and regression principles transfer','核心貢獻還需跨架構與併發審查~Kernel contributions add cross-architecture and concurrency review'),(388,'任務與資源狀態影響系統執行~Task and resource states affect execution','核心排程處理 CPU 時間，HPC 排程處理工作分配~Kernel scheduling handles CPU time; HPC scheduling allocates jobs')],'linux','Linux 公開開發流程與排程文件呈現持續協作；CFS 與 EEVDF 分開說明，避免把歷史演算法寫成今日唯一實現。~Linux development and scheduler documents show ongoing collaboration; CFS and EEVDF are separated rather than presenting one historical algorithm as universal today.')

add(400,'DNS 委派、任播與根服務韌性~DNS delegation, anycast and root-service resilience','名稱與層次~Names and hierarchy|委派與驗證~Delegation and validation|分散與快取~Distribution and caching|量測與治理~Measurement and governance','root dns rootreq',
'玩具 DNS 正向快取 TTL=300 s；每10秒一請求且無提前淘汰，300 s 內30個請求理想需1次上游查詢，命中29/30≈96.67%。TTL 不保證資料實時，重啟、負快取與不同解析器會改變此例。~With toy TTL 300 s and one request every 10 s without early eviction, 30 requests ideally need one upstream query and yield 29/30≈96.67% hits. TTL is not real-time freshness; restarts, negative caching and resolver differences alter the result.', '''
名稱層次~Name hierarchy|DNS 名稱由標籤與委派層次構成。~DNS names consist of labels and delegation hierarchy.|拆解自製 example.invalid 的邏輯層次。~Break down the hierarchy of self-made example.invalid.|網域名稱就是伺服器 IP 本身。~A domain name is its server IP.
根角色~Root roles|根服務主要提供頂級域委派而非所有網站答案。~Root service chiefly provides TLD delegations, not every site’s final answer.|畫玩具根、TLD 與權威三層查詢。~Draw toy root, TLD and authoritative queries.|根伺服器儲存全球所有網頁內容。~Root servers store every webpage.
解析器角色~Resolver roles|遞迴解析器替客戶端追蹤委派與快取。~Recursive resolvers follow delegations and cache for clients.|分開畫客戶端、遞迴與權威角色。~Draw client, recursive and authoritative roles.|瀏覽器每次都直接問遍所有根伺服器。~Browsers ask every root directly on each request.
根身份數量~Root identity counts|A–M 是13個邏輯身份，不是13臺實體機器。~A–M denotes 13 logical identities, not 13 physical machines.|依 IANA 清單區分身份與營運者。~Separate identities and operators using IANA lists.|13個根身份代表全球只有13臺根機器。~Thirteen identities mean only thirteen machines worldwide.
委派資料~Delegation data|NS 與必要 glue 幫助解析器找到下一層。~NS and necessary glue help resolvers locate the next layer.|以玩具區檔畫委派與 glue 的角色。~Draw delegation and glue roles in a toy zone.|委派響應就是每個應用最終內容。~Delegation responses contain final application content.
權威邊界~Authority boundaries|權威區與遞迴快取有不同資料責任。~Authoritative zones and recursive caches have different duties.|比較玩具權威更改與快取到期。~Compare toy authoritative changes and cache expiry.|快取資料永遠等於權威最新資料。~Cached data always equals current authoritative data.
DNSSEC 信任~DNSSEC trust|簽章認證來源與完整性，不加密查詢名稱。~Signatures authenticate provenance/integrity, not query secrecy.|畫玩具信任鏈而不設定真實區檔。~Draw a toy trust chain without configuring real zones.|DNSSEC 會讓所有查詢名稱不可見。~DNSSEC hides every queried name.
負回答語意~Negative answers|不存在與暫時失敗需不同判斷和快取。~Nonexistence and temporary failure differ in interpretation/caching.|分類自製響應示例與恢復情境。~Classify self-made responses and recovery scenarios.|任何查詢失敗都表示網域永久不存在。~Every failed query means permanent nonexistence.
任播路徑~Anycast paths|同一地址可由多處服務，由路由選路徑。~One address may be served in many locations selected by routing.|在紙上多城市圖模擬路徑變化。~Simulate route changes on a paper city map.|anycast 表示每次請求同時送到所有節點。~Anycast sends each request to every node.
故障域~Failure domains|營運者、地點、路由與軟體形成不同故障域。~Operators, sites, routes and software create different failure domains.|對假想部署標共同供應與路徑。~Mark shared suppliers and paths in a fictional deployment.|不同城市就完全沒有共同故障域。~Different cities guarantee no shared failure domain.
TTL 快取~TTL caches|有效期降低上游流量但允許暫時舊資料。~Expiry reduces upstream traffic while permitting temporary stale data.|重算本課快取命中率與限制。~Recalculate example hits and limits.|TTL 內所有資料都實時更新。~All data updates in real time within TTL.
查詢最小化~Query minimization|分層查詢可減少每層收到的完整名稱資訊。~Layered queries can reduce full-name disclosure at each layer.|畫玩具逐層所需標籤範圍。~Draw required labels at each toy layer.|根解析必需收到每個應用完整 URL。~Root resolution requires every full application URL.
速率與延遲~Rates and latency|快取命中與未命中有不同延遲路徑。~Cache hits and misses have different latency paths.|比較玩具冷快取與熱快取時間表。~Compare toy cold- and warm-cache timings.|DNS 單次延遲可代表所有網頁傳輸效能。~One DNS delay represents all web-transfer performance.
根區治理~Root-zone governance|資料變更治理與根營運是不同職責。~Data-change governance and root operations are separate duties.|按公開檔案區分假想請求與釋出角色。~Separate hypothetical request and publication roles from public docs.|任何根營運者可獨自改全球所有委派。~Any root operator can independently change every delegation.
觀測限制~Observation limits|本地測到路徑不能推論所有使用者路徑。~One local path measurement cannot infer all users' paths.|只分析自製軌跡，不掃描真實根設施。~Analyze self-made traces without scanning real root infrastructure.|一個地區的低延遲證明全球同樣低延遲。~One region’s low latency proves low latency worldwide.
韌性驗收~Resilience acceptance|驗收要區分名稱正確、服務可用與隱私。~Acceptance separates correct names, availability and privacy.|用玩具故障圖與快取表完成離線報告。~Complete an offline report from toy failures and caches.|網頁能開一次就證明 DNS 永遠可靠。~One successful page proves permanently reliable DNS.
''',[(398,'瀏覽服務需名稱解析定位~Browsing uses names to locate services','DNS 不處理 HTTP 內容與個人會員資料~DNS does not manage HTTP content or member profiles'),(397,'共享分散網路與協議相容原理~Distributed-network and compatibility principles transfer','根系統以委派與任播為核心~Root services center on delegation and anycast')],'icann','IANA 根清單與 RFC 明確區分邏輯身份、委派與服務要求；課題不提供真實設施掃描或修改。~IANA lists and RFCs distinguish identities, delegations and service requirements; exercises do not scan or modify real infrastructure.')

